('TV Show', 'Waco: Madman or Messiah', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2018, 'TV-14', '1 Season', 'Documentary, Special Interest', 'The raid of Mount Carmel develops into a 51-day stand-off between the Branch Davidians and the FBI. A direct line of communication is established between FBI negotiators and David Koresh on the inside.', 'Prime Video'),
