('Movie', 'Vietnam: Secret Negotiations that Ended the War', 'Daniel Roussel', NULL, NULL, NULL, 2015, 'PG-13', '53 min', 'Documentary, International, Special Interest', 'While the war raged on, Henry Kissinger, national security advisor to President Nixon, and Lê Duc Tho, member of Vietnam''s Politburo, held secret meetings in France. This award-winning film features exclusive interviews and undisclosed recordings of what happened between two men who were worlds apart. How do historians explain the massive air offensive that followed weeks after peace was signed?', 'Prime Video'),
