('Movie', 'Valley Uprising', 'Pete Mortimer, Nick Rosen', 'Peter Sarsgaard', NULL, NULL, 2014, '13+', '99 min', 'Action, Documentary, Sports', 'In the shady campgrounds of Yosemite, climbers carved out a counterculture of dumpster-diving and wild parties that clashed with the conservative values of the National Park Service. "Valley Uprising" is the riveting, unforgettable tale of this bold rock climbing tradition: half a century of struggle against the laws of gravity and society. Featuring Alex Honnold with narration by Peter Sarsgaard.', 'Prime Video'),
