('Movie', 'Twenty Bucks', 'Keva Rosenfeld', 'Linda Hunt, Brendan Fraser, Elisabeth Shue, Steve Buscemi, Christopher Lloyd, William H. Macy, Jeremy Piven, David Schwimmer', NULL, NULL, 1993, 'R', '91 min', 'Arthouse, Comedy, Drama', 'This multi-character comedy follows the path of a single twenty dollar bill in a city neighborhood,focusing on various holders and their intertwining stories, including two convenience store robbers, an estranged father and daughter and a young newlywed couple. Featuring performances by Elisabeth Shue, Christopher Lloyd, Linda Hunt and Spalding Gray.', 'Prime Video'),
