('TV Show', 'Trapped [English Subtitled]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2019, 'TV-14', '2 Seasons', 'TV Shows', 'When a man immolates himself and a government Minister outside Parliament in Reykjavik, Police chief Andri Ólafsson is in charge of the case. This takes him back to the town he left behind, where darker secrets than he knew lurk in the mountains and valleys around the fjord. Then the brutal murder of the foreman at a geothermal power plant raises questions.', 'Prime Video'),
