('Movie', 'Touch Chesi Chudu', 'Vikram Sirikonda', 'Ravi Teja, Raashi Khanna, Seerat Kapoor', 'India', NULL, 2018, '13+', '142 min', 'Drama, International, Romance', 'Karthikeya(Ravi Teja) is a businessman who keeps his family first before anything. He has a tough time convincing Pushpa(Raashi Khanna) whom he met in a match making, to marry him and when things seem to be going fine, he suddenly comes across Irfan, a criminal with whom he shares a dreaded past. Who is Irfan? What is the past that connects both of them? What is the shocking fact revealed later?', 'Prime Video'),
