('TV Show', 'Tokyo Alice', NULL, 'Aya Asahina, Maryjun Takahashi, Reina Triendl, Mizuki Yamamoto, Ryohei Otani', 'Japan', NULL, 2019, '13+', '1 Season', 'Drama, Romance', 'This is the story of the real-life, high-end romances of four former classmates. It follows the love, work and interests of the four protagonists, Fu, Mizuho, Sayuri and Ryo. Amazon Original "Tokyo Alice" Author: Toriko Chiya (Kodansha "Kiss")', 'Prime Video'),
