('Movie', 'Titanic The Shocking Truth', 'Tim Bell', 'Tony Caprari', NULL, NULL, 2012, '7+', '52 min', 'Documentary', 'Everyone knows the Titanic struck an iceberg and sank on her maiden voyage. However, this film provides evidence that it was not the Titanic that sank, but Titanic was switched for its sister ship the Olympic. The Olympic was damaged badly when it struck the warship the HMS Hawke. The Olympic''s damage was so serious it could not pass inspection. What transpired was an insurance fraud.', 'Prime Video'),
