('Movie', 'The Young Land', 'Ted Tetzlaff', 'Pat Wayne, Yvonne Craig, Dennis Hopper, Dan O''Herlihy, Roberto De La Madrid', NULL, NULL, 1959, '13+', '92 min', 'Action, Western', 'In 1848 in California, an American (Hopper) is placed on trial for killing a Mexican. Mexican-Americans are anxious to see if the American justice system treats everyone equally. After the trial the young sheriff (Wayne), who had arrested him, has to save him from being lynched.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'The Yellow Birds', 'Alexandre Moors', 'Tye Sheridan, Alden Ehrenreich, Toni Collette, Jason Patric, Jack Huston, Jennifer Aniston', NULL, NULL, 2018, 'R', '95 min', 'Drama', 'Alden Ehrenreich, Tye Sheridan and Jennifer Aniston star in this explosive wartime story about the bonds of friendship and the hard truth of the battlefield.', 'Prime Video'),
('TV Show', 'The Wubbulous World of Dr. Seuss', NULL, 'Martin P. Robinson, Anthony Asbury, John Kennedy', NULL, NULL, 1997, 'TV-Y', '2 Seasons', 'Kids', 'This Emmy-nominated series features the fun, music and adventures of some of the favorite characters created by Theodore Geisel (aka Dr. Seuss). Starring The Cat In the Hat, The Grinch, his dog Max, Terrence, Horton, Yertle and all the residents of Seussville, these whimsical tales and characters come to life using masterful puppets built by Jim Henson''s Creature Shop and 3D computer animation.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'The World''s Most Peaceful Resorts', 'Mark Knight', NULL, NULL, NULL, 2012, 'ALL', '60 min', 'Special Interest', 'Surround yourself with the natural beauty of some of the World''s most beautiful luxury resorts. From the Mexican Riviera and Yucatan to Rio de Janeiro, Buenos Aires and Cancun-enjoy a virtual vacation in a soothing video postcard without music or narration-just the natural sounds recorded on location in HD. Sharecare Windows videos are included in your Prime membership.', 'Prime Video'),
