('TV Show', 'The Triangle', NULL, 'Eric Stoltz, Catherine Bell, Lou Diamond Phillips, Bruce Davison, Sam Neill', NULL, NULL, 2005, '16+', '1 Season', 'TV Shows', 'This Emmy-winning mini-series from Bryan Singer ("X-Men") follows a team of four experts as they investigate the disappearance of shipping vessels in the Bermuda Triangle, where they find a cosmic threat that might unravel time itself.', 'Prime Video'),
('TV Show', 'The Trial: A Murder In The Family', NULL, 'Michael Gould, Emma Lowndes, Kevin Harvey, Fern Deacon, Liam Sargeant, Valerie Jerwood, Corinne Bowler, Nina Tanner, Janet Thomas, Brian Barker, Max Hill, Michelle Nelson, John Ryder, Lucy Organ', NULL, NULL, 2017, '16+', '1 Season', 'Drama, Suspense', 'The five-part series follows a fictional court case in which university lecturer Simon Davis (Michael Gould) is tried for the murder of his wife, in an attempt to recreate an accurate portrayal of an English legal trial. The prosecuting counsel, defence counsel and judge featured in the series are real professionals; and the jury is made up of twelve members of the British public.', 'Prime Video'),
('TV Show', 'The Toothbrush Family', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1999, 'ALL', '1 Season', 'TV Shows', 'The bathroom world of the Toothbrush Family is full of surprises - mischievous plastic dinosaurs, runaway pegs, fan-induced blizzards and dancing shoes... there''s even a toothfairy. All the more fun for the imaginative young toothbrushes, Molly and Max, who spend their days exploring with their friends Susie Sponge, Flash Flouride and Countess de Comb.', 'Prime Video'),
('TV Show', 'The Time Of Our Lives', NULL, 'Justine Clarke, Shane Jacobson, William McInnes, Claudia Karvan, Michelle Vergara Moore, Stephen Curry', NULL, NULL, 2014, '16+', '2 Seasons', 'Drama', 'The Time of Our Lives is a drama series, set in a moody inner-city Melbourne, which follows the lives of a typical extended Australian family, in all its contemporary variations.', 'Prime Video'),
('TV Show', 'The Tick', NULL, 'Peter Serafinowicz, Griffin Newman, Valorie Curry, Brendan Hines, Yara Martinez, Scott Speiser', 'United States', NULL, 2019, '18+', '2 Seasons', 'Action, Comedy', 'Tick and Arthur have freed the City from The Terror - now they must defend it from new villains and old enemies. That is if they can convince AEGIS, the government agency in charge of superhero regulation, that they deserve the job. But now that the City is ‘safe enough to protect’ Tick and Arthur begin to see they’ve got competition...', 'Prime Video'),
