('TV Show', 'Star Trek: The Next Generation', NULL, 'Patrick Stewart, Jonathan Frakes, Levar Burton, Brent Spiner, Michael Dorn, Marina Sirtis, Gates McFadden, Wil Wheaton, Denise Crosby, Diana Muldaur, Whoopi Goldberg', NULL, NULL, 1994, 'NR', '7 Seasons', 'Drama, Science Fiction, Special Interest', 'The seventh and final season of this beloved sci-fi series begins with Data (Brent Spiner) experiencing negative emotions such as anger, while his lookalike "brother," Lore, leads a dangerous, independent faction of Borg to destroy all organic life.', 'Prime Video'),
