('Movie', 'Sing Along with Little Baby Bum', 'Cannis Holder', 'Grace Tamayo, Erin Webbs', NULL, NULL, 2019, 'ALL', '35 min', 'Kids', 'Sing along to this 30-minute long compilation with some of LittleBabyBum''s most classic, well-loved and educational nursery rhymes!', 'Prime Video'),
