('TV Show', 'Silk', NULL, 'Maxine Peake, Rupert Penry-Jones, Neil Stuke, Alex Jennings, Phil Davis, Frances Barber', NULL, NULL, 2014, 'TV-14', '3 Seasons', 'Drama', 'Defense barrister Martha Costello is now a QC and busier than ever, while Clive Reader, also a QC, is specializing in prosecution. The criminal bar is a small world and they are pitted against each other increasingly often. Harriet wants to modernize Shoe Lane, but the changes are resented by Billy. Martha, Clive and Caroline are up for head of chambers and it means radical changes at Shoe Lane.', 'Prime Video'),
