('Movie', 'Root of the Problem', 'Scott Sikma', 'Sergio Di Zio, Claire Rankin, Jayson Therrien, Leslie Benn, Ty Loupelle', NULL, NULL, 2020, '7+', '95 min', 'Comedy, Drama, Special Interest', 'When a suburban family inherits a real-life money tree, the dad thinks he has a one-way ticket to easy street. But he loses sight of the things that matter most in life and becomes more distant and secretive with his wife and children. Now, the family will be tested and must search within their hearts to find the answers and discover that it is better to give than receive.', 'Prime Video'),
('TV Show', 'Room at the Top', NULL, 'Matthew McNulty, Maxine Peake, Jenna Louise Coleman, Kevin McNally', NULL, NULL, 2012, '18+', '1 Season', 'TV Shows', 'Set in post-war Britain and based on John Brain''s classic novel, this drama follows a young man''s struggle to rise above the world of his childhood and in the end, Joe must choose between the true love he feels for one woman and the success and stability offered by a union with another.', 'Prime Video'),
