('Movie', 'Rodeo & Juliet', 'Thadd Turner', 'Krista Allen, Tim Abell, Nadine Crocker', NULL, NULL, 2015, '7+', '88 min', 'Drama', 'Instead of spending her holiday break in the big city, Juliet is taken by her mother to the country for Christmas, where she develops a bond with her late grandfather''s horse and catches the eye of a local cowboy.', 'Prime Video'),
