('Movie', 'Robin Hood (Silent)', 'Allan Dwan', 'Douglas Fairbanks Sr., Enid Bennett, Wallace Beery, Alan Hale Sr.', NULL, NULL, 1922, '13+', '121 min', 'Action', 'Amid big-budget medieval pageantry, King Richard goes on the Crusades leaving his brother Prince John as regent, who promptly emerges as a cruel, grasping, treacherous tyrant.', 'Prime Video'),
