('Movie', 'Relaxing Water', 'Mark Knight', NULL, NULL, NULL, 2012, 'ALL', '60 min', 'Arthouse, Special Interest', 'A soothing video postcard with no narration-simply the natural sounds and video in HD. DeSoto Falls, Iao Valley Maui, Grand Bahama Island, Punta Mita Golf Course Mexico, Sipalay Boats, Caceres Reef and Glassfish, Philippines, Aruba beach, Del Norte Coast CA, Yellowstone Nat''l Park, Tumalo Falls OR, Colorado River Texas, Oregon Cattle Ranch, Rocky Coastline Chile, Schroon River and more.', 'Prime Video'),
