('TV Show', 'RAKUEN The Secret of Paradise', NULL, 'Kazuyoshi Miyoshi', NULL, NULL, 2017, 'TV-NR', '1 Season', 'Documentary', 'Kazuyoshi Miyoshi has published photo collections on Tahiti, Maldives, Seychelles, Hawaii and other paradises. In this series, accompanied by beautiful models, Miyoshi revisits those paradise beaches, forests and World heritages, discovering the Secrets of Paradise as he roams about freely. Captured in 4K UHD. Narrator: Charles Glover; Casts: Kazuyoshi Miyoshi, Ellie Toyoda, and others', 'Prime Video'),
