('Movie', 'Prema Pipasi', 'Murali Ramaswamy', 'GPS, Suman, Kapilakshi Malhotra, Sonakshi Varma', NULL, NULL, 2021, '18+', '132 min', 'Romance', 'Prema Pipasi is about a frustrated man whose journey begins with the search for true love. Something that is holy & pure. The relationships that unfold in his journey of love are the things to watch out for. Each relationship opens up anew dimension that was never seen & expressed before. Amidst all the drama, romance, comedy& thrill, will he finally get the love he is looking for ?', 'Prime Video'),
('TV Show', 'Preachers'' Daughters', NULL, 'Audrey Perry, Cheryl Perry', NULL, NULL, 2013, 'TV-PG', '1 Season', 'Drama, Unscripted', 'This provocative series follows the families of 3 church pastors to offer a behind-the-altar look at what happens at home after the sermon ends. It''s a revealing, hard-hitting and often humorous look at how the daughters try to balance typical teenage temptations with their parents'' strict, faith-based expectations. What happens will surprise viewers and change these families forever.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Prayer Never Fails', 'Wes Miller', 'Corbin Bernsen, Lorenzo Lamas, Eric Roberts, Nick Lashaway, Lynn Whitfield, Clifton Davis', NULL, NULL, 2017, '7+', '98 min', 'Drama, Faith and Spirituality', 'When a high school basketball coach is fired for praying with one of his players, he follows God''s calling and hires an agnostic, gambling lawyer to file a lawsuit. Starring Corbin Bernsen, Lorenzo Lamas, and Eric Roberts.', 'Prime Video'),
('TV Show', 'Pramface', NULL, 'Sean Michael Verey, Scarlett Alice Johnson, Angus Deayton, Anna Chancellor', NULL, NULL, 2014, 'TV-14', '3 Seasons', 'Comedy, Young Adult Audience', 'As far as Jamie''s concerned his relationship with Laura is now on track. It''s his final year of school and he''s starting to plan for his future. He''s got it all figured out and it would all be so much easier if Laura felt the same. University is beckoning and there''s a niggling thought that just won''t go away: Is Jamie, sweet as he is, the best she can do?', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Power Douglas', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2008, 'NR', '19 min', 'Music Videos and Concerts', 'Power Douglas plow their way through a barraging blitz of hardcore, jazz spazz, and afro beat elements in Brooklyn.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Powder Blue', 'Timothy Linh Bui', 'Jessica Biel, Ray Liotta, Eddie Redmayne, Forest Whitaker, Kris Kristofferson, Lisa Kudrow, Patrick Swayze', 'United States', NULL, 2009, 'R', '106 min', 'Drama, Suspense', 'On the gritty streets of LA, the destinies of four people desperate for connection and redemption are about to collide. Jessica Biel, Ray Liotta, Forest Whitaker and Eddie Redmayne lead a top-notch cast in this powerful thriller about an overwhelmed erotic dancer, a grieving husband who has lost his will to live, a terminally ill ex-con and a pathologically shy mortician.', 'Prime Video'),
('TV Show', 'Postcards from Buster', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2012, 'TV-Y', '1 Season', 'Kids', 'Buster Baxter of "Arthur" fame travels around the world with his family.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Possessed', 'Steven E. de Souza', 'Timothy Dalton, Jonathan Malen, Henry Czerny, Michael Rhoades, Shannon Lawson, Christopher Plummer, Piper Laurie, Richard Waugh, Michael McLacklan', NULL, NULL, 2000, '16+', '110 min', 'Drama, Horror, Special Interest', 'Inspired by the true account of the first documented exorcism performed in America detailed in the book of the same name, "Possessed" tells the story that was suppressed for nearly half a century. After the death of his aunt, eleven-year-old Robbie Manheim begins to exhibit strange behavior, and his parents turn to troubled priest Father William Bowdern for help after science fails.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Posse', 'Kirk Douglas', 'Kirk Douglas, Bruce Dern, Bo Hopkins', NULL, NULL, 1975, 'PG', '93 min', 'Action, Drama, Western', 'A tough marshal with political ambitions leads an elite posse to capture a notorious criminal. He succeeds, but instead of cheering him, the public turns against him.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Portastatic', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2011, 'NR', '42 min', 'Music Videos and Concerts', 'Mac McCaughan and company take their seasoned act to Jersey in support of "Be Still Please" from Portastatic.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Port of New York', 'Laslo Benedek', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1949, 'NR', '82 min', 'Action, Drama', 'Two narcotics agents go after a gang of murderous drug dealers who use ships docking at the New York harbor to smuggle in their contraband.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Porky''s Revenge', 'James Komach', 'Dan Monahan, Mark Herrier, Wyatt Knight, Tony Ganios, Kaki Hunter', NULL, NULL, 1985, 'R', '93 min', 'Comedy, Young Adult Audience', 'As graduation nears for the class of 1955 at Angel Beach High, the gang once again faces off against their old enemy, Porky, who wants them to throw the school''s championship basketball game because he''s betting on the opposing team.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Porky''s II: The Next Day', 'Bob Clark', 'Dan Monahan, Mark Herrier, Wyatt Knight, Roger Wilson, Cyril O''Reilly, Tony Ganios, Kaki Hunter', NULL, NULL, 1983, 'R', '98 min', 'Comedy, Young Adult Audience', 'The naughty high schoolers of Angel Beach High now seek revenge on a group of religious fanatics and corrupt politicians - all of whom want to shut down their Shakespeare production after they cast a Seminole transfer student in the lead.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Popular Nursery Rhymes', NULL, 'Elly, Eva', NULL, NULL, 2019, 'ALL', '22 min', 'Kids', 'Catch Kids Camp at it''s best! Sing along to some of the most popular nursery rhymes and kids song with Elly and Eva. This is the ultimate collection for children as it has a blend of nursery rhymes like ''Wheels on the Bus'', ''Finger Family'' and learning songs like ABC Song and Numbers Song. So hop on board and enjoy!', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Polylove', 'Charlie David', 'Brent Everett, Steve Pena, Jayson Smith, Dr. Carrie Jenkins, Dr. Laurie Betito, Gabriel Clark, Caitlyn Roberts, Samantha Fraser', NULL, NULL, 2019, NULL, '59 min', 'LGBTQ, Special Interest', 'PolyLove explores non-monogamy and the journey to redefine a relationship. Statistically more young people are now saying I don''t or I delay than I do. Brace yourself, because we are going to a place where bravery and honesty are essential. A place where loving someone enough to set them free isn''t just a trite metaphor, it''s essential to your personal and relationship growth.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Pollyanna', 'Paul Powell', 'Mary Pickford, Wharton James, Katherine Griffith, Helen Jerome Eddy', NULL, NULL, 1920, 'NR', '60 min', 'Comedy, Drama, Kids', 'When Pollyanna is orphaned, she is sent to live with her crotchety Aunt Polly. Pollyanna discovers that many of the people in her aunt''s New England home town are as ill-tempered as her aunt.', 'Prime Video'),
('TV Show', 'Police Rescue', NULL, 'Gary Sweet, Sonia Todd, Steve Bastoni, John Clayton, Tammy Macintosh, Belinda Cotterill, Jeremy Callaghan', NULL, NULL, 1991, '16+', '1 Season', 'Action, Drama', 'When you work on the Police Rescue squad, trouble finds you. There are no slow days. No easy jobs. Every time the phone rings, it''s a new emergency!', 'Prime Video'),
('TV Show', 'Poldark', NULL, 'Aidan Turner, Eleanor Tomlinson, Ellise Chappell, Tim Dutton, Beatie Edney, Jack Farthing, Kerri McLean, Luke Norris, Vincent Regan, Harry Richardson, Tristan Sturrock, Peter Sullivan, Pip Torrens, Gabriella Wilde, Tom York, Anthony Calf', NULL, NULL, 2019, '18+', '5 Seasons', 'Drama, Historical', 'Following the death of Elizabeth, Poldark resolves to put Westminster behind him. But when an old friend begs for help, Ross must challenge the establishment again, drawing the Poldarks into greater danger than ever before. UK Edition.', 'Prime Video'),
('TV Show', 'Pokémon the Series: Gold and Silver', NULL, 'Ikue Ohtani, Veronica Taylor', NULL, NULL, 2001, 'TV-Y7', '4 Seasons', 'Anime, Kids', 'Leaving Pallet Town behind them, Ash, Pikachu, Misty, and Brock are back on the road and heading for their next challenge: the Johto region!', 'Prime Video'),
('TV Show', 'Pointless Celebrities', NULL, 'Alexander Armstrong, Richard Osman', NULL, NULL, 2016, '7+', '2 Seasons', 'Special Interest, Unscripted', 'The brainy quiz returns for a new celebrity series in which celebrity contestants try to score as few points as possible by plumbing the depths of their general knowledge to come up with the answers no-one else could think of. Presented by Alexander Armstrong and Co Host Richard Osman.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Pocoyo in cinemas: Your First Movie', 'Alfonso Rodríguez', NULL, NULL, NULL, 2018, 'ALL', '50 min', 'Animation, Kids', 'The world is in danger and only Pocoyo and the Super Friends can save us! Nina, Pato and Elly will have to work as a team and overcome their fears to defeat a villain who threatens the peace of the Pocoyo World. Will they get out of this mess? But that is not all! Get ready to live funny stories, dance, sing and learn with Pocoyo!', 'Prime Video'),
('TV Show', 'Pocket.watch Onyx Family Ultimate mishmash', NULL, 'Mirthell Mitchell, Rita Mitchell, Shalom Mitchell, Sinead Mitchell, Sade Mitchell, Shiloh Mitchell', NULL, NULL, 2020, 'TV-Y7', '1 Season', 'Kids', 'Onyx Family, popular vloggers best known for their silly and spooky skits, stars in the brand new series, pocket.watch Onyx Family Ultimate mishmash! Enjoy the scary but comedic scenarios cooked up by siblings Shiloh, Shasha, Sinead, and Shalom-AKA Onyx Kids-along with Onyx Mom and Onyx Dad, Rita and Mirthell, on the ultimate family-friendly entertainment adventure.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Pocket full of game', 'David Holley, Deborah Cardona', 'Katherine K Nunez, Carlos Garcia, Joey Ortiz, David Holley', NULL, NULL, 2020, '18+', '125 min', 'Action, Romance', 'Porsha Garcia is a female huster who as it all Money ,beauty, respect. She earned it all by being loyal and respecting the code of the streets. A chance encounter with a stick up kid named Fresh introduces her to a whole new world.', 'Prime Video'),
('TV Show', 'Plim Plim', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2015, 'ALL', '1 Season', 'Animation, Kids', 'From amazing robots to magical words, delicious pizza to special kingdoms, Plim Plim is an animated series for all ages! Plim and his friends learn life lessons and make the world a better place together, one adventure at a time.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Playtime with Mila and Morphle', 'Arthur van Merwijk', NULL, NULL, NULL, 2019, 'ALL', '43 min', 'Animation, Kids', 'In this compilation of My Magic Pet Morphle cartoon, join Mila and Morphle as they go on magical adventures during their playtime with their friends!', 'Prime Video'),
('TV Show', 'Playful Kiss', NULL, 'Kim Hyun-joong, Jung So-min, Lee Tae-sung, Lee Si-young, Yoon Seung-ah', NULL, NULL, 2010, '13+', '1 Season', 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'In this K-drama romance, ditsy Oh Ha-ni confesses her love to studious school golden boy Seung-jo. After she gets rejected, an earthquake forces them to move in together. But can living in close quarters bring them closer, or pull them apart?', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Planet Of The Humans', 'Jeff Gibbs', 'Al Gore, Bill McKibben, Richard Branson, Robert F. Kennedy Jr., Michael Bloomberg, Van Jones, Vinod Khosla, Vandana Shiva, Ozzie Zehner, Steven Running, Nina Jablonski, Stephen Churchill, Sheldon Solomon', NULL, NULL, 2020, '13+', '100 min', 'Documentary, Special Interest', '"Planet of the Humans" dares to say what no one will-that we are losing the battle to stop climate change by following leaders who have taken us down the wrong road-selling out the green movement to bankers and billionaires. This urgent, must-see movie is guaranteed to generate anger, debate, and, hopefully, a willingness to see our survival in a new way-before it''s too late.', 'Prime Video'),
('TV Show', 'Planet Egypt', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2011, 'TV-14', '1 Season', 'Documentary', 'Planet Egypt recounts the epic history of Ancient Egypt and its Pharaohs, from the pre-dynastic period through to the late dynasties. Each episode addresses one aspect of Egypt’s enormous success, including the unlikely rise of its first powerful rulers, the wars they fought, the spiritual grounding that held the society together and the grand quest for immortality pursued by the Pharaohs.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Pit Stop', 'Yen Tan', 'Bill Heck, Marcus DeAnda, Amy Seimetz', NULL, NULL, 2014, '18+', '81 min', 'LGBTQ, Romance', 'In this compelling drama, openly gay Ernesto and closeted Gabe grapple with the sad tribulations of being gay in a small, working-class Texas town. Reminiscent of such classic rural gay love stories as "Big Eden" and "Brokeback Mountain," this festival hit is an uplifting love story about male intimacy, the heartache of unsuccessful relationships, and the transformative power of love.', 'Prime Video'),
('TV Show', 'Pistorius', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2018, '13+', '1 Season', 'TV Shows', 'Pistorius is a four-part feature documentary about the South African Paralympic and Olympic sprinter Oscar Pistorius, who shot and killed his girlfriend in the early hours of Valentine’s Day 2013. The story of a man and a nation both born to great disadvantage, the film follows the challenges, hopes and triumphs of both and the demise of their dreams under the glare of the world media.', 'Prime Video'),
