('Movie', 'Oklahoma Crude', 'Stanley Kramer', 'George C. Scott, Faye Dunaway, John Mills, Jack Palance, William Lucking, Harvey Jason, Hal Smith', NULL, NULL, 1973, 'PG', '112 min', 'Western', 'In 1913, in Oklahoma, oil derrick owner Lena Doyle (Faye Dunaway), aided by her father (Sir John Mills) and a hobo (George C. Scott), is stubbornly drilling for oil despite the pressure from major oil companies to sell her land.', 'Prime Video'),
('TV Show', 'Off the Cuff', NULL, 'Chris Parr, Harris Dirnberger, Philip Dirnberger, William Jones', NULL, NULL, 2020, '16+', '2 Seasons', 'Documentary, Special Interest', 'In an effort to explore the most fascinating communities in the world, Season 2 of "Off the Cuff" is a collection of short documentaries that showcase the most obscure communities in America.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Of Two Minds', 'Lisa Klein, Doug Blush', 'Terri Cheney, Carlton Davis, Cheri Keating', NULL, NULL, 2013, '13+', '90 min', 'Documentary', 'Of Two Minds is an award-winning feature documentary that explores the extraordinary lives, struggles and successes of a few of the over five million Americans living with bipolar disorder. It puts a human face on the topic, providing an intimate, sometimes painful, sometimes painfully funny, look at those who live in its shadows: our parents and children, our friends and lovers...and ourselves.', 'Prime Video'),
