('Movie', 'No Place to Hide: The Rehtaeh Parsons Story', 'Rama Rau', NULL, 'Canada', NULL, 2015, '13+', '48 min', 'Documentary, Special Interest', 'Rehtaeh Parsons, a 15 year old student from Nova Scotia, was raped by four schoolboys while drunk at a sleepover. A photo of her rape soon began circulating online. Through the eyes of her parents, this film re-examines these alarming events, which ultimately led to Rehtaeh''s suicide. A shocking testament to police indifference, the stigma of sexual assault and the effects of cyber bullying.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Nishabdham (Telugu) (4K UHD)', 'Hemant Madhukar', 'Anushka Shetty, Madhavan, Anjali, Michael Madsen', NULL, NULL, 2020, '16+', '126 min', 'Suspense', 'A murder-mystery thriller. A world-famous cello player is murdered and crucified in a Seattle Villa that has a reputation for being haunted. His friends and family try to figure out if he was really killed by a supernatural being or if he was assassinated by someone he knows. His dumb and deaf wife and a police detective are pinned against each other as they discover the victim''s dark past.', 'Prime Video'),
