('Movie', 'Nick Di Paolo: Inflammatory', 'Samuel Brownfield', 'Nick Di Paolo', NULL, NULL, 2017, NULL, '64 min', 'Arts, Entertainment, and Culture, Comedy', 'If you believe in Safe Spaces, run to yours now, as Nick Di Paolo once again shows why he''s the master of slaughtering sacred cows and being absolutely hilarious while doing so. Laugh along as he treats subjects as sensitive as domestic violence, transgender bathrooms and black parenting with all the sentimentality of a Bill Belicheck press conference.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Nick Cannon: F--k Nick Cannon', 'Jay Chapman', 'Nick Cannon', NULL, NULL, 2013, '18+', '97 min', 'Arts, Entertainment, and Culture, Comedy, Special Interest', 'In his follow up to his tremendously successful debut comedy special ''Mr. Showbiz,'' the comic-actor-musician-host responds to anyone who''s ever said: ''F#ck Nick Cannon.'' A recent health scare has changed how he sees the world and he is here to share his unique perspective on getting older, raising his children, and living with his famous wife (Mariah Carey).', 'Prime Video'),
