('Movie', 'Lucky Texan', 'Robert N. Bradbury', 'John Wayne, Barbara Sheldon, George "Gabby" Hayes, Yakima Canutt, Gordon Demaine, Ed Parker, Earl Dwire, Lloyd Whitlock, Tex Palmer, George Morrell, George F. Hayes', NULL, NULL, 1934, '13+', '56 min', 'Western', 'Two miners discover a streak of gold, but bad guys attempt to murder one and pin the crime on the other - the victim recovers and sets up a surprise.', 'Prime Video'),
