('TV Show', 'Little Women: LA', NULL, 'Tonya Reneé Banks, Terra Jole', NULL, NULL, 2016, 'TV-14', '4 Seasons', 'Unscripted', 'In Little Women: LA Season 4, relationships between cast members are more volatile than ever. Preston and Elena find themselves back in LA but are at odds over Elena''s preoccupation with launching her fashion line and DIY makeup tutorials. Meanwhile, Tonya and Jasmine continue their on-again, off-again friendship.', 'Prime Video'),
