('Movie', 'Invasion of the Body Snatchers', 'Don Siegel', 'Kevin McCarthy, King Donovan, Dana Wynter, Larry Gates', NULL, NULL, 1956, 'PG', '80 min', 'Drama, Horror, Science Fiction', 'A small-town doctor learns that the population of his community is being replaced by emotionless alien duplicates.', 'Prime Video'),
