('Movie', 'Hope Ranch', 'Rex Piano', 'Bruce Boxleitner, Lorenzo Lamas, Barry Corbin, Gail O''Grady, Laura Johnson, Brian Gross, J.D. Pardo, Richard Lee Jackson, Isabelle ''Isabell'' Howell, Brad Hawkins, Nicholas ''Nico'' Hill, Stephen Wozniak, Tina Illman, Clint Jung', NULL, NULL, 2002, 'PG-13', '90 min', 'Kids, Western', 'Former police officer and marine J.T. Hope starts a program for troubled teens on his ranch, Circle Hope Ranch, to help juvenile delinquents get started on a path away from crime and drugs through honest labor and teamwork.', 'Prime Video'),
