('Movie', 'Go Buster - Buster And Friends', 'Nick Hatton Jones, Richard Hickey', NULL, NULL, NULL, 2019, 'ALL', '31 min', 'Kids', 'Buster is a sweet little bus who loves playing. He has a lot to learn about the world and he is always faced with different little challenges to overcome. He loves a giggle which he loves to share with his friends. In this compilation, follow Buster as he builds sandcastles with his friend Digger, stands up against his bully Robot Buster, and teaches you all sorts of cool shapes he''s learned!', 'Prime Video'),
