('Movie', 'Go Buster - Awesome Songs', 'Cannis Holder', NULL, NULL, NULL, 2019, 'ALL', '32 min', 'Kids', 'Come and enjoy the hilarious and fun adventures of Buster the Bus! This collection of Go Buster videos includes "Stuck In The Mud", "Buster''s New Tires" and more.', 'Prime Video'),
