('Movie', 'Gentle Midnight Rain black screen 9 hours', 'Mark Knight', NULL, NULL, NULL, 2017, 'ALL', '541 min', 'Special Interest', 'One of our most popular sleep videos is now available with a completely black screen to help you enjoy a deep, restful and rejuvenating slumber. The total black screen eliminates the blue-spectrum light that generates melatonin and inhibits REM sleep. All Sharecare Windows programs are included in your Prime membership.', 'Prime Video'),
