('TV Show', 'Asawa Ko Karibal Ko', NULL, 'Kris Bernal, Rayver Cruz, Thea Tolentino', NULL, NULL, 2019, '7+', '1 Season', 'Kids, LGBTQ, Romance', 'Rachel meets Nathan, a gay man who later marries her due to family''s pressure. Unhappy and trapped, Nathan plots his fake death and later undergoes to a sexual reassignment and face surgery in another country. Years later, Rachel meets Gavin and falls for him. Gavin has a wife, Venus whom Rachel will eventually find out to be her former husband.', 'Prime Video'),
