('Movie', 'Around the World in One Hour', 'Mark Knight', NULL, NULL, NULL, 2012, 'ALL', '60 min', 'Special Interest', 'A soothing video postcard with no narration or music, just natural sounds. Underwater reefs-Philippines, penguins in Argentina, Ice City of Harbin China, Panama Canal, Millennium Park Chicago, Aruba, Oregon Cattle Ranch, Glassfish, Panama Rain Forest , Hacienda Temezon Mexico, Hachiko Crossing Tokyo, Venice Gondolas, Prague, Zocolo Square Mexico City, Tanah Lot Bali, and the Bellagio Fountains', 'Prime Video'),
