('Movie', 'Any Bullet Will Do', 'Justin Lee', 'Kevin Makely, Bruce Davison, Jenny Curtis, Meg Foster, Todd A. Robinson', NULL, NULL, 2018, '18+', '107 min', 'Action, Drama, Western', 'Taking place during 1876 in Montana, a ruthless headhunter tracks his own Brother through Big Sky country with the help of a young fur trapper.', 'Prime Video'),
