('TV Show', '2019 AVP Huntington Beach Open - Day 1', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2019, 'TV-NR', '1 Season', 'TV Shows', 'The 2019 AVP season will be kicking off in style as we hit the sands of Surf City for the Huntington Beach Open. Spend your Cinco de Mayo weekend with the AVP as we kick off our summer of beach volleyball.', 'Prime Video'),
('TV Show', '2019 AVP Hermosa Beach Open - Day 3', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2019, 'TV-NR', '1 Season', 'TV Shows', 'July 26th – 28th, 2019; Hermosa Beach is a cornerstone of the AVP schedule. The passionate Hermosa beach volleyball fans create one of the most energetic beach volleyball environments in the world. Don’t miss this one!', 'Prime Video'),
