('TV Show', 'Chopped', NULL, NULL, 'United States', 'April 1, 2021', 2000, 'TV-G', '17 Seasons', 'Cooking & Food, Family, Lifestyle & Culture', 'Passion and expertise rule the kitchen on the fast-paced new series, Chopped. Hosted by Ted Allen (Food Detectives), the series challenges four up-and-coming chefs to turn a selection of everyday ingredients into an extraordinary three-course meal. After each course, a contestant gets "chopped" until the last man or woman left standing claims victory.', 'Hulu'),
