('Movie', 'So I Married An Axe Murderer', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'April 1, 2021', 1993, 'PG-13', '93 min', 'Comedy, Romance', 'Offbeat, hatchet-driven romance about a wedlock-shy coffee house poet (Mike Myers) whose perfect woman (Nancy Travis) just might be a serial killer.', 'Hulu'),
