('Movie', 'The Haunting', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'January 1, 2021', 1999, 'PG-13', '113 min', 'Horror', 'A professor invites three insomniacs to participate in a sleep disorder study at an eerie, isolated New England mansion. But it turns out that the professor is far more interested in the sinister mansion and its ghastly horrors.', 'Hulu'),
