('Movie', 'The Brink', NULL, NULL, 'United States', 'July 4, 2019', 2019, '91 min', NULL, 'Documentaries', 'The Brink follows Steve Bannon leading up to the 2018 mid-term elections in the United States. A keen manipulator of the press Bannon continues to draw headlines and protests wherever he goes, feeding the powerful myth on which his survival relies.', 'Hulu'),
