('Movie', 'Pick of the Litter', NULL, NULL, 'United States', 'February 2, 2019', 2018, '81 min', NULL, 'Documentaries', 'Five spirited Labrador puppies embark on an incredible journey to become guide dogs for the blind. Which ones will have what it takes?', 'Hulu'),
