('Movie', 'Love, Gilda', NULL, NULL, 'Canada, United States', 'January 31, 2019', 2018, '85 min', NULL, 'Documentaries', 'A joyous, moving celebration of the life of the first superstar of Saturday Night Live. Gilda Radner''s jubilant spark is captured through private audiotapes, home movies and diaries in this salute to her indomitable spirit.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'Cruise', NULL, NULL, 'United States', 'January 28, 2019', 2018, '90 min', NULL, 'Drama, Romance', 'Set in the 1980s, a young Italian-American from the "wrong side of the tracks" falls for a Jewish girl from Long Island.', 'Hulu'),
