('TV Show', 'Miranda (TV)', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'January 14, 2019', 2009, 'TV-PG', '3 Seasons', 'Comedy, International', 'Written by and starring Miranda Hart as the impossibly clumsy Miranda who is back in her beloved joke shop with an ensemble cast of characters including her bossy mother, who is still desperately trying to marry her off, all watched over by her handsome friend Gary. Expect laughs from start to finish in this eccentric and affectionate family sitcom.', 'Hulu'),
('TV Show', 'Dead by Dawn', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'January 13, 2019', 2019, 'TV-14', '1 Season', 'Documentaries, Horror, Science & Technology', 'At night, mother nature reveals her sadistic side. As mysterious monsters come out to feed on the weak… anything can become prey. To survive you’ll have to be smart, fast and lucky or you might find yourself dead by dawn.', 'Hulu'),
