('Movie', 'UFC Main Event', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'December 28, 2018', 2014, 'TV-14', NULL, 'Sports', 'UFC Main Event is a 1-hour program that showcases the best fights of recent vintage, set-up by prefight, interview-driven features that reveal the backstories of the athletes and their mindsets just prior those epic bouts.', 'Hulu'),
