('Movie', 'Casi Leyendas', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'December 1, 2018', 2017, 'TV-PG', '116 min', 'Comedy, International', 'Axel, a very peculiar Spanish man, decides to go around Buenos Aires looking for his old friends.', 'Hulu'),
