('Movie', 'O.J.: Made in America', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'February 27, 2018', 2016, 'TV-14', NULL, 'Crime, Documentaries, Mystery', 'It is the defining cultural tale of modern America - a saga of race, celebrity, media, violence, and the criminal justice system. And two decades after its unforgettable climax, it continues to fascinate, polarize, and even, yes, develop new chapters. Now, the producers of ESPN''s "30 for 30" have made it the subject of their most ambitious project yet. From Peabody and Emmy-award winning director Ezra Edelman, it''s "O.J.: Made in America."', 'Hulu'),
