('TV Show', 'Brothers Conflict', NULL, NULL, 'Japan', 'September 5, 2017', 2013, 'TV-14', '1 Season', 'Anime, Comedy, International', 'Hinata Ema is the only daughter of a famous adventurer. When her father decides to remarry, she leaves the newlyweds alone and moves in with her 13 new stepbrothers, who each have a unique personality. Is love in the air for Hinata, too?', 'Hulu'),
