('TV Show', 'Dragonar Academy', NULL, NULL, 'Japan', 'September 5, 2017', 2014, 'TV-MA', '1 Season', 'Action, Adventure, Anime', 'Ash is a joke to his fellow students at Dragonar Academy until the day his dragon awakens, and his world changes forever. There''s just one problem: His dragon is actually a beautiful girl, and she''s determined to be the master – and make Ash the slave!', 'Hulu'),
