('TV Show', 'Gungrave', NULL, NULL, 'Japan', 'September 5, 2017', 2003, 'TV-MA', '1 Season', 'Action, Adventure, Anime', 'Brandon Heat returns from the grave to defeat Millennion, a mafia organization with hordes of undead enforcers. Packing his handguns and a coffin full of heavy weapons, Heat won''t stop until Millennion''s leader - his former best friend - is destroyed.', 'Hulu'),
