('Movie', 'The Man From Utah', 'Robert N. Bradbury', 'John Wayne, George "Gabby" Hayes, Polly Ann Young, Yakima Canutt, Edward Peil, Anita Campillo, Lafe McKee, George Cleveland, Earl Dwire, George F. Hayes', NULL, NULL, 1934, '13+', '56 min', 'Western', 'A rambling cowboy becomes an undercover deputy, entering a rodeo to find out why the potential winners keep getting murdered.', 'Prime Video'),
