('Movie', 'The Lucy Show - Vol. 2', 'Maury Thompson', 'Lucille Ball, Vivian Vance, Gale Gordon, Jim Nabors, Mel Tormé, Claude Akins, Mary Jane Croft', NULL, NULL, 2001, 'ALL', '127 min', 'Comedy', '"The Lucy Show" was the 3rd series which Lucille Ball used to dominate the Monday TV line-up on CBS. Like her earlier series, "I Love Lucy," it ran six seasons, and stayed in the top 10 in the ratings for its entire run. Enjoy 5 episodes: "Lucy & the Ring-A-Ding-Ring" - "Lucy Gets Caught Up in the Draft" (Jim Nabors) - "Viv Visits Lucy" - "Main Street USA" (Mel Tormé) - "Lucy Meets the Law"', 'Prime Video'),
