('Movie', 'The Legend of Swee'' Pea', 'Benjamin May', 'Lloyd Daniels, Avery Johnson, Bobbito Garcia, David Robinson, Jerry Tarkanian', 'United States', NULL, 2020, '18+', '80 min', 'Documentary, Sports', 'A "mystical understanding of the game" made Lloyd "Swee'' Pea" Daniels a New York City basketball legend by the age of 16. Christened the "next Magic Johnson", his career effectively ended at age 21 after being shot 3 times in the chest after a tussle over $8 of cocaine. The Legend of Swee'' Pea follows the twists and turns of fortune in the life of a basketball prodigy.', 'Prime Video'),
