('Movie', 'The Ladies Man', 'Jerry Lewis', 'Jerry Lewis, Helen Traubel, Kathleen Freeman, Hope Holiday, Lynn Ross', NULL, NULL, 1961, '13+', '96 min', 'Comedy', 'After being jilted by his gal, Herbert swears off romance and is determined to live his life as a confirmed bachelor. However, he then finds employment at a Hollywood boardinghouse for women, and the female residents go wild over the new help!', 'Prime Video'),
