('Movie', 'The Jazz Singer', 'Richard Fleischer', 'Neil Diamond', NULL, NULL, 1980, '13+', '116 min', 'Drama', 'Neil Diamond adds his own distinctive sounds to the classic role of a young Jewish cantor on the verge of a dream. It''s the story of a man who forsakes the synagogue choir for a chance at rock superstardom. Defying his father, he turns his back on his marriage and community to team up with his new manager, Molly.', 'Prime Video'),
