('Movie', 'Mo Mandel: Negative Reinforcement', 'Steven Feinartz', 'Mo Mandel', NULL, NULL, 2016, NULL, '66 min', 'Arts, Entertainment, and Culture, Comedy, Special Interest', 'Mo Mandel takes the stage in his first hour-long special at the Gothic Theater in Denver. He loves Julia Iglesias, hates positive people, and aims his frenetic laser at everything from the sins of his parents, to the perils of sex, to the dark nature of his own disastrous mind.', 'Prime Video'),
('TV Show', 'Mix Master: King of Cards', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2005, 'ALL', '1 Season', 'Animation, Anime, Kids', 'Mix Master: King of Cards - In the Mix Master animated series, the everyday town of Gamebridge has mixed up with a magical game world. Peculiar monsters known as Hench are running wild, and an evil Prince is plotting world conquest. The folks of Gamebridge must turn to an unlikely hero, Ditt, an 11 year old slacker who will become the Mix Master and save the world.', 'Prime Video'),
('TV Show', 'Mix Master: Final Force', NULL, 'Dorothy Fahn, Doug Erholtz', NULL, NULL, 2011, 'TV-Y7', '1 Season', 'Anime, Kids', 'After becoming the legendary Mix Master, Ditt now leads a boring, normal life as a student. But when the fantasy world faces another crisis, Ditt must join with other Mix Masters who are called upon to battle evil forces. The evil villain, Root, is determined to destroy both the Real World and the Fantasy World and create a new world of his own.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Mitchell', 'Andrew V. McLaglen', 'Joe Don Baker, Linda Evans, John Saxon, Martin Balsa, Merlin Olsen', NULL, NULL, 1975, NULL, '98 min', 'Action, Suspense', 'Mitchell (Baker) tough, hard-nosed cop who single-mindedly pursues a pair of drug dealers, who he hopes will lead him to the headquarters of a large crime syndicate in Los Angeles that he wishes to destroy. The pursuit leads to car chases, shoot-outs, action, and violence. A well directed actioner.', 'Prime Video'),
('TV Show', 'Mister Maker', NULL, 'Phil Gallagher', NULL, NULL, 2007, 'ALL', '1 Season', 'Kids, Special Interest', 'Mister Maker is an arts and craft show that combines live action, graphics and animation to show brilliant art techniques in both 2D and 3D! A child''s entertainment show that teaches you numerous easy arts and crafts for anybody watching. Let''s get making!', 'Prime Video'),
