('Movie', 'Midnight Waterfalls for Sleep 8 hours', 'Mark Knight', NULL, NULL, NULL, 2019, NULL, '480 min', 'Special Interest', 'Sharecare Windows presents a darker-screen version of our most-popular nighttime waterfalls accompanied by the natural sounds recorded on location. Helps create healthy sleep habits by reducing the blue-spectrum light waves-known to inhibit REM sleep. This calming video will help you relax into a deep sleep. Filmed on location in North Carolina''s Blue Ridge Mountains.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Midnight Thunderstorm for Sleep 9 Hours', 'Mark Knight', NULL, NULL, NULL, 2014, 'ALL', '541 min', 'Special Interest', 'Our most popular ambient sleep video is a full nine hours with an ultra dark screen for deep sleep. Relax to the sounds of rain softly falling on leaves accompanied by a natural thunderstorm. The dark screen reduces the blue-spectrum light waves-known to inhibit REM sleeping-helping create healthy sleep habits. For best results adjust your monitor or TV to the night or darkest screen setting.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Midnight Stallion', 'William Dear', 'Kris Kristofferson, Jodelle Ferland, Chelah Horsdal, Matt Mazur, David Orth, April Telek, Carlos Joe Costa, Christopher Gauthier', NULL, NULL, 2012, '7+', '90 min', 'Adventure, Drama', 'A family, about to lose their farm to the bank, finds an unlikely chance to keep it by entering a wild horse in a race.', 'Prime Video'),
