('TV Show', 'Michael Jackson: The Ultimate Icon', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2017, 'TV-14', '1 Season', 'TV Shows', 'This one-hour special will include exclusive conversations with Michael''s family and friends regarding the final months leading up to his death.', 'Prime Video'),
