('TV Show', 'Down East Dickering', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2015, 'TV-PG', '2 Seasons', 'Documentary, Special Interest', 'This series will follow three to five teams of small town dealers giving viewers an entertaining window into small town Maine.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Down 2 Come Up', 'Micah Troy', 'Pastor Troy, Malan Boykin, Shawty Lo', NULL, NULL, 2020, '18+', '80 min', 'Drama', 'Tyrone (Pastor Troy), is released from prison early and returns to his hood. While his girl, Anetra (Malan Boykin) stayed true, her brush with the King of Bankhead (Shawty Lo) threatens the couple''s chance at rebuilding their lives.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Dov Davidoff: Lower Your Expectations', 'John Asher', 'Dov Davidoff', NULL, NULL, 2016, '18+', '59 min', 'Arts, Entertainment, and Culture, Comedy, Special Interest', 'In Dov Davidoff''s all new stand-up special, Lower Your Expectations, Dov returns with his one-of-a-kind frenetic style to dissect the hilariously misleading truths in culture and to question the American future.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Doug Stanhope: No Refunds', 'Milton Lage', 'Doug Stanhope', NULL, NULL, 2007, '18+', '60 min', 'Arts, Entertainment, and Culture, Comedy, Special Interest', 'Like the legends who were born out of smokey, booze-soaked nightclubs of decades past, Doug Stanhope spews his own brand of moral outrage in an unmatched style that borders on self-destruction. Nothing is sacred, no subject off-limits and most importantly nothing is contrived. This is an unflinching look at one of the few voices left standing in the dark, punk-rock underbelly of stand-up comedy.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Doug Stanhope: No Place Like Home', 'Brian Hennigan', 'Doug Stanhope', NULL, NULL, 2016, '18+', '71 min', 'Arts, Entertainment, and Culture, Comedy, Special Interest', 'Doug Stanhope performs live in his hometown of Bisbee, Arizona, tackling an assortment of hard-hitting issues, from caring for the mentally-ill, to Vietnam vets, being locked up abroad and why everyone should kick like they kick. Watch him battle ISIS for the disenfranchised, angry youth.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Doug Dynasty', 'Doug Benson', 'Doug Benson', NULL, NULL, 2014, '18+', '61 min', 'Arts, Entertainment, and Culture, Comedy, Special Interest', 'Doug Benson, High Times 2006 Stoner of the Year, delivers in his first comedy special filmed at the Neptune Theatre in Seattle. He responds to audience Tweets with the blunt truth, performs impressions and tells some hilarious stoner stories. Enjoy, it''s a real hit from start to finish.', 'Prime Video'),
