('Movie', 'Doctor Blood''s Coffin', 'Sidney Furie', 'Hazel Court, Ian Hunter', NULL, NULL, 1961, '13+', '92 min', 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'There is horror in a small Cornish village when a disbarred doctor starts performing grafting experiments on the unfortunate and terrified villagers.', 'Prime Video'),
