('TV Show', 'Dino Dana', NULL, 'Michela Luci, Saara Chaudry, Amish Patel', 'Canada, United States', NULL, 2020, 'ALL', '4 Seasons', 'Kids', 'Dana is a 9-year old girl who loves dinosaurs and spends all of her time learning about them. After receiving a book she discovers she can see Dinosaurs in real life.', 'Prime Video'),
