('TV Show', 'Comicstaan Semma Comedy Pa', NULL, 'Karthik Kumar, Praveen Kumar, Rajmohan Arumugam, Vidyullekha Raman, Mervyn Rozz, Abishek Kumar, Annamalai Lakshmanan, Karthigeyan Durai, Mayandi Karunanithi, Syama Harini, Yogesh Jagannathan', 'India', NULL, 2020, '13+', '1 Season', 'Comedy', 'Aspiring comedians compete to become the future of funny in Tamil stand-up comedy. Mentored by the biggest Tamil comedians, find out who will be crowned the winner of Comicstaan Semma Comedy Pa!', 'Prime Video'),
