('Movie', 'Citizen K', 'Alex Gibney', 'Mikhail Khodorkovsky', NULL, NULL, 2020, '18+', '126 min', 'Documentary', 'The strange case of Mikhail Khodorkovsky, once believed to be the wealthiest man in Russia, who rocketed to prosperity and prominence in the 1990s, served a decade in prison, and became an unlikely martyr for the anti-Putin movement.', 'Prime Video'),
