('Movie', 'Christmas Recipe for Romance', 'Marco Deufemia', 'Madeline Leon, Sebastian Sacco', NULL, NULL, 2019, NULL, '88 min', 'Comedy, Romance', 'Abby enters into a cooking contest in hopes of winning the cash prize to save her family-run Inn. The only problem is that she''s a bit of a disaster in the kitchen. But when a Christmas miracle has renowned chef Jason Corwin as a guest at the Inn, she recruits him to help and the kitchen isn''t the only thing that is heating up.', 'Prime Video'),
