('TV Show', 'Busytown Mysteries', NULL, 'Kevin Dennis, Joanne Vannicola, Paul Wensley, Ellie Ellwand, Julie Lemieux, Richard Binsley', NULL, NULL, 2009, 'ALL', '1 Season', 'Animation, Kids', 'Curiosities are everywhere in Busytown and so are Huckle Cat, Lowly Worm, Sally Cat, Hilda Hippo plus Pig Will and Pig Won''t. Each episode is an innovative blend of humor and learning based around six unforgettable friends and many other colorful characters from the amazing world of Richard Scarry''s books.', 'Prime Video'),
