('TV Show', 'Burn Notice', NULL, 'Bruce Campbell, Kiele Sanchez, RonReaco Lee', NULL, NULL, 2011, 'TV-PG', '8 Seasons', 'Drama', 'Before Sam Axe teamed up with Michael and Fiona, he was Commander Axe, U.S. Navy SEAL. The Fall of Sam Axe tells the story of how Sam went from respected Naval Commander to the man of mystery we''ve come to know on Burn Notice.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Bulldog Drummond', 'F. Richard Jones', 'Ronald Colman, Claud Allister, Lawrence Grant', NULL, NULL, 1929, '7+', '90 min', 'Drama, Suspense', 'A bored WWI veteran helps out a young woman, whose uncle is being held hostage by embezzlers.', 'Prime Video'),
('TV Show', 'Bulge Bracket', NULL, 'Jessika Van, Feodor Chin, Lanny Joon, Anisha Adusumilli, Leonard Wu, Gigi Gustin, Rachel Alig, Kristen Vaganos, Jonathan P. Sims, Teddy Larsen, Chris King Wong, Chris Elsenbroek, Nick Bouier, Colin Molloy, Susan Chuang, Vishesh Chachra, Bruce Clifford, David Pinion, Jake Jacobson, Hilary Barraford, Philicia Saunders, Andre Franco, Jessica Davis, Douglas Kim, Laura Liefer, Chris Markle, Michael Cosentino', NULL, NULL, 2020, '16+', '1 Season', 'Comedy, Drama', 'In the high-intensity world of mergers, acquisitions, and IPOs, a young female investment banker (Jessika Van, CBS''s "Rush Hour") confronts the patriarchy in the frat house of Wall Street. An ensemble dramedy about the costs of climbing the corporate ladder.', 'Prime Video'),
('TV Show', 'Building The Dream Nashville', NULL, 'Vern Yip, Carisha Swanson', NULL, NULL, 2020, '7+', '1 Season', 'Documentary, Special Interest', 'We all think about what we should be doing to our homes-but what if your home could do more for YOU? If it could inspire you, rejuvenate you, make you feel happier from the moment you walk through the door? That''s the challenge we here at House Beautiful posted to our builder, Castle Homes, and 14 of the nation''s hottest designers. Here''s what happens when you build the dream.', 'Prime Video'),
('TV Show', 'Building Dream Homes', NULL, 'Richard Wilson', NULL, NULL, 2014, 'TV-PG', '1 Season', 'Documentary, Special Interest', 'This series follows some of the nation''s architects leading the way in ground-breaking design, as they battle with builders, blueprints and the clients who hire them, all in the name of making dream properties become a reality and showing first-hand the drama, headaches and hard work it takes to design and build these innovative residential builds.', 'Prime Video'),
('TV Show', 'Building Cars', NULL, 'James May, Ant Anstead, Kate Humble', NULL, NULL, 2015, 'TV-PG', '1 Season', 'Special Interest', 'Every 68 seconds a brand new car drives off the production line at the MINI Plant in Oxford. In this ambitious new series, James May goes behind the scenes to bring us this modern miracle in real time. He''s joined by Ant Anstead and Kate Humble to reveal the science, engineering and people that keep us all on the road, and see how a car is built from start to finish in a little over 24 hours.', 'Prime Video'),
('TV Show', 'Bug Diaries', NULL, 'Abigail Harrison, Nilah Rivera, Logan Smith', 'United States', NULL, 2020, 'ALL', '3 Seasons', 'Kids', 'Three unlikely bug buddies, Fly, Spider and Worm, fly, spin, and jump into all kinds of adventures in the big world around them. Imagine hopping a ride on a furry dog or dodging raindrops bigger than your house! Using their unique insect abilities, our tiny heroes find ways to help themselves and others out of sticky situations and record their stories in their bug diaries!', 'Prime Video'),
('TV Show', 'Buffy The Vampire Slayer', NULL, 'Sarah Michelle Gellar, Nicholas Brendon, Alyson Hannigan', NULL, NULL, 2003, 'TV-14', '7 Seasons', 'Action, Adventure, Drama', 'As Buffy accompanies Dawn on her first day at the new Sunnydale High, Giles continues Willow''s magic education in England. But while Buffy is surprised to be offered a guidance counselor job, Willow is shocked to experience a horrific future vision of the Hellmouth.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Buckskin Frontier', 'Leslie Selander', 'Richard Dix, Jane Wyatt, Lee J. Cobb, Victor Jory, George Reeves', NULL, NULL, 1943, '13+', '106 min', 'Western', 'A railroad man and the owner of a freight line battle for control of a crucial mountain pass. Dix''s opposition comes from freight wagon owner Lee J. Cobb, due to Dix''s railroad cutting into his business and Dix''s opposition to Cobb. Complicating matters is that Cobb''s daughter Jane Wyatt has fallen for the railroad man. But the real villain turns out to be rival railroad owner Victor Jory, who is looking to take out both Cobb and Dix.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Bryan Callen: Never Grow Up', 'John Brenkus', 'Bryan Callen', NULL, NULL, 2017, NULL, '58 min', 'Arts, Entertainment, and Culture, Comedy, Special Interest', 'Comedy Dynamics Presents: Bryan Callen struggles with which definition of masculinity to embrace. His example growing up was his giant of a father. A marine. A man built for war. A man hairy enough to walk up to a bee hive naked and start eating honey without a problem. Bryan did not grow into his father. Bryan is a man but a man built for dance not war. This is his struggle.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Bryan Callen: Man Class', 'Manny Rodriguez', 'Bryan Callen', NULL, NULL, 2012, '18+', '78 min', 'Arts, Entertainment, and Culture, Comedy, Special Interest', 'Comedy Dynamics Presents: In his first one-hour comedy special Bryan Callen gives his unique take on how to be a real man in modern society.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Bruce Lee the Invincible', 'Chi Lo', 'Sing Chen', NULL, NULL, 2007, 'PG-13', '90 min', 'Action', 'Fantastic fighting sequences mark this kung fu action film.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Bruce Lee Fights Back From the Grave', 'Doo-yopng Lee', 'Jun Chong', NULL, NULL, 2007, 'R', '84 min', 'Action', 'When Han Ji-hyeok dies mysteriously in Las Vegas, his brother Han Wook rushes there to make inquiries. He learns that Ji-hyeok was the victim of an opium ring. Unable to get the police to help him, Han Wook works alone in his attempts to bring the drug smugglers to justice.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Brothers O''Toole', 'Richard Erdman', 'John Astin, Pat Carroll, Hans Conried, Richard Erdman, Allyn Joslyn, Richard Jury, Lee Meriwether, Jesse White, Steve Carlson, Miranda Barry, Francelle Fuller, Ted Claassen, Harlan Knudson, Leon Inge, Jacques Hampton, Charlie Dell, Vern Porter, Noomis Jones, Leland Murray, Ed Mullancy, William Oakley, Gary Tessler, The Rufus Krisp Ensemble', NULL, NULL, 1973, NULL, '95 min', 'Comedy, Western', 'Western spoof about two con-artist characters at large in 1890 Colorado. The comedy is centered around a gold hunt with lots of fun. Hans Conreid is excellent as the bedraggled, bombastic politician.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Broken Dreams', 'Pras Lingam', 'Thenuka Kantharajah, Simson Bubbel, Nico Birnbaum', NULL, NULL, 2020, '18+', '31 min', 'Horror', 'The classy Dr. Christina Henning is the epitome of success - a rising career, a palatial house, a doting husband, and a lovely baby. But, amidst the intense intertwining of illusion and reality, as one peels away the layers, the ominous shadows get darker, and leaves one with the question, "Who is Christina?"', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Brody Stevens: Live From The Main Room', 'Samuel Brownfield', 'Brody Stevens', NULL, NULL, 2018, '18+', '49 min', 'Arts, Entertainment, and Culture, Comedy, Special Interest', 'Filmed and created at The World Famous Comedy Store on Sunset Blvd in West Hollywood, CA, Stevens assumes the "Sam Kinison spot", leading this late night audience on a journey showcasing his unique banter, upbeat music, classic jokes and positive punchlines.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Britt-Marie Was Here', 'Tuva Novotny', 'Pernilla August, Peter Haber, Vera Vetali', NULL, NULL, 2019, '13+', '97 min', 'Comedy, Drama, Sports', 'After the end of a long marriage, Britt-Marie is starting over at age 63. In the small town of Borg, the only job she can find is quite challenging: to coach the town''s youth soccer team. Based on the bestselling novel by author Fredrik Backman (A Man Called Ove).', 'Prime Video'),
('TV Show', 'Britain''s Best Drives', NULL, 'Richard Wilson', NULL, NULL, 2009, 'TV-PG', '1 Season', 'Documentary, Special Interest', 'Presented by Richard Wilson and timed to mark the 50th anniversary of the first motorway, this series sees the classic comedy actor steer six classic cars round the twists and turns of six of the best drives of 1958 as described in British motoring guide books of the period.', 'Prime Video'),
('TV Show', 'Britain by Narrowboat', NULL, 'Colin Dobson-Fox, Shaun Dobson-Fox', NULL, NULL, 2020, '13+', '1 Season', 'Documentary, Special Interest, Unscripted', 'In a last-ditch attempt to save his mental health, Colin and partner Shaun take drastic action! Selling their home, possessions, and quitting their jobs, they spend their life savings building a narrowboat to cruise the canals and rivers of Great Britain. Follow their adventure as they discover the secrets of the waterways, uncover forgotten history, and adapt to a totally different way of life.', 'Prime Video'),
('TV Show', 'Bring It', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2018, 'TV-PG', '2 Seasons', 'TV Shows', '"After getting disqualified from the Summer Slam Battle Round, Miss D decides she needs to focus on what really matters: growing her girls into amazing dancers. The Dolls will still have a battle every week but Miss D is pushing them to think bigger, prepping them for a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity:', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Bright Light Fever', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2011, 'NR', '21 min', 'Music Videos and Concerts', 'Bright Light Fever take the brand of blues injected garage rock they bred in Sacramento CA south to Los Angeles'' Spaceland.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Brigham City', 'Richard Dutcher', 'Richard Dutcher, Matthew Brown, Wilford Brimley, Carrie Morgan, Jongiorgi Enos, Tayva Patch, Jeff Johnson, Wendy Hoop, Sterling Brimley, Richard J. Clifford, Frank Gerrish, Janice Power, Rick Macy, Jerry North, Jack North, Jacque Gray, Barta Heiner, Tim Hansen, Robert Nelson, Elisabeth Simmons, Nick Whitaker, Chris Clark, Chris Kendrick, Emily Pearson, Bill Osborn, Kathryn Little, Haley Fife, Anne Sward, Bus Riley, Jayne Luke, Jeremey Hoop, Shannon Engemann, Ivan Croslan, Shirley Bliss', NULL, NULL, 2001, 'PG-13', '120 min', 'Drama, Suspense', 'Sheriff Wes Clayton is also a Mormon bishop in a picturesque little burg called Brigham City whose residents are stalked by an unknown serial killer. This mystery will keep you on the edge of your seat until the shocking final twist.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Brick Lane', 'Sarah Gavron', 'Tannishtha Chatterjee, Satish Kaushik, Christopher Simpson, Harvey Virdi', NULL, NULL, 2008, 'PG-13', '102 min', 'Arthouse, Drama, Romance', 'A young Bangladeshi woman, Nazneen, arrives in 1980s London, leaving behind her beloved sister and home, for an arranged marriage and a new life. Trapped within the four walls of her flat in East London, and in a loveless marriage with the middle aged Chanu, Nazneen struggles to accept her new life. Then one day, the hotheaded young Karim comes knocking at her door.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Brian Posehn: The Fartist', 'Jay Chapman', 'Brian Posehn', NULL, NULL, 2013, '18+', '58 min', 'Arts, Entertainment, and Culture, Comedy, Special Interest', 'In Brian Posehn''s new standup special, "The Fartist," he raises the questions every parent needs to ask. Like when''s the right time to tell your kid about Star Wars, or how much should you tip a stripper?', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Brian Posehn: 25x2', 'Ryan Polito', 'Brian Posehn', NULL, NULL, 2017, NULL, '64 min', 'Arts, Entertainment, and Culture, Comedy, Special Interest', 'In his latest special, Posehn laments the recent loss of his heroes. He also professes re-found love for a certain sci-fi franchise, and manages to rip on a few recent bands like the aging rocker he is. It''s personal, silly, profane, dry and screwed up and sometimes all at once. It''s Posehn / 25x2.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Brian Aylward: Big In Asia', 'Tuvshinbold Naidandorj', 'Brian Aylward', NULL, NULL, 2020, '18+', '46 min', 'Arts, Entertainment, and Culture, Comedy, Special Interest', 'Filmed live in Ulaanbaatar, Mongolia, this is the first stand-up special from internationally acclaimed comedian Brian Aylward. Brian is also a former Canadian Comedy Award winner for "Best Stand-up Comic."A Newfoundland native, Brian shares a huge sack of hilarious stories from his adventures throughout Asia. It''s all original, brilliantly observational comedy that bridges the cultural gap.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Brent Weinbach: Appealing To The Mainstream', 'Jay Chapman', 'Brent Weinbach', NULL, NULL, 2017, '18+', '69 min', 'Arts, Entertainment, and Culture, Comedy, Special Interest', 'Brent Weinbach is weird. In this show, Brent attempts to adjust his quirky personality so that he can fit in with the world around him, which would be valuable to his career as a comedian and entertainer. Through an absurd and abstract discourse, Brent explores the ways in which he can appeal to a broader, mainstream audience, so that ultimately, he can become successful in show business.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Breathtaking Scenes from Around the World', 'Mark Knight', NULL, NULL, NULL, 2012, 'ALL', '30 min', 'Special Interest', 'A relaxing video postcard with no narration-simply the natural sounds and HD video. Views include; Eternity Beach in Hawaii, Fly fishing on the Mohican River, Asilomar Beach inCalifornia, Twin Falls Yankee Boy Basin in Colorado, Jungle waterfall in Maui, Del Norte Coast lighthouse in California, Adirondack Mountains in New York, Trunk Bay in St. John and Annapolis Harbor sunrise.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Breathing Fire', 'Lou Kennedy', 'Bolo Yeung', NULL, NULL, 2007, 'PG-13', '85 min', 'Action', 'Michael, a Vietnam vet with two kids, pulls off a bank heist with his gang, which includes the bank''s manager. To ensure the loyalty of everyone involved, Mike makes a special set of keys, so that the hiding place for the loot can only be opened if all the members are present. The bank manager, however, gets cold feet and tries to back out.', 'Prime Video'),
('TV Show', 'Breathe: Into the Shadows', NULL, 'Abhishek A. Bachchan, Amit Sadh, Nithya Menen, Saiyami Kher, Hrishikesh Joshi, Shrikant Verma', NULL, NULL, 2020, '13+', '1 Season', 'Drama, Suspense', 'A 6-year old girl is kidnapped by a mysterious masked man, who demands an unusual ransom. To save his daughter, Dr. Avinash Sabharwal must kill someone! Meanwhile, Kabir Sawant''s journey continues in the hostile environment of the Delhi Crime branch. Lies, deceit and mind games begin when Kabir is given charge of the investigation, and meets Avinash. How far will Avinash go to save his daughter?', 'Prime Video'),
('TV Show', 'Breathe', NULL, 'Amit Sadh, Neena Kulkarni, Sapna Pabbi, Hrishikesh Joshi, R. Madhavan, Shri Swara, Atharva Vishwakarm', NULL, NULL, 2018, '16+', '1 Season', 'Drama', 'Breathe is an Indian drama that explores the lives of ordinary men faced with extraordinary circumstances. Kabir (Sadh), a brilliant but non-conventional officer of the Crime Branch, puts the pieces together of seemingly unconnected deaths of organ donors that lead up to an unlikely suspect - the affable Danny (Madhavan). Kabir will not stop till he cracks the case and delivers justice.', 'Prime Video'),
