('Movie', 'The Norse: An Arctic Mystery', 'Andrew Gregg', 'David Suzuki', NULL, NULL, 2012, '13+', '52 min', 'Documentary', 'The History books say that the first European to make contact with Native Americans was Christopher Columbus. New evidence tells a different story, that another civilization arrived in the New World centuries earlier. They were the Norse, a seafaring people who originated in the Scandinavian countries of Denmark, Norway and Sweden. They bore the name Viking, an "Old Norse" term for a pirate raid.', 'Prime Video'),
