('Movie', 'The Dressmaker', 'Jocelyn Moorhouse', 'Kate Winslet, Liam Hemsworth, Judy Davis, Hugo Weaving, Caroline Goodall, Sarah Snook, Kerry Fox, Sacha Horler, Rebecca Gibney, Gyton Grantley, Shane Jacobson, Genevieve Lemon, Alison Whyte, Mark Leonard Winter, James Mackay, Amanda Woodhams, Hayley Magnus, Julia Blake, Terry Norris, Shane Bourne, Darcey Wilson, Rory Potter, Simon Maiden, Tracy Harvey', NULL, NULL, 2016, '16+', '119 min', 'Historical', 'THE DRESSMAKER tells the story of the beautiful and talented Tilly Dunnage. After years working as a dressmaker in exclusive Parisian fashion houses, Tilly returns home to a town in the Australian outback to reconcile with her eccentric mother Molly.', 'Prime Video'),
