('Movie', 'No Greater Love', 'Justin Roberts', 'Gene Delgado, Jameson Lindskog', NULL, NULL, 2017, NULL, '97 min', 'Documentary', 'No Greater Love explores a combat deployment through the eyes of an Army chaplain, as he and his men fight their way through a hellish tour in one of the most dangerous places in Afghanistan and then as they struggle to reintegrate home.', 'Prime Video'),
