('Movie', 'Alex James: Slowing Down Fast Fashion', 'Ben Akers', 'Alex James', 'United Kingdom, France, United States', NULL, 2016, '7+', '65 min', 'Documentary, Special Interest', 'Alex James, Blur bassist turned cheesemaker, presents this critical look at the fashion industry and its enormous human and environmental cost. Far from predicting the apocalypse, Slowing Down Fast Fashion seeks to provide solutions. By talking to designers, activists and high street brands, the film shows that there is a wide ranging and ever growing thirst for change.', 'Prime Video'),
