('Movie', 'Wetbacks', 'Hank McCune', 'Lloyd Bridges, Nancy Gates, Barton MacLane, John Hoyt, Harold Peary, Nacho Galindo, Robert Keys', NULL, NULL, 1956, '18+', '87 min', 'Drama', 'Former Coastguardsmen Jim Benson is about to lose his boat when a couple approaches him for a fishing charter. Jim departs just ahead of the Sherrif with drunken Shanks, and his companion Sally (Gates). Shanks takes off into a small Mexican village after a fight with Jim, stranding both Sally and him with no money. Two local men hear of Jim''s plight, and offer him money to smuggle a batch of illegal aliens, called Wetbacks, into the U.S. He agrees but is blackmailed into continuing to run the smuggling operation. Afraid, Jim decides to make a run for it, but someone close to him reveals themselves as a US Immigration agent and asks him to assist them in shutting down the smugglers for good.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Transgenders: Pakistan''s Open Secret', 'Sharmeen Obaid-Chinoy', NULL, NULL, NULL, 2011, '16+', '54 min', 'Documentary, Special Interest', 'In a never-before-seen side of life in Pakistan, this film follows the stories of three transgender people, each of whom represent a different way of life in Pakistan.', 'Prime Video'),
('TV Show', 'The Supa Strikas', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2013, '7+', '3 Seasons', 'Kids', 'In their bid to raise the Super League trophy, the world''s greatest soccer team, Supa Strikas, must adventure through the world of soccer. Supa Strikas explore the roots of the game meet its greatest players (past & present) and confront its most unscrupulous coaches and players! Supa Strikas combines humor, action, technology and exploration in the context of a real soccer challenge.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Sweet Deception', 'Timothy Bond', 'Kate Jackson, Joanna Pacula, Joan Collins, Jack Scalia, Rob Stewart, Lisa Scrage, Tanja Reichert, Sharon Scott', NULL, NULL, 1998, NULL, '88 min', 'Suspense', 'Risa Gallagher is sentenced to life in prison after coming home to find her husband murdered. She must escape and find the real killer to prove her innocence, but who of her friends on the outside can she trust?', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Secrets', 'Juwan Lee', 'Denyce Lawton, Harold House Moore, Denise Boutte', NULL, NULL, 2020, '18+', '111 min', 'Drama', 'When a successful married businessman has a sexual appetite larger than what''s on his plate, chaos erupts.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Sebastian Maniscalco: Aren''t You Embarrassed?', 'John Asher', 'Sebastian Maniscalco', NULL, NULL, 2014, NULL, '62 min', 'Arts, Entertainment, and Culture', 'Sebastian Maniscalco returns home to Chicago to perform in front of a live, sold-out audience and asks "Aren''t You Embarrassed?" With his inimitable delivery, he skewers modern-day society through the lens of his old-world Italian-American upbringing. No topic is off-limits - but perhaps we all should be just a little embarrassed.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Pataakha', 'Vishal Bhardwaj', 'Sanya Malhotra, Radhika Madan, Sunil Grover, Vijay Raaz', 'India', NULL, 2018, '18+', '131 min', 'Comedy, Drama', 'Based on Charan Singh Pathik''s short story Do Behnein, Pataakha narrates the story of two feuding sisters who realize the true nature of their relationship only after marriage separates them.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'One Child Nation', 'Nanfu Wang, Jialing Zhang', NULL, 'United States', NULL, 2019, 'R', '88 min', 'Documentary', 'Included with Prime November 8. In the 2019 Sundance U.S. Grand Jury Prize-winning documentary One Child Nation, Chinese-born filmmakers Nanfu Wang (Hooligan Sparrow) and Jialing Zhang expose the devastating consequences of China’s One-Child Policy through the stories of those who lived through it.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Ocean to Sky', 'Michael Dillon', 'Edmund Hillary', NULL, NULL, 2020, '7+', '106 min', 'Documentary', 'In 1953, Edmund Hillary and Tenzing Norgay summited Mt Everest - the first to do so. That same year, back in Hillary''s home land of New Zealand, the jetboat was invented. With this new invention, Hillary, conqueror of the Himalayas'' greatest mountain, strove to also become the first to climb the Himalayas'' greatest river, the Ganges.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Ninu Veedani Needanu Nene', 'Caarthik Raju', 'Sundeep Kishan, Anya Singh, Murali Sharma, Vennela Kishore, Posani Krishnamurali, Poornima Bhagyaraj, Pragati, Divya Ganesh, Banda Raghu', NULL, NULL, 2019, '13+', '123 min', 'Comedy, Drama, International', 'Ninu Veedani Needanu Nene is about a young man who gets mired in a dire situation and comes out successfully.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Mrs Pollifax Spy', 'Leslie H. Martinson', 'Harold Gould, Darren McGavin', NULL, NULL, 1971, '13+', '109 min', 'Comedy', 'A bored widow looks for excitement – and finds it when she begins working for the CIA.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Missing Mom', 'Robert McCallum, Jordan C. Morris', 'Robert McCallum, Chris Byford', NULL, NULL, 2018, '13+', '85 min', 'Documentary, Drama, Suspense', 'This multi-award winning documentary shows film director, Rob McCallum and his brother, Chris, a police officer, searching for their Mom who''s been missing for almost 25 years. The pair interview reluctant family members, discover distorted truths about their past, and follow a series of cryptic clues from Las Vegas to Canada in a tale that''s full of suspense and mystery.', 'Prime Video'),
('TV Show', 'LOL - Hasse toh Phasse', NULL, 'Arshad Warsi,  Boman Irani,  Gaurav Gera,  Sunil Grover,  Mallika Dua,  Kusha Kapila,  Aadar Malik,  Aakash Gupta,  Ankita Shrivastav,  Cyrus Broacha,  Aditi Mittal,  Suresh Menon', NULL, NULL, 2021, '13+', '1 Season', 'Comedy, Unscripted', 'Hosted by Boman Irani and Arshad Warsi, 10 of India’s most entertaining comedians face a unique challenge - survive 6 hours together without laughing while doing whatever it takes to break the other contenders. In this one of a kind comedy battle, a laugh, giggle or smile could get you eliminated, and only the one that can keep a straight face to the finish will be crowned "Last One Laughing".', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Hold', 'Frank Mosley', 'Robby Storey, Stephanie Rhodes, Jodie Moore, Andrew Sensenig', NULL, NULL, 2009, '18+', '86 min', 'Drama, Suspense', '"Hold" is a tense, spare, and lean drama about a young couple''s relationship in the aftermath of a violent home invasion.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Hindu Raga Music for Yoga', 'Yocalm Studios', NULL, NULL, NULL, 2014, 'ALL', '37 min', 'Special Interest', 'Relaxing and soothing nature videos accompany the gentle sounds of the sitar, veena and tabla. This compilation is a blend of Hindustani- and Carnatic-influenced music, recorded live with thanks to a local Raga group from the Punjab region of India. Presented in conjunction with Yocalm Studios UK and Sharecare Windows', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'High Noon', 'Fred Zinnemann', 'Gary Cooper, Lloyd Bridges, Grace Kelly, Thomas Mitchell, Lon Chaney, Katy Jurado, Otto Kruger, Henry Morgan, Ian MacDonald, Eve McVeagh', NULL, NULL, 1952, 'PG', '85 min', 'Drama, Suspense, Western', 'Gary Cooper won the Oscar for the Best Actor in this classic tale of a lawman who stands alone to defend a town of cowardly citizens against a gang of revenge-seeking criminals.', 'Prime Video'),
('TV Show', 'Ethan The Dump Truck', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'April 20, 2021', 2019, 'ALL', '2 Seasons', 'Animation, Kids', 'Ethan the Dump Truck is an ideal educational TV show for toddlers and preschoolers. Ethan is a small yet very active dump truck. He is always rushing into new adventures, and tries to learn as much as he can through the games he plays. On his adventures, Ethan learns shapes, colors and numbers. Come and learn with Ethan while having great fun!', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Enakkoru Magan Pirappan', 'Keyaar', 'Ramki, Kushboo, Vivek, Senthil', NULL, NULL, 1996, 'ALL', '146 min', 'Comedy, Drama', 'Balu''s mother desperately wants a grandson, but his wife gives birth to a baby girl. As Balu''s mother suffers a heart attack, he ends up showing his friend''s newborn son as his own to make her happy.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Doug Stanhope''s The Unbookables', 'Jeff Pearson', 'James Inman, Andy Andrist, Brett Erickson, Sean Rouse, Brendon Walsh, Kristine Levine, Travis Lipski, Norm Wilkerson', NULL, NULL, 2017, '18+', '95 min', 'Arts, Entertainment, and Culture, Comedy, Special Interest', 'Stand-up legend Doug Stanhope sends his hand-picked comedy pals on an insane stand-up comedy van trip across the Midwest. Get in the van with comics who are unsafe at any speed!', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Do You Wanna Dance?', 'Michael Nickles', 'Robert Krantz, Patricia Skeriotis, Robert Costanzo', NULL, NULL, 1999, '13+', '104 min', 'Comedy, Romance', 'Billy Duncan, a dance instructor, has fallen on hard times and is sentenced to community service time. His assignment? To give dance lessons to elderly parishioners at a local Greek church. Reluctant at first, Billy soon finds himself falling in love with a wealthy parishioner''s daughter. With the help of an off-beat Priest, Billy is inspired into teaching dance again and taking a chance on love.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Copper Mountain', 'David Mitchell', 'Jim Carrey, Alan Thicke', NULL, NULL, 1983, '18+', '60 min', 'Comedy', 'Two friends travel to a ski resort, with one looking to hit the slopes, while the other spends time trying to pick up women.', 'Prime Video'),
('TV Show', 'Color Crew All About Colors', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'April 20, 2021', 2018, 'ALL', '4 Seasons', 'Animation, Kids', 'Watch the Color Crew as they play around with everyone''s favorite baby GooGoo, and make him laugh out loud!', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Anu Menon: Wonder Menon', 'Naveen Kumar M.N.', 'Anu Menon', 'India', NULL, 2019, '16+', '69 min', 'Arts, Entertainment, and Culture', 'In her first special Wonder Menon, Anu Menon talks about her Gujju husband, her Malayali parents, the mayhem of marriage, motherhood and her traumatic travels.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'A Date With Murder', 'Rex Piano', 'Alexandra Paul, Robyn Lively, David Chokachi, David Shae, Bart Johnson, John Colton, Ellyn Daniels', NULL, NULL, 2008, 'R', '85 min', 'Drama, Suspense', 'After her sister is murdered, Stacy must put her skills as a lawyer and investigator to use when she finds a hidden hard drive that links her sister to an adult-themed dating and hookup site. She signs up for the website and schedules dates with men that are recorded to have met her sister, sure one of them is the killer.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Raabta', 'Dinesh Vijan', 'Kriti Sanon, Sushant Singh Rajput, Deepika Padukone, Rajkummar Rao, Jim Sarbh, Varun Sharma, Nidhi Subbaiah', 'India', NULL, 2017, '13+', '144 min', 'Drama, International, Romance', 'A woman crosses paths with her reincarnated lover from a previous lifetime.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'YO', 'Rafa Cortes', 'Alex Brendenmuhl, Margalida Grimalt, Rafel Ramis', NULL, NULL, 2007, 'PG-13', '98 min', 'International', 'A handyman named Hans moves to a small town in Majorca where his his presence strikes a discord with the local residents.', 'Prime Video');
INSERT INTO `streaming_titles` (`type`, `title`, `director`, `cast`, `country`, `date_added`, `release_year`, `rating`, `duration`, `listed_in`, `description`, `streaming site`) VALUES
('Movie', 'The Pilgrim''s Progress', 'Robert Fernandez', 'David Thorpe, John Rhys-Davies, Kristyn Getty, Ben Price', NULL, NULL, 2019, '7+', '118 min', 'Animation, Drama, Kids', 'The Pilgrim''s Progress was written over 340 years ago by John Bunyan when he was in prison. The story has been smuggled to the underground church during communism, banned for a time in China, and has sold more copies than any other book other than the Bible. The journey of this remarkable work continues as Revelation Media brings the story to a new generation using state-of-the-art CGI animation.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'THE MAIDEN AND THE WOLVES', 'Gilles LeGrand', 'Laetitia Casta Jean Paul Rouve Stefano Accorsi', NULL, NULL, 2008, 'PG-13', '106 min', 'International', 'Angèle is determined to become the first woman veterinarian. Torn between 2 men, an unscrupulous industrialist and a simple man who lives among wolves. She uses this rivalry to attain her goal: saving wolves.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'The Klansman', 'Terence Young', 'Lee Marvin, Richard Burton, Cameron Mitchell, O.J. Simpson, Lola Falana, David Huddleston, Luciana Paluzzi, Linda Evans, Ed Call, John Alderson, John Pearce, David Ladd, Vic Perrin, Spence Wil-Dee, Wendell Wellman, Hoke Howell, Virgil Frye, Robert Porter, Lee de Broux, Charlie Briggs, Morgan Upton, Eve Christopher, Susan Brown, Gary L. Catus, Jeannie Bell, Jo Ann Cowell, Scott Edmund Lane, Bert Williams, Larry Williams, Staple Singers, Mavis Staples, Roebuck ''Pops'' Staples, Gene Lehfeldt, Conrad E. Palmisano', NULL, NULL, 1974, 'R', '101 min', 'Drama', 'An FBI Agent goes undercover in the Ku Klux Klan.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'TAXI BLUES', 'Pavel Lungin', 'Pyotr Mamonov, Pyotr Zaychenko, Vladamir Kashpur', NULL, NULL, 1990, 'PG-13', '105 min', 'International', 'Russian w/English subs. Ivan, a cab driver meets Alexi, a musician, they become friends. Alexi is discovered goes on tour and becomes a celebrity.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Soulmate', 'Axelle Carolyn', 'Anna Walton,  Tom Wisdom', NULL, NULL, 2014, 'NR', '104 min', 'Drama, Horror', 'Audrey Barker moves to the countryside in a last effort to get back on her feet after the death of her husband. She soon realizes her new house is haunted, yet decides to stay, hoping to find comfort in the presence of the ghost. But who is this new companion? And what does he really want from her?', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Saina', 'Amole Gupte', 'Parineeti Chopra, Manav Kaul, Meghna Malik, Shubhrajyoti Barat', 'India', NULL, 2021, 'ALL', '134 min', 'Drama, Sports', 'World Champion. Olympic Medallist. The Doyen Of Indian Badminton. Saina Nehwal Is All Of This And Much More. This Biopic Chronicles The Inspiring Story Of A Gifted Youngster''s Ascendance To The Pinnacle Of The Badminton World Through Sheer Passion And Perseverance - A Journey That Has Since Inspired And Empowered An Entire Nation.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'PERSECUTION', 'Patrice Chereau', 'Charlotte Gainsbourg, Romain Duris, Jean-Hugues Anglade', NULL, NULL, 2009, 'PG-13', '99 min', 'International', 'A stranger who regularly breaks into his house and spies on him haunts Daniel (Romain Duris) and tells him that he is the man of his life. Daniel is shocked and tells the stranger to stay away since he has a girlfriend, Sonia.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Nene Raju Nene Mantri', 'Teja', 'Rana Daggubati, Kajal Aggarwal, Catherine Tresa', 'India', NULL, 2017, '13+', '151 min', 'Drama, International', 'NRNM''s story is set in Uravakonda village in Rayalaseema. Jogendra (Rana) is a good-natured financier. He loves his wife Radha (Kajal) so much that he rechristens his name as Radha Jogendra. An unfortunate incident involving the village Sarpanch (Pradeep Rawat) and his wife results in Radha’s miscarriage.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'LOVE VERTIGO', 'Laurent Chouchan', 'Phillipe Torreton Sophie-Charlotte Husson  Julie Gayet', NULL, NULL, 2001, 'R', '83 min', 'Comedy, International', 'How can a man be sure he’ll love his wife all his life? This is the question Vincent asks himself the night before his wedding. During this long night, Vincent fills with doubts.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Live-In Maid (English Subtitled)', 'Jorge Gaggero', 'Norma Aleandro, Marko Mundstock, Claudia Laparo', NULL, NULL, 2005, 'NR', '83 min', 'Comedy, Drama, International', 'A wealthy woman and her live-in housekeeper must adjust their entrenched routine and relationship when Buenos Aires is plunged into economic crisis.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'LET THERE BE LIGHT', 'Arthur Joffe', 'Helene de Fourgorelles Tcheky Karyo Pierre Arditi', NULL, NULL, 1998, 'PG-13', '101 min', 'Comedy, International', 'Having decided to address mankind through film, God creates a screenplay and descends to Earth to find a director worthy of making it into a movie.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'LAST STOP PARADISE', 'Lucian Pintille', 'Costel Cascaval, Dorina Chiria, Gheorghe Visu', NULL, NULL, 1998, 'PG-13', '96 min', 'International', 'A hot summer day in Bucharest. Norica, and Mitu, meet and tease each other and start a drinking competition. This is no one-night stand. It could be serious, but Norica is engaged and Mitu has a commitment.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Jack And The Beanstalk', 'Jean Yarbrough', 'Bud Abbott, Lou Costello, Buddy Baer, Shaye Cogan, James Alexander, Dorothy Ford, Barbara Brown, David Stollery, William Farnum, Johnny Conrad, Mel Blanc, Claire Du Brey, Joe Kirk, Hank Mann, Charles Perry, Almira Sessions, Jack Shea, Arthur Shields', NULL, NULL, 1952, 'G', '82 min', 'Comedy', 'Abbott & Costello''s version of the famous fairy tale, about a young boy who trades the family cow for magic beans.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Interlude', 'Herve Bodilis', 'Vincent Winterhalter, Sopnie Verbeek, Dinara Drukarova', NULL, NULL, 2016, 'R', '95 min', 'Comedy, International', 'Raphaël buys a boat and convinces his two friends to go on a tour just like in the old days. They’re not as fit and don''t really share the same interests anymore. All that changes when two younger women join the cruise.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'In the Arms of My Enemy', 'Micha Wald', 'Adrian Jolivet, Gregoire Colin, Gregoire LePrince-Ringuet', NULL, NULL, 2007, 'R', '83 min', 'Drama, International', 'Brothers Jakub and Vladimir, join a Cossack army to flee poverty. Brothers Elias and Roman, steal horses to survive. Fate brings them together Vladimir gets killed. Jakub now burning with anger is obsessed with revenge.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'ICEBERG', 'Dominique Abel Fiona Gordon Bruno Romy', 'Fiona Gordon Lucy Tulugarjuk Dominique Abel', NULL, NULL, 2005, 'PG-13', '84 min', 'Comedy, International', 'Fiona locks herself in a freezer overnight. She is rescued, returns home and finds that her husband and children failed to notice her absence. Fiona now wants to leave and live on an iceberg.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'I LOVE YOU TOO', 'Ruud van Hemert', 'Antonie Kamerling, Angela Shijf, Beau van Erven Dorens', NULL, NULL, 2001, 'R', '92 min', 'International', 'While camping in France, Dutch friends Eric and Eddy meet two women. Eric talks to Silke, a medical student in Holland. He tells her about the very erotic book he is writing; we see it in flashbacks.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'DON''T FORGET YOU''RE GOING TO DIE', 'Xavier Beauvois', 'Xavier Beauvois Chiara Mastroianni  Roschdy Zem', NULL, NULL, 1995, 'R', '117 min', 'Drama', 'Benoit has his life planned. But he forgot his military duty. He tries to get out with a psychiatrist, then suicide. He is then told he is HIV positive. Along the way he meets Claudia.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'DIARY OF A CHAMBERMAID', 'Luis Bunuel', 'Jeanne Moreau, Georges Geret, Michel Piccoli', NULL, NULL, 1964, 'PG', '97 min', 'International', 'A true French classic from legendary Oscar winning director Luis Bunuel. Celestine, the chambermaid, has a new job in the country. The Monteils, who she works for are a strange group with many problems and fetishes.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'CLIMAX', 'K Bhavani Shanker', 'G B Rajendra Prasad, Sasha Singh, Pridhvi', NULL, NULL, 2021, '13+', '77 min', 'Comedy, Drama', 'Multimillionaire Vijay Modi, absconding with hundreds of crores of embezzled money is now brutally murdered in an upscale 7 Star hotel Suite room. He spent the previous night with a gorgeous looking , Navya after offering her a crore of rupees. Navya who accepted the offer after her dire needs becomes the prime suspect now.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'BURNT OUT', 'Fabienne Godet', 'Marion Cotillard, Dominique Blanc, Julie Depardieau', NULL, NULL, 2005, 'PG-13', '87 min', 'Drama, International', 'Marion Cotillard leads a stellar cast in this award winning drama. Disheartened after a shocking event that took place in his firm, a compliant and committed employee loses the ground under his feet and revolts.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Blame it On Fidel', 'Julie Gavras', 'Nina Kerval-Bey, Julie Depardieu, Stefano Accorsi', NULL, NULL, 2007, 'PG-13', '99 min', 'Drama', 'A 9-year-old girl weathers big changes in her household as her parents become radical political activists in 1970-71 Paris.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'ALL FIRED UP', 'Jean-Paul Rappeneau', 'Yves Montand, Isabelle Adjan, Lauren Hutton', NULL, NULL, 1982, 'PG-13', '103 min', 'International', 'Victor (Montand) is an absent father and gambler, he comes home in need of money to cover his gambling debts. His daughter thwarts his plans. But when she realizes gangsters are looking for him, her attitude changes.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'A Shot In The Dark', NULL, 'Joaquim de Almeida, Vanessa Mesquita, Filipe Duarte', NULL, NULL, 2013, '18+', '1 min', 'Action', 'A baby is kidnapped in a Brazilian airport. Years later, the mother lives in Lisbon and works in a strip-tease bar so she can survive. When she is fired, she joins a gang of bank robbers...', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'A NIGHT IN VERSAILLES', 'Bruno Podalydes', 'Denis Podalydes Isabelle Candalier Phillipe Uchan', NULL, NULL, 1992, 'PG-13', '45 min', 'Comedy, International', 'Arnaud has planned a quiet, romantic dinner with a pretty woman at his apartment. He is a mild-mannered young man and has charms.His well planned dinner is interrupted by his brother and a group of visitors.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Tru Love', 'Shauna MacDonald, Kate Johnston', 'Shauna MacDonald, Kate Trotter, Christine Horne', NULL, NULL, 2014, '16+', '88 min', 'Arthouse, LGBTQ, Romance', 'A widow, recovering from the death of her husband, comes to the big city to spend time with her busy professional daughter. Instead, she forges and unlikely relationship with a commitment-phobic lesbian who has a past with her daughter.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'The Bid', 'Richard Harris, Maurquis Boone', 'Richard Harris, Maurquis Boone, Carlos Davis, Allen Sherrod, Thomas Ames, Jose Carrasquillo', NULL, NULL, 2021, '18+', '90 min', 'Comedy', 'In this hilarious comedy starring Maurquis Boone and Richard Harris, two Philadelphia rappers gets framed by an overzealous police officer. The duo are sent to prison and are forced to fight the unjust system from behind bars.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Tabù', 'F.W. Murnau', 'Matahi, Anne Chevalier, Bill Bambridge, Hitu', NULL, NULL, 1930, '13+', '78 min', 'Romance', 'On the South Pacific island of Bora Bora, a young couple''s love is threatened when the tribal chief declares the girl a sacred virgin.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Revisitant', 'Jon Binkowski', 'Lisa Enos Smith, Tracy Wiu, Sally Glaner, Jade Rattigan, Michele Sims, Marc Musso', NULL, NULL, 2021, '16+', '100 min', 'Horror', 'A victim plagued with paranormal attacks passes an evil entity on to a single mother and her two teenage daughters.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Remember Pearl Harbor', 'Tim Gray', 'Tom Selleck', NULL, NULL, 2016, '18+', '82 min', 'Documentary', 'Narrated by actor Tom Selleck, Remember Pearl Harbor chronicles the personal stories of veterans and citizens who witnessed the surprise attack by the Japanese on the American Pacific Fleet on December 7, 1941. The film documents the 75th anniversary, the tragic events and the courageous acts of those who were in or near Pearl Harbor on that day.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Red Ribbon Blues (Restored)', 'Charles Winkler', 'Paul Mercurio, Debi Mazar, RuPaul, John Epperson, Lisa Waltz, Leland Orser', NULL, NULL, 1996, '18+', '98 min', 'Comedy, Drama, LGBTQ', 'After attending 23 funerals, Troy and his friends are tired of seeing members of their community dying of AIDS after being denied the medication they need by the big drug companies. The group plans a heist to steal the medication and start a community drug distribution program. Most importantly, these activists pose the question: how far would you go to stay alive?', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Raasi', 'Muraliappas', 'Ajith Kumar, Rambha, Prakash Raj, Vadivelu', NULL, NULL, 1997, 'ALL', '143 min', 'Drama, Romance', 'Kumar, a young man, falls in love with Meena, his uncle''s daughter. Complications come to light when he is unable to shell out enough money for an important occasion.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'One of Her Own', 'Armand Mastroianni', 'Martin Sheen, Lori Loughlin, Greg Evigan, Reginald VelJohnson, Rhoda Griffis', NULL, NULL, 1994, NULL, '88 min', 'Drama', 'Toni Stroud, a trainee police officer, is raped by a colleague. When he''s accused of rape by someone else, she goes to her superiors about it. Instead of taking action against him, they retaliate by firing her, and then close ranks around the rapist. Meanwhile, Toni is subjected to relentless bullying and vandalism. She takes action against the rapist and her former bosses, but will she prevail?', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'My Month with Mrs Potter', 'Christopher Norton', 'Frankie Fairbrass, Jane Hayward, Daisy Tonge', NULL, NULL, 2019, '13+', '88 min', 'Drama', 'Ryan a small time criminal on the run , is caught breaking into a cottage by its owner Mrs Potter; a bitter, unsociable and self isolated old lady, who has just been given a month to live. Although from very different worlds, the two realise they can help each other and agree to spend the month together; it''s a hasty decision that turns into the most extraordinary month of both their lives.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Learning & Early Education For Kids', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2021, 'ALL', '29 min', 'Kids', 'Learn the basics in early learning in a fun and enjoyable way.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Kylie Minogue: Showtime', 'Billy Simpson', 'Ashley Pearson, Dean Piper, Kirsty Tyler, George Kimpson', NULL, NULL, 2016, '7+', '61 min', 'Documentary', 'Kylie Minogue has been a household name for over the last three decades, she is a true showbiz product and an incredibly successful woman. Join Kylie and discover her incredible journey. It is time for Showtime.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Error In Judgement', 'Scott P. Levy', 'Joanna Pacula, Joe Mantegna, Lee Sung Hi, Kate Jackson, Paul Dooley, David Millbern, Jessica Hopper, Michael Sutton, Ric Sarabia, David Parry, Mike Kimmel, Grgoery Daven, Sonia Jackson, Kevin Dailey, Candace Carnicelli', NULL, NULL, 1999, '18+', '93 min', 'Suspense', 'An art dealer''s gallery gets revitalized when he hires a new, energetic young artist. Unknown to him, she is a psychiatric patient of his wife, and this begins to put strain on his marriage as employer and employee grow closer.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Cut the Rope: Om Nom Stories - Holiday Specials', 'Zeptolab', 'Cut the Rope, Om Nom', NULL, NULL, 2021, 'ALL', '48 min', 'Animation, Kids', 'No one loves holidays more than Om Nom, Om Nelle, and Nibble Nom! Get in the holidays mood with this festive compilation: Christmas, Easter, Halloween and more at once!', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Address Unknown', 'Shawn Levy', 'Patrick Renna, Kyle Howard, Corbin Allred, Michael Flynn', NULL, NULL, 1997, 'PG', '83 min', 'Action, Drama, Suspense', '10 years after their fathers'' deaths, two teenagers'' tragic common bond leads to friendship and adventure. Determined to uncover what really happened to their fathers, Matt and Tarra must take on two officials who know the shocking truth.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', '10.0 Earthquake', 'David Gidali', 'Henry Ian Cusick, David Chokachi, Jeffrey Jones, Kristen Dalton, Cameron Richardson', NULL, NULL, 2014, '16+', '87 min', 'Science Fiction', 'Los Angeles is about to be hit by a devastating earthquake, and time is running out to save the city from imminent danger.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Wonder Boy for President', 'John Barker', 'Kagiso Lediga, Ntosh Madlingozi, Tony Miyambo, Thishiwe Ziqubu, John Vlismas, Akin Omotoso, Loyiso Gola, David Kibuuka', NULL, NULL, 2016, '18+', '87 min', 'Drama', '''Wonder Boy for President'' tells the story of Wonder Boy, a charismatic and authoritative young man from the Eastern Cape, who is coerced into running for president by two dubious and corrupt characters. Their aim is to mould him into a great politician and manufacture his downfall at the right time, for the right price.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'What If', 'Michael Dowse', 'Daniel Radcliffe, Mackenzie Davis, Rafe Spall, Zoe Kazan, Adam Driver, Megan Park, Oona Chaplin', NULL, NULL, 2014, 'PG-13', '98 min', 'Comedy, Drama', 'WHAT IF is the story of medical school dropout Wallace (Daniel Radcliffe), who''s been repeatedly burned by bad relationships. So while everyone around him, including his roommate Allan (Adam Driver) seems to be finding the perfect partner (Mackenzie Davis), Wallace decides to put his love life on hold. It is then that he meets Chantry (Zoe Kazan) an animator who lives with her longtime boyfrien..', 'Prime Video'),
