('Movie', 'White Fire', 'Jean-Marie Pallardy', 'Robert Ginty, Belinda Mayne, Fred Williamson', NULL, NULL, 1985, '18+', '102 min', 'Action, Romance, Suspense', 'Jewel thieves Bo & Inga target the legendary ''White Fire'' diamond - a priceless rock so hot it actually burns those who try to lay their hands on it! They undertake an outrageous plan involving plastic surgery and explosives to infiltrate the mine where the diamond awaits. But the plan hits an unexpected snag with the arrival of smooth-talking badass Noah Barclay.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Triassic Hunt', 'Gerald Rascionato', 'Michael Pare, Linnea Quigley, Ramiro Leal, Kristie Krueger', NULL, NULL, 2021, '16+', '87 min', 'Action, Science Fiction', 'When two dinosaurs break out of a lab and attack an industrial park, a ragtag group of mercenaries is called in to contain the creatures before they decimate the park and escape into the world.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'The Teacher', 'Rambabu Muddapu', 'V R k Rao, Chinni Krishna, V Meena Kumari, P V Sindhu, Swapna, Latha, Ravikishore, Srinivas', NULL, NULL, 2021, '13+', '63 min', 'Drama', 'We should pickup good from the bad,that''s what the life has taught in the present Scenario.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'South Sea Adventures - A Colorful Dramatized Travelogue Featuring the Pacific Islands', 'Carl Dudley, Richard Goldstone, Frances D. Lyon, Walter Thompson', 'Orson Welles, Numerous Islanders, Don the Beachcomber, Diane Beardmore, Tommy Zahn, Marlene Lizzio, Kay Johnson', NULL, NULL, 1958, '7+', '116 min', 'Drama', 'A multifaceted 1958 dramatization that has us traveling across the various lands that make up the Pacific Islands, starting in Hawaii, & ending in Australia. For those who haven''t had the privilege of exploring the South Sea islands & their people for themselves, this is certainly the next best thing. The film not only take us on a journey, but also acts as a time capsule, & trip to the past.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Life With Father - A Restored Color Classic with William Powell & Elizabeth Taylor', 'Michael Curtiz', 'William Powell, Elizabeth Taylor, Irene Dunne, Edmund Gwenn, Jimmy Lydon, Zasu Pitts', NULL, NULL, 1947, '13+', '118 min', 'Action, Comedy, Drama', 'The story is simple: William Powell and his wife, played by Irene Dunne, face a series of calamities, some serious and some ridiculous, mostly brought on by their four rambunctious, red-headed sons. After a visiting cousin brings along sixteen-year-old Elizabeth Taylor, events are put into motion which threaten to turn Powell''s neatly-ordered world as a father upside down.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Kasak', 'K. Bapaiah', 'Neelam Kothari, Rishi kapoor, Kader Khan, Laxmikant Berde', NULL, NULL, 1991, '13+', '142 min', 'Drama, Romance', 'Divya loved Suraj who is now no more she marries Vijay for the sake of her family and plans to divorce him soon but will Vijay agree to her terms.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Joe & Joe', 'David Wall', 'David Wysocki, Sean Patrick Brennan, Tracy Griffith', NULL, NULL, 1996, '13+', '79 min', 'Arts, Entertainment, and Culture, Comedy, Suspense', 'Joe and Joe are two like-able losers living in Cape Cod who mow lawns for a living, but their equipment it quite antiquated. Their lives change one day when a mysterious women appears and tells them about a lost treasure, the values of which could easily buy them some new lawn mowing equipment.', 'Prime Video'),
