('Movie', 'Abhijan', 'Satyajit Ray', 'Waheeda Rehman, Soumitra Chatterjee, Ruma Guha Thakurta, Rabi Ghosh, Shekhar Chatterjee, Gyanesh Mukherjee, Ajit Bandyopadhyay', NULL, NULL, 1962, '13+', '136 min', 'Drama', 'The story revolves around a taxi driver, Narsingh, who attempts to reinvent his life by visiting his native place, but instead gets embroiled in Sukharam''s smuggling and human trafficking business.', 'Prime Video'),
