('Movie', 'This World Won''t Break', 'Josh David Jordan', 'Greg Schroeder, Matthew Posey, Roxanna Redfoot', NULL, NULL, 2020, '16+', '149 min', 'Drama', 'A Texas troubadour yearns to be remembered like the Southern bluesmen before him, but his failings and self-doubt forestall his musical dreams and blind him to the open road.', 'Prime Video'),
('TV Show', 'Mother''s Love', NULL, 'Darya Plakhtiy, Taras Tsymbalyuk, Pyotr Rykov, Anastasia Bunina', NULL, NULL, 2021, '18+', '1 Season', 'Drama', 'Masha Sorokina is happy - Sergey, a man she loves, proposes her to marry him. But Sergey''s mother, wealthy and haughty Margarita, believes that a regular girl who has grown up in an orphanage is not worthy of her only beloved son! She will find out the secret Masha has been keeping for many years and declare a merciless war on her!', 'Prime Video'),
