('Movie', 'The Magnetic Monster - One of the best 50''s Sci-Fi Movies', 'Curt Siodmak', 'Richard Carlson, King Donovan, Jean Byron, Byron Foulger', NULL, NULL, 1953, '13+', '75 min', 'Drama, Horror, Science Fiction', 'For many, this "B" film succeeds on all levels & was made for an adult audience...For some, it''s considered schlock! One of the few 50''s Sci-Fi films to show the nuclear radiation problem realistically. Dated now,, but an effective, well-written thriller. The star of "It Came From Outer Space," Creature From The Black Lagoon" & other classics. Richard Carlson gives another fine performance.', 'Prime Video'),
