('Movie', 'One too much school, the kidnapping of the victor', 'Cris Gomes, Monik Macedo, Tininha Araujo', 'Bruna Rauta, Larissa Maria, Helena Strada, Fernando Sampaio', NULL, NULL, 2019, '13+', '46 min', 'Action', 'After the sale of the Blessed school, Vitor tries to start his life over and takes a vacation at his cousin''s house. Arriving there mysteriously, Vitor disappears without leaving any traces. The worried residents of the house then decided to look for clues to Vitor''s whereabouts. Danilo, leads this fun and trap-filled quest, this adventure that will move the kids.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'NAPULIONE remastered', 'Alessandro Derviso', 'Danilo Rovani, Arduino Speranza', NULL, NULL, 2021, '18+', '58 min', 'Action', 'Two nice Neapolitan policemen, must defeat a gang of Russian criminals, led by an unusual boss, with a passion for Neapolitan sayings.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Murder Bury Win', 'Michael Lovan', 'Mikelen Walker, Erich Lane, Henry Alexander Kelly, Craig Cackowski, Brian Slaten, Michael Lovan, Jake Neri, Amy Everson, Melissa Lagosh', NULL, NULL, 2021, '18+', '91 min', 'Comedy, Horror, Suspense', 'After a famous game creator drops dead in a suspicious freak accident, three aspiring game designers must turn to their game for guidance. The premise of their game? How to murder someone... and get rid of the body.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Maussan''s UFO Files', 'Darcy Weir', 'Jaime Maussan, Darcy Weir', NULL, NULL, 2021, '13+', '70 min', 'Drama, Science Fiction', 'This film follows the incredible story of Jaime Maussan and his pursuit in the main stream journalism field to uncover the truth about UFOs internationally. Watch his story unfold as we recount his rise as a journalist covering controversial Mexican UFO events.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Lilith', 'Alexander T. Hwang', 'VERNON WELLS, FELISSA ROSE, THOMAS HALEY, BRIALYNN MASSIE, MICHAEL WAINWRIGHT, CHARLES CHUDABALA, HUNTER JOHNSON, MICHAEL JON MURPHY, JENNIFER NANGLE, COLTON WHEELER', NULL, NULL, 2021, '16+', '83 min', 'Horror', 'Lilith could have been the first woman of humanity but, instead, she was expelled from heaven and doomed forever for opposing the patriarchal system of the kingdom of heaven. Now she is back - with her servants and her thirst for vengeance to destroy the order created by God and the Devil.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Lemon', 'Janicza Bravo', 'Brett Gelman, Judy Greer, Michael Cera, Nia Long, Shiri Appleby, Fred Melamed, Rhea Perlman, David Paymer, Gillian Jacobs, Martin Starr, Megan Mullally, Jeff Garlin, Marla Gibbs', NULL, NULL, 2017, '16+', '83 min', 'Comedy', 'Lemon: a person or thing that proves to be defective, imperfect, or unsatisfactory. Isaac Lachmann is a lemon. His career is going nowhere. His girlfriend of ten years is leaving him. Isaac Lachmann now just watches as his life unravels.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Last Shift', 'Anthony DiBlasi', 'Juliana Harkavy, Joshua Mikel, J. LaRose', NULL, NULL, 2015, 'R', '88 min', 'Horror', 'Rookie police officer Jessica Loren [Juliana Harkavy - "The Walking Dead"] is assigned the last shift at a closing police station. Jessica comes to learn that it''s home to the ultimate embodiment of evil and his devoted followers.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Jump Into the Void', 'Daniel Calparsoro', 'Najwa Nimri, Roberto Chalu', NULL, NULL, 1995, '18+', '83 min', 'Action', 'Alex is a 20 year old girl that keeps financially all her family through illegal arms trafficking, always with the risk of dying or killing. She''s the only girl on a men''s group, torn between his need to love and a life based on violence.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Iris', 'Albert Maysles', 'Iris Apfel, Carl Apfel', NULL, NULL, 2015, 'PG-13', '80 min', 'Documentary', 'From legendary late 88-year-old documentarian Albert Maysles (GREY GARDENS, GIMME SHELTER), comes IRIS. Iris Apfel, is the 93-year-old style maven who has had an outsized presence on the New York fashion scene for decades.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'I Am Love (English Subtitled)', 'Luca Guadagnino', 'Tilda Swinton,  Flavio Parenti,  Edoardo Gabbriellini,  Alba Rohrwacher', NULL, NULL, 2010, 'R', '119 min', 'Drama, International', 'At the heart of the wealthy Recchi family is Tancredi Recchi''s wife Emma (Tilda Swinton), whose existence is shocked to the core when she embarks on a passionate love affair that will change her family forever.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Hot Dog', 'Torsten Künstler', 'Til Schweiger, Matthias Schweighofer, Leigh Gill', NULL, NULL, 2021, '16+', '106 min', 'Action, Comedy', 'When an ambassador''s daughter is kidnapped, two elite officers must join forces to track her down. Despite their differences the two men are partnered up and must work together to find the missing girl.', 'Prime Video'),
('TV Show', 'Funny Little Stories', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2021, '16+', '1 Season', 'Comedy', 'The Covid-19 pandemic is the driving force behind borderline situations experienced in the 5 episodes of the series. Loneliness, claustrophobia, desire, jealousy, fear, unemployment and a thirst for life spur the characters in confinement. Recorded without any direct contact between the team and the actors, the series relies on movie magic to provide the audience with clever entertainment.', 'Prime Video'),
('TV Show', 'Fallout', NULL, 'Mark Mitchell, Ian Mune', NULL, NULL, 2000, '13+', '1 Season', 'TV Shows', 'A 2 x 2 hour mini-series based on events surrounding the 1984 snap election in New Zealand.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Enna Satham Indha Neram', 'Guru Ramesh', 'M. Raja, Nithin Sathya, N. Puralavan, Maanu, Malavika Wales', NULL, NULL, 2014, '7+', '95 min', 'Drama', 'Speech and hearing impaired quadruplets go on an excursion to a zoo. Driven by excitement, the four children lose their way, and a dangerous python, on the loose, threatens their safety.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Dangerous Moves', 'Richard Dembo', 'Michel Piccoli, Alexandre Arbatt, Liv Ullmann, Leslie Caron, Wojciech Pszoniak', NULL, NULL, 1984, '16+', '101 min', 'Drama, Suspense', 'Aging Soviet chess champion Akiva Liebskind arrives in Geneva to face off against his former student Pavius Fromm in a World Championship match. Pavius is a defector from the USSR, and the Soviet authorities threaten to harm Akiva''s family if he does not defeat the rogue player. Determined to shame Pavius, the government brings the wife he left behind to the game.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'COD(Cash On Delivery)', 'Robert Megha', 'Jatin Negi, Preeti Choudhury, Vikrant Khaire, Arjun Gopal Marwal, Devendra Bhagat, Deepak Ogale, Vaibhav Kumbhar, Sanjiv Landage, Naveen Sequeira, Akshay Lohakpure, Omi Kashyap, Amrish Majumdar, Amar Dixit, Christopher R. Watson, Kajal Singh', NULL, NULL, 2021, '13+', '130 min', 'Comedy, Drama', 'COD is a story about a jobless artist who hijacks an abandoned taxi. His mission is to deliver the taxi and get some Cash on Delivery. A Passion Movies presentation.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Caim', 'Jonathan Trumble', 'Halle Beversluis, Jonathan Trumble, Harrison Brousseau, Clara Mae Fields, Nathan Sachritz, Sydney Bramlett, Holden Gilkey, Jill Adler', NULL, NULL, 2021, '18+', '84 min', 'Drama, Horror, Suspense', 'A girl wakes up in a chair knowing nothing about her current predicament, nor what led up to it. Through memories and visions she comes to a resolution, but a grim one.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Black and White in Color', 'Jean-Jacques Annaud', 'Jean Carmet, Jacques Dufilho, Catherine Rouvel, Jacques Spiesser, Maurice Barrier', NULL, NULL, 1976, 'PG', '92 min', 'Action, Comedy, Drama', 'French colonists in Africa find themselves at war with their German neighbors. Deciding that they must do their proper duty and fight the Germans, they promptly conscript the local native population. A young, idealistic French geographer seems to be the only rational person in the town, and he takes over control of the war after several bungles on the part of the others.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'BHAKSHAKARU (Kannada)', 'Antony Varghese', 'Chemban Vinod Jose, Santhy Balachandran, Sabumon Abdusamad, Jaffar Idukki', NULL, NULL, 2019, '13+', '95 min', 'Action', 'BHAKSHAKARU is a 2021 Indian Kannada Dubbed (Jallikattu 2019 film) independent action film directed by Lijo Jose Pellissery with a screenplay by S. Hareesh and R. Jayakumar, The event are set off when a butcher''s buffalo breaks free and runs amok. It was selected as the Indian entry for the Best International Feature Film at the 93rd Academy Awardsaction', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Angels Die Hard!', 'Richard Compton', 'Will Smith, Tom Baker', NULL, NULL, 1970, '16+', '84 min', 'Action, Drama', 'Members of a motorcycle gang swear revenge after one of their number is killed in a backwater California town.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'A New Husband for Christmas', 'Derrick C. Mullen', 'Keyona Bledsoe, Freddie T. Cole Jr., Tamika Foggie, Benjamin J. Jones, Lauren Cowan, Kanisha Gross', NULL, NULL, 2020, '13+', '104 min', 'Comedy, Romance, Special Interest', 'Stan and Kelly Stevenson seem to be more committed to growing apart rather than growing together. Their friends are caught in the middle of divorce conversations during one of the most joyous seasons of the year.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'A Mother''s Escape', 'Blair Hayes', 'Tara Buck, Damon Carney, Larry Jack Dotson, Beth Grant, Spencer Mabrey', NULL, NULL, 2017, '18+', '93 min', 'Suspense', 'The only good thing in Murel''s life is her son Kipp. Murel is determined to protect her son, including spiriting him away from her second husband Tommy, whose drinking and abuse has gotten out of control for the last time. When she discovers that Tommy has reported Kipp''s disappearance as an abduction, Murel finds herself on the wrong side of the law.', 'Prime Video'),
('TV Show', 'Thus Spoke Kishibe Rohan', NULL, 'Issey Takahashi, Marie Iitoyo, Tomoya Nakamura', NULL, NULL, 2020, '16+', '1 Season', 'Comedy, Drama', 'He''s a manga artist with the power to change other people''s life stories – but trouble has a particular way of finding him. Adapted from the popular anime series: JoJo''s Bizarre Adventure.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Run For The Sun', 'Roy Boulting', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1956, '7+', '99 min', 'Action', 'An author and a magazine writer crash in the Mexican jungle and find themselves the subject of a deadly game of cat-and-mouse.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Mr.Bharath', 'S. P. Muthuraman', 'Rajnikanth, Sathyaraj, Ambika, Sharada, Raghuvaran, Goundamani, Viji', NULL, NULL, 1986, '13+', '141 min', 'Action, Drama', 'Businessman Gopinath abandons Shanti, his first love, to marry a rich heiress. Later, Bharath, Gopinath and Shanti''s illegitimate son, seeks revenge from him for the injustice meted out to his mother.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Milgram and the Fastwalkers 2', 'Richard Cutting', 'Richard Cutting, Colleen Zenk, Tuck Milligan, Patricia Mizen', NULL, NULL, 2019, '13+', '120 min', 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'The sequel to the hit alien suspense film features Milgram being drawn deeper into the conspiracy as the extraterrestrials show themselves and reveal their plan.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Grapes on a Vine', 'Alfred Robbins', 'Gregory Alan Wiiliams, Jazsmin Lewis, Dwayne Boyd', NULL, NULL, 2008, '18+', '80 min', 'Drama, Romance', 'Kyle is the art director at the High Museum in Atlanta Georgia. He wants two things in life, a male child and a van Gogh painting valued at 275,000. His wife Brandy cannot conceive so he plans a camping trip where he will have her killed and hung to make it look like a racially motivated killing so he can collect the 500,00 insurance policy which will enable him to get what he wants.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Cypress Under Water', 'Mohammadali Bashe Ahangar', 'Babak Hamidian, Mina Saadati, Reza Behboodi, Masoud Raygan, Homayoun Ershadi, Shahram Haghighat Doost, Mahtab Nasirpour', NULL, NULL, 2018, '13+', '109 min', 'Drama', 'Does Jahanbakhsh Keramat''s secret reveal? This secret will dishevel the sleep of Chista, Mahrou, Goudarz, Bahram, Jahangir, and Major Poshias. Jahanbakhsh goes on a long trip to prove his innocence...', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'You Can''t Say No', 'Paul Kramer', 'Marguerite Moreau, Hamish Linklater, Hus Miller', NULL, NULL, 2019, '18+', '91 min', 'Comedy', 'Days before signing divorce papers, a couple give their relationship one final shot by playing a game - no matter what they ask of each other, they can''t say no.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Willow (Plus Bonus Features)', 'Ron Howard', 'Val Kilmer, Joanne Whalley, Warwick Davis, Patricia Hayes, Gavan O''Herlihy, Phil Fondacaro, Pat Roach, Rick Overton, Kevin Pollak, Billy Barty, Jean Marsh, David Steinberg, Tony Cox, Robert Gillibrand, Mark Northover, Maria Holvöe, Julie Peters, Mark Vande Brake, Dawn Downing, Michael Cotterill, Zulema Dene, Joanna Dickens, Jennifer Guy, Ron Tarr, Sallyanne Law, Ruth Greenfield, Kate Greenfield', NULL, NULL, 1987, 'PG', '207 min', 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Willow is a timeless fantasy tale where heroes come in all sizes. Filled with magic and danger it is the ultimate story of good versus evil.', 'Prime Video'),
('TV Show', 'Wildfire', NULL, 'Genevieve Padalecki, Nicole Tubiola, Nana Visitor, Greg Serano, Micah Alberti, James Read, Ryan Sypek, Andrew Hoeft, Dennis Weaver', NULL, NULL, 2008, 'TV-14', '1 Season', 'Drama', 'In the Final Season, Kris once again is needed to rescue Raintree while her relationship with Junior takes an unexpected turn. With her future hanging in the balance, will Kris leave Raintree for a new project? Will she get to one last ride with Wildfire? Don''t miss the final 13 episodes of Wildfire!', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Whirlwind', 'John English', 'Gene Autry, Champion, Gail Davis', NULL, NULL, 1951, '7+', '70 min', 'Special Interest, Western', 'Gene Autry arrives in Red Bluff to work on the investigation of mail robberies. U.S. Bonds are stolen, and Smiley finds burned fragments of them. A henchman confesses who the guilty party is.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'We', 'Mani Nasry', 'Mani Nasry, Humberly Gonzalez, Shiva Negar, Cory Lee, Sera-Lys McArthur, Shoshana Wilder, Anita La Selva, Lara Daans, Joan Gregson, Marcia Bennett', NULL, NULL, 2021, '7+', '86 min', 'Action, Drama', 'In the pursuit of love and happiness, Mani Nasry known as Ethan in the film meets obstacles that threaten to halt his quest. Dating within different cultures and being open to all religions, Ethan must deal with constant roadblocks. From First Nations to South American, his journey to find love in Toronto is nothing but complex. He faces discrimination and depression but always remains optimistic.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Water For Elephants', 'Francis Lawrence', 'Reese Witherspoon, Robert Pattinson, Christoph Waltz, Hal Holbrook', NULL, NULL, 2011, 'PG-13', '120 min', 'Action', 'HD. An old man recalls his unforgettable experience working in a Depression-era circus in this stirring adaptation of the bestseller.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Warrior Queen', 'Chuck Vincent', 'Sybil Danning, Donald Pleasence, Rick Hill, Josephine Jacqueline Jones, Tally Chanel, Samantha Fox, Suzanna Smith, David Brandon, Mario Cruciani, Marco Tullio Cau', NULL, NULL, 1987, 'R', '70 min', 'Drama', 'Drama directed by Chuck Vincent, starring Sybil Danning and Donald Pleasence. In ancient Pompeii, the kindhearted Roman emperor''s wife works secretly to help slaves escape their harsh lives as non-stop cleaners and sex objects. As the queen gets more and more involved in her quest for equality she puts her own life at risk.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Venom Coast', 'Michael Fredianelli', 'Anthony Jan Potter, Carolyn Compton, Kelly Ann Dunn, Kylie Brady', NULL, NULL, 2021, '16+', '93 min', 'Horror', 'A group of friends is stalked by a family of killers on a vintage cruise ship.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Uyarndha Manithan', 'Krishnan-Panju', 'Sivaji Ganesan, Sowcar Janaki, S. A. Ashokan, Major Sundarrajan, Manorama', NULL, NULL, 1968, 'ALL', '162 min', 'Drama', 'Uyarndha Manithan is Tamil Emotional Drama Film. Sivaji and Ashokan are close friends. Sivaji loves and marries Vanishri who belongs to lower caste. Sivaji''s dad kills Vanishri and her dad by firing their home. He also blackmails Sivaji to marry Sowcar Janaki. Sivaji marries Sowcar Janaki and lives his life thinking about Vanishri.', 'Prime Video'),
('TV Show', 'Thomas & Friends 18, 19, 20, 21', NULL, 'Joseph May', NULL, 'August 1, 2021', 2017, 'TV-Y', '4 Seasons', 'Animation, Kids', 'Thomas and Friends are back in series 21 for another fun-filled series of railway adventures. Terence the Tractor runs into problems on a frozen pond. Gordon and Spencer take off with each other''s coaches, causing confusion and delay. Poor Toby has to work with a new coach that loves to go fast. And Cranky learns that two cranes are better than one when new crane Carly arrives at Brendam Docks.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'The World''s Oldest Living Bridesmaid', 'Joseph L. Scanlan', 'Donna Mills, Brian Wimmer, Winston Rekert, Art Hindle, Laura Press', NULL, NULL, 1990, 'ALL', '94 min', 'Drama', 'A perpetually single woman falls in love with a much-younger man and soon has to reconcile dating someone not only younger, but also less established than herself.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'The Swing', 'Percy Adlon', 'Anja Jaenicke, Lena Stolze, Joachim Bernhard', NULL, NULL, 1983, '16+', '133 min', 'Drama', 'The life of 3 sisters in Munich before the First World War. Based on the book by Annette Kolb.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'The Russia House', 'Fred Schepisi', 'Sean Connery, Michelle Pfeiffer', NULL, NULL, 1990, 'R', '123 min', 'Drama, Suspense', 'Alcoholic book editor from a bargain basement publishing house in Great Britain, "Barley" Scott Blair, would rather be drinking in Lisbon than attending a book dealers'' show in Russia. To his surprise, his boozy holiday ends early when a CIA agent pays him a visit. His objectives: to assess new Russia''s involvements in the old Cold War and to verify the authenticity of the notebooks found.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'The Old West', 'George Archainbaud', 'Gene Autry, Champion, Gail Davis', NULL, NULL, 1952, '7+', '62 min', 'Special Interest, Western', 'Gene Autry tames and sells wild horses to a stagecoach line. His only competitor ambushes and shoots Gene, who is nursed back to health. A wild stagecoach race to test Gene''s horses is arranged.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'The Lair of the White Worm', 'Ken Russell', 'Hugh Grant, Amanda Donohoe, Catherine Oxenberg', NULL, NULL, 1988, 'R', '93 min', 'Comedy, Horror', 'After a mysterious skull is unearthed, it''s stolen and used by its new owner to worship a pagan god who hungers for the taste of virginal flesh in this cheeky horror-comedy.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'The Golden Child', 'Michael Ritchie', 'Eddie Murphy, J. L. Reate, Charles Dance', NULL, NULL, 1986, 'PG-13', '93 min', 'Adventure', 'A detective must find a kid wanted by dark forces.', 'Prime Video'),
('TV Show', 'The Bronx Bunny Show', NULL, 'Mick O''Hara, Ciaran Morrison, Kelly Carlson, Steve Schirripa', NULL, NULL, 2007, 'TV-PG', '1 Season', 'Comedy', 'Bronx Bunny and Teddy T host a talk show from their home in East LA.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Thai Pirandhal Vazhi Pirakkum', 'A. K. Velan', 'S. S. Rajendran, M. N. Rajam, Prem Nazir, Rajasulochana, V. K. Ramasamy', NULL, NULL, 1958, 'ALL', '139 min', 'Drama', 'Thai Piranthal Vazhi Pirakkum is a Tamil Emotional Family Drama. Prem Nazir is a doctor and son of V.K.Ramasamy who gives much importance to money. V.K.Ramasamy doesn''t like S.S.Rajendran as he supports farmers. Rajasulochana is S.S.Rajendran''s sister. Her marriage gets stopped and S.S.Rajendran goes to jail because of V.K.Ramasamy. The rest of the story is how S.S.Rajendran avenges V.K.Ramasamy.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Something Wild (1986)', 'Jonathan Demme', 'Jeff Daniels, Melanie Griffith, Tracey Walter, Dana Preu, Jack Gilpin, John Waters, Ray Liotta, John Sayles', NULL, NULL, 1986, 'R', '114 min', 'Comedy', 'A budding yuppie business executive in New York City gets picked up by a sexy, wacked out woman. They spend a wild weekend together. She cons him into posing as her husband. They visit her mom, attend her high school reunion, and have a violent run-in with her ex-husb- band, a psycho con just out of jail.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Snake Eater', 'George Erschbamer', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1989, 'R', '95 min', 'Action', 'A former marine embarks on a mission to rescue his kidnapped sister.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Six Weeks', 'Tony Bill', 'Dudley Moore, Mary Tyler Moore, Katherine Healy, Shannon Wilcox, Bill Calvert', NULL, NULL, 1982, 'PG', '108 min', 'Drama', 'In this heart-warming drama, a terminally ill young girl strives to bring together her wealthy mother (Mary Tyler Moore) and a California politician (Dudley Moore), fulfilling her dream of having a family during the last six weeks of her life.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Sivappu Malli', 'Rama Narayanan', 'Vijayakanth, Chandrashekar, Shanthi Krishna, S.S. Chandran', NULL, NULL, 1981, '18+', '127 min', 'Action, Drama', 'Sivappu Malli is a Tamil Action Film. Vijayakanth and Chandrashekar are honest factory workers who lead the fight against the Factory owner for the labourer''s rights. The clash between the two sections of society reaches a level where S.S. Chandran and gang plot to eliminate Vijayakanth and Chandasekhar. They manage to do away with Chandrashekar; however Vijayakanth is too smart for them.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Sideways', 'Alexander Payne', 'Paul Giamatti, Sandra Oh, Thomas Haden Church, Virginia Madsen, Marylouise Burke, Jessica Hecht, Missy Doty, M.C. Gainey, Patrick Gallagher, Alex Kalognomos, Joe Marinelli, Alysia Reiner, M. C. Gainey', NULL, NULL, 2004, 'R', '127 min', 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'A struggling writer and his has-been actor best friend get into all kinds of trouble when they embark on a wine tasting tour prior to the best friend''s wedding.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Server Sundaram', 'Krishnan-Panju', 'Nagesh, R. Muthuraman, K. R. Vijaya, Major Sundarrajan, Manorama', NULL, NULL, 1964, 'ALL', '159 min', 'Comedy, Drama', 'Nagesh plays the lead role in the movie. Nagesh lives a contended life of a waiter with his mother. He falls in love with K.R.Vijaya who comes frequently to the hotel he works but K.R.vijaya is not interested. Nagesh ventures into movies with the help of his friend Muthuraman. The rest of the movie is about how he excels in movies and whether he gets his ladylove.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Separate Lives', 'David Madden', 'James Belushi, Linda Hamilton, Vera Miles, Elisabeth Moss', 'United States', NULL, 1995, 'R', '102 min', 'Drama, Suspense', 'When a murder detective (James Belushi) is asked by an attractive psychology professor to watch over her, he becomes aware of her split personality. Despite a seemingly dark side to her character, he begins to develop feelings for her, even choosing to ignore signs that point to her as a suspect in a murder case.', 'Prime Video');
