('Movie', 'Saturday The 13th', 'Ogundoju Ojo, Musa Raji DOP', 'Kemi Komolafe, Jacob Moses, Marilyn Okhonfo, Temitope Faturoti, Ogundoju Ojo Opeyemi, Adeyinka Adesida, Precious Akintade, Funmilayo  Adesida, Meroyi Olamide, Bolanle Faloye', NULL, NULL, 2021, '13+', '57 min', 'Action, Drama', 'Amarachi the daughter of a medicine man and her friend was killed during an attempted rape. The father invoked the spirit of the daughter to avenge the death of the daughter and replace dead bodies of the daughter and the friend with bodies of the men that was responsible for their death.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Sanctuary', 'Reid Nicewonder', 'Alexandra Willers, Michael Andrew Scott, Blake Logan, Fedor Steer, Shanna McLaughlin', NULL, NULL, 2021, '18+', '85 min', 'Horror, Science Fiction, Suspense', 'Four people in a high rise condo fight for their lives against a malevolent force that seeks to destroy them. But when a mysterious being in a familiar body finds them, the group discovers what''s truly at stake.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Rollerball (1975)', 'Norman Jewison', 'James Caan, John Houseman, Ralph Richardson, Maud Adams, John Beck, Moses Gunn, Pamela Hensley', NULL, NULL, 1975, 'R', '125 min', 'Action, Adventure', 'James Caan stars as a rollerball champ in this fast-hitting, action- packed glimpse of a future where a brutal, no-holds-barred sport takes the place of war, and murder is just part of the game.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Ring of Fire II: Blood and Steel', 'Richard W. Munchkin', 'Maria Ford, Vince Murdocco, Don Wilson', NULL, NULL, 1993, 'R', '97 min', 'Action, Drama', 'A martial-arts fighter battles murderous gang members and the henchmen of an evil underground fighting champion to save his girlfriend.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Ran (1985)', 'Akira Kurosawa', 'Tatsuya Nakadi, Akira Terao, Jinpachi Nezu, Daisuke Ryu, Mieko Harada, Hitoshi Ueki', NULL, NULL, 1985, 'R', '154 min', 'Action, Drama', 'Akira Kurosawa retells Shakespeare''s classic tragedy King Lear against a samurai backdrop. Lord Hidetora is a warlord who transfers his kingdom to his eldest son. A power struggle ensues, incited by his two disinherited younger sons.', 'Prime Video'),
