('Movie', 'The Rocket', 'Richard Blake', 'Brady Tutton, Richard Blake, Dawn Holt Lauber, Carl Ciske', NULL, NULL, 2020, '7+', '87 min', 'Drama, Sports', 'With grand expectations from his father and the local community, a high school football star''s entire future is suddenly lost, and he must find a new way to push towards greatness.', 'Prime Video'),
