('Movie', 'Dirty Dirty Jokes', 'Peter Robert', 'Andrew Dice Clay, Redd Foxx, Denny Johnston, Jackie Martling, Robert Schimmel', NULL, NULL, 1993, 'R', '59 min', 'Comedy', 'A stand-up concert featuring six of the most hilarious comedians around. Hosted by Redd Foxx, the topic of the evening is sex in all of its funny forms. Not for the easily offended!', 'Prime Video'),
