('Movie', 'Can''t Cut It', 'Franky Okamura', 'Shijimi, Franky Okamura, Naoki Kondo', NULL, NULL, 2021, '13+', '23 min', 'Arthouse, Horror, Romance', 'Chiharu, who lives alone in a slightly outdated apartment, is about to pass the age for marriage, but she can''t stop having an affair with Hiroki. One day, Noriko, Hiroki''s wife, visits Chiharu''s room alone and asks her to leave her husband. Chiharu does not respond. And Hiroki also visits Chiharu''s room as usual.　Selected for the Japan Art Center 12th Movie Grand Prix.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Blippi''s School Supply Scavenger Hunt', NULL, 'Clayton Grimm', NULL, NULL, 2021, 'ALL', '39 min', 'Kids', 'Blippi is an educational kids show tailored for children of 2-5 years. In this Back to School special, Blippi embarks on an amazing Back To School Adventure! Join Blippi in the scavenger hunt for school supplies in this educational kids video! This episode is starring Clayton Grimm as Blippi.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'Beate', 'Samad Zarmandili', 'Donatella Finocchiaro, Paolo Pierobon, Lucia Sardo', NULL, NULL, 2021, '18+', '94 min', 'Comedy, Drama', 'In this timely and relevant story of revolt against greed and apathy for the working class, a group of Italian lingerie factory workers take matters into their own hands after discovering their boss''s plot to lay them off and export the jobs to Serbia. The workers must form an unlikely alliance with nuns in a nearby convent when they both discover they each have a common enemy.', 'Prime Video'),
('TV Show', 'Bakugan Battle Brawlers', NULL, 'Scott McCord, Jason Deline, Julie Lemieux', NULL, 'September 9, 2021', 2009, 'TV-PG', '1 Season', 'Animation, Anime, Kids', 'Join Dan and his friends as they battle their Bakugan Brawlers to save Vestroia and Earth, and to restore peace throughout the two dimensions.', 'Prime Video'),
('TV Show', 'All Or Nothing: Toronto Maple Leafs', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2021, 'TV-14', '1 Season', 'Sports', 'The first of the All or Nothing franchise to follow an NHL team, the docu-series brings fans closer to the Toronto Maple Leafs organization than ever before, with cameras capturing every moment during the 104th NHL regular season and playoffs.', 'Prime Video'),
