('Movie', 'After Miss Julie', 'Patrick Marber', 'Geraldine Somerville, Phil Daniels, Kathy Burke', NULL, NULL, 1995, '18+', '78 min', 'Arts, Entertainment, and Culture, Drama, Young Adult Audience', 'An updated version of Strindberg''s play examining class and social differences. Julie, the daughter of an MP, seduces her father''s chauffeur, despite his being engaged to the maid.', 'Prime Video'),
('Movie', 'A War', 'Tobias Lindholm', 'Pilou Asbæk, Tuva Novotny, Søren Malling, Dar Salim, Dulfi Al-Jabouri', 'Denmark, France', NULL, 2016, 'R', '115 min', 'Drama, International', 'Company commander Claus Pedersen and his men are stationed in Afghanistan. During a mission, the soldiers are caught in heavy crossfire and in order to save his men, Claus makes a decision that has grave consequences for him and his family back home.', 'Prime Video'),
