('TV Show', 'Big Freedia: Queen of Bounce', NULL, 'Big Freedia', NULL, 'September 10, 2021', 2016, 'TV-14', '1 Season', 'Documentary, Special Interest, Unscripted', 'Get in Formation because the critically acclaimed series Big Freedia: The Queen of bounce is back for an electrifying Fifth Season!', 'Prime Video'),
