('Movie', 'Stage Fright', 'magnolia', 'Minnie Driver, Meat Loaf Aday', NULL, NULL, 2014, 'R', '88 min', 'Arthouse, Arts, Entertainment, and Culture, Horror', 'In this genre-bending musical comedy, a starry-eyed teenager stuck in the kitchen of a snobby performing arts camp dreams of Broadway. She sneaks into an audition and lands the lead role. But just as rehearsals begin, blood starts to spill.', 'Prime Video'),
