('Movie', 'Mike Epps: Under Rated, Never Faded & X-Rated', 'Marcus Raboy', 'Mike Epps, Doug E. Fresh', NULL, NULL, 2021, '18+', '69 min', 'Comedy', 'The devilishly handsome and raucously funny comic Mike Epps takes the stage in his funniest ever stand-up comedy special. Epps has a knack for the absurd and his commentary on culture and young life is hilarious. Mike Epps showcases his comic versatility, charisma, endless supply of jokes and delivers non-stop laughter. Features a special appearance by Doug E. Fresh.', 'Prime Video'),
('TV Show', 'MI HISTORIA', NULL, 'Juanes, Mon Laferte, Nicky Jam, Ozuna, Residente', NULL, NULL, 2021, 'TV-NR', '1 Season', 'Music Videos and Concerts', 'Amazon Music presenta una serie biográfica sobre tus artistas favoritos de la música Latina.', 'Prime Video'),
