('TV Show', 'Wu-Tang: An American Saga', NULL, NULL, 'United States', 'September 8, 2021', 2019, 'TV-MA', '2 Seasons', 'Black Stories, Drama', 'EMMY® NOMINATED Wu-Tang: An American Saga is inspired by “The Wu-Tang Manual” and “Tao of Wu”, and based on the true story of the Wu-Tang Clan. Set in early ’90s New York at the height of the crack cocaine epidemic, the show tracks the Clan’s formation, a vision of Bobby Diggs aka The RZA, who strives to unite a dozen young, black men that are torn between music and crime but eventually rise to become the unlikeliest of American success stories.', 'Hulu'),
