('Movie', '30 Minutes or Less', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'August 1, 2021', 2011, 'R', '82 min', 'Action, Adventure, Comedy', 'In 30 Minutes or Less, a small town pizza delivery guy is kidnapped and forced to rob a bank in mere hours by two wanna-be criminal masterminds.', 'Hulu'),
