('Movie', 'Mud', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'August 1, 2021', 2012, 'PG-13', '131 min', 'Action, Adventure, Drama', 'After two boys discover a mysterious outlaw named Mud hiding on a deserted island in the Mississippi River, they embark on a dangerous, life-changing odyssey to reunite Mud with his long-lost love.', 'Hulu'),
