('Movie', 'Shark Tale', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'August 1, 2021', 2004, 'PG', '90 min', 'Action, Adventure, Comedy', 'A young fish''s false reputation as a ''shark slayer'' earns him fame...and gets him fitted for cement fins in this animated tale.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'Some Kind of Wonderful', NULL, NULL, 'United States', 'August 1, 2021', 1987, 'PG-13', '95 min', 'Comedy, Romance', 'A young tomboy, Watts (Mary Stuart Masterson), discovers that her feelings for her best friend, Keith (Eric Stoltz), run deeper than just friendship when he gets a date with Amanda (Lea Thompson), the most popular girl in school. Amanda''s ex, Hardy (Craig Scheffer), who is from the rich section of town, is unable to let go of her, and plans to get back at Keith.', 'Hulu'),
