('Movie', 'I Declare War', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'July 15, 2021', 2014, NULL, '94 min', 'Action, Adventure, Comedy', 'A group of friends play an innocent game of Capture the Flag, arming themselves with nothing more than sticks & their imagination. One day the game takes on a more serious tone as their imaginations take them beyond the rules of the game.', 'Hulu'),
