('Movie', 'Red Dawn', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'May 19, 2021', 2012, 'PG-13', '93 min', 'Action, Adventure', 'The city of Spokane, Washington is awakened by a North Korean paratrooper invasion. Marine Corps veteran Jed Eckert and his civilian brother, Matt, unite with their friends to form a guerrilla resistance group to drive the invaders from their home.', 'Hulu'),
