('Movie', 'Mosquita y Mari', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'May 15, 2021', 2012, NULL, '85 min', 'Drama, LGBTQ+, Romance', 'This touching coming of age tale follows a pair of Latina teens in Southeast Los Angeles – straight A student Mosquita and struggling tough girl Mari – who begin studying together, then gradually fall in love.', 'Hulu'),
('TV Show', 'Pride', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'May 15, 2021', 2021, 'TV-MA', '1 Season', 'Documentaries, LGBTQ+', '“PRIDE” is a six-part documentary series chronicling the struggle for LGBTQ+ civil rights in America from the 1950s through the 2000s. Six renowned LGBTQ+ directors explore heroic and heartbreaking stories that define us as a nation. The limited series spans the FBI surveillance of homosexuals during the 1950s Lavender Scare to the “Culture Wars” of the 1990s and beyond, exploring the queer legacy of the Civil Rights movement and the battle over marriage equality. The evolution of trans rights and identities through the decades is charted through interviews and archival footage of pioneers including Christine Jorgensen, Flawless Sabrina, Ceyenne Doroshow, Susan Stryker, Kate Bornstein, Dean Spade and Raquel Willis.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'Reaching for the Moon', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'May 15, 2021', 2013, NULL, '114 min', 'Documentaries, Drama, LGBTQ+', 'A chronicle of the complicated love affair between Pulitzer Prize-winning American poet (and lesbian) Elizabeth Bishop and acclaimed Brazilian architect Lota de Macedo Soares.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'The Mountain Between Us', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'May 15, 2021', 2017, 'PG-13', '112 min', 'Adventure, Drama, Romance', 'Two strangers embark on a harrowing journey across the wilderness after their plane crashes in a remote mountain area.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'Tru Love', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'May 15, 2021', 2013, NULL, '88 min', 'Drama, LGBTQ+, Romance', 'Tru is a serial bed-hopping lesbian who cannot commit to a relationship or a job. Then she meets Alice, a beautiful widow and her good friend’s mother. Tru and Alice strike up an unlikely relationship.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'UFC 262', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'May 15, 2021', 2021, NULL, NULL, 'Sports', 'UFC 262', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'United States of LaLiga', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'May 15, 2021', 2019, NULL, NULL, 'Sports', 'A showcase of unique stories about LaLiga fans across North America.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'MLK/FBI', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'May 14, 2021', 2020, NULL, '106 min', 'Black Stories, Documentaries', 'Based on recently declassified files, Oscar-nominated filmmaker Sam Pollard explores the US government''s surveillance and harassment of Martin Luther King, Jr.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'Saint Maud', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'May 13, 2021', 2019, 'R', '85 min', 'Horror', 'A newly devout hospice nurse, becomes obsessed with saving her dying patient''s soul - but sinister forces, and her own sinful past, threaten to put an end to her holy calling.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'Some Kind of Heaven', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'May 13, 2021', 2020, NULL, '83 min', 'Documentaries', 'Behind the gates of a palm tree-lined fantasyland, four residents of America’s largest retirement community – The Villages, FL – strive to find happiness and meaning.', 'Hulu'),
('TV Show', 'The Crime of the Century', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'May 11, 2021', 2021, NULL, '1 Season', 'Documentaries', 'Alex Gibney explores the origins, extent and fallout of America''s opioid epidemic in this riveting two-part documentary.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'Robot & Frank', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'May 9, 2021', 2012, 'PG-13', '89 min', 'Comedy, Drama, Science Fiction', 'Set in the near future, Robot & Franke is a buddy caper about an elderly ex-jewel thief and his new caretaker robot.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'Little Fish', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'May 7, 2021', 2020, NULL, '101 min', 'Drama, Romance, Science Fiction', 'As a memory loss virus runs rampant, one couple fights to hold their relationship together before the disease can erase all memory of their love in this sweeping sci-fi romance.', 'Hulu'),
('TV Show', 'Eyewitness to a Pandemic', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'May 6, 2021', 2020, NULL, '1 Season', 'Documentaries', 'The horror of the COVID-19 pandemic blazed a devastating path around the world, but in the United States, the lethal destructiveness of COVID-19 would first visit New York City. Eyewitness News tells the story in the way that only New York''s No. 1 News can in our docuseries, Eyewitness to a Pandemic. Eyewitness News reporter Jim Dolan offers an unflinching look at exactly what happened to New York and its people, at how they bravely faced menace and death, and at how they are marching forward into an uncertain new world, familiar yet full of risk.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'Looking For Lady Day', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'May 6, 2021', 2021, NULL, NULL, 'Documentaries', 'The Legend is wrong: Billie Holiday is neither from Baltimore nor Harlem, but Philadelphia, and throughout her life the city continued to draw her back. Its vibrant jazz scene was a refuge for her, first as a star and then when she was forced out of the spotlight of New York. But it was also the site of some her greatest hardship and humiliation, a place where she was hounded by the law, arrested repeatedly, and sentenced to prison in a trial that made headlines. 6abc’s Tamala Edwards brings Billie and her hometown jazz mecca to life. See the clubs where Lady Day performed, the stages where she sang, the places she lived, and learn why one song – Billie Holiday’s signature tune – brought the wrath of racist lawmen down on her, leaving her with few places where she could feel safe, and few people to trust. Looking for Lady Day: the complicated relationship a genius jazz legend had with the city where she was born.', 'Hulu'),
('TV Show', 'Total Recall(ed): The Story of America''s Largest, Wildest Recall Election', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'May 6, 2021', 2021, NULL, '1 Season', 'Documentaries', 'In 2003, Gray Davis became the first California governor to ever face a recall election. Outrage over an electricity crisis and a car tax fueled the grassroots movement, which quickly transformed into a larger than life political circus led by ''The Terminator'' Arnold Schwarzenegger. A whopping 134 other candidates jumped into the race including media mogul Arianna Huffington, actor Gary Coleman, Hustler magazine’s Larry Flynt, adult film star Mary Carey, and college student Daniel Watts, who ran using money he won on ‘Wheel of Fortune.’ In just 10 wild weeks, Schwarzenegger overcame accusations of sexual misconduct and political inexperience to power his way to the top of the pack – ultimately ousting Davis to take on the biggest role of his life: California Governor. For the first time together, key players explain how this one-of-a-kind political moment unfolded. Hear from former Governor Gray Davis, former Lt. Governor Cruz Bustamante, recall petition founder Ted Costa, citizen candidates Mary Carey and Daniel Watts, former San Francisco Mayor Willie Brown, Schwarzenegger''s communications director Rob Stutzman, Gray Davis''s press secretary Steve Maviglio, historian Barry Bradford, and journalist Phil Matier.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'Shadow in the Cloud', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'May 5, 2021', 2020, 'R', '83 min', 'Action, Adventure, Horror', 'A female WWII pilot traveling with top secret documents on a B-17 Flying Fortress encounters an evil presence on board the flight.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'Skyfall', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'May 5, 2021', 2012, 'PG-13', '143 min', 'Action, Adventure, Thriller', 'Bond''s loyalty to M is tested as her past comes back to haunt her. As MI6 comes under attack, 007 must track down and destroy the threat, no matter how personal the cost.', 'Hulu'),
('TV Show', 'Deadly Women', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'May 4, 2021', 2013, 'TV-14', '6 Seasons', 'Crime, Documentaries, Drama', 'Deadly Women investigates the motives and M.O.''s of female murderers. Two experts sift forensic fact from fanciful fiction. Former FBI agent Candice DeLong offers insight into the psychology of female killers, while Dr. Janis Amatuzio, a forensic pathologist, provides commentary on the evidence that Deadly Women leave behind.', 'Hulu'),
('TV Show', 'Homicide Hunter', NULL, NULL, 'United States', 'May 4, 2021', 2013, 'TV-14', '7 Seasons', 'Crime, Documentaries', 'Murder changes everything for those left in the wake of the crime, but what about the investigator who solves the heinous crime? Meet Lieutenant Joe Kenda, a 23-year veteran of the Colorado Springs Police Department who reveals the vivid memories of the most disturbing murders that still haunt him to this today.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'Love Sarah', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'May 4, 2021', 2020, NULL, '98 min', 'Comedy, Romance', 'A young woman wishes to fulfill her mother''s dream of opening her own bakery in Notting Hill, London. To do this, she enlists the help of an old friend and her grandma.', 'Hulu'),
('TV Show', 'Naked and Afraid', NULL, NULL, 'United States', 'May 4, 2021', 2013, 'TV-14', '2 Seasons', 'Adventure, Documentaries, Reality', 'Strangers find themselves stranded in some of the world’s most remote areas with no water, no tools – and no clothes.', 'Hulu'),
('TV Show', 'Pikwik Pack', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'May 4, 2021', 2020, 'TV-Y', '1 Season', 'Adventure, Kids', 'Suki the hedgehog, Axel the raccoon, Tibor the hippo and Hazel the cat deliver magical packages filled with love to the kind citizens of Pikwik. Every day, a new surprise package arrives. The team might face rough rapids, stormy skies, or a foggy forest, but when they work together, they always deliver! Each delivery is chock-full of big adventures, silly hijinks, and heartfelt charm that will entertain while underscoring the value of community, responsibility and teamwork.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'The Legend of Baron To''a', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'May 3, 2021', 2020, NULL, '106 min', 'Action, Comedy', 'When his late father’s championship belt is stolen by a ruthless gang, a displaced Tongan man must defeat the kingpin and get the title back.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'Flight', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'May 2, 2021', 2012, 'TV-MA', '139 min', 'Black Stories, Drama, Family', 'A veteran pilot makes a miraculous landing after a mechanical malfunction sends his plane hurtling toward the ground, but an investigation into the incident reveals that he was drunk at the time.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'An Elephant''s Journey', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'May 1, 2021', 2017, 'PG', '90 min', 'Adventure, Drama', 'While living in Africa with his aunt (Elizabeth Hurley), a teen boy (Sam Ashe Arnold) teams up with a huge, friendly elephant to take down a dangerous gang of local poachers.', 'Hulu'),
('TV Show', 'Are You the One?', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'May 1, 2021', 2014, 'TV-14', '3 Seasons', 'Reality, Romance', 'If your perfect match was standing right in front of you, would you even know it? In the most ambitious dating experiment ever attempted, that question will be answered as contestants compete in a series of challenges designed to test the intelligence of their heart. "Are You The One" begins by selecting 10 beautiful single women from across the US. Using the most extensive matchmaking process ever seen, 10 men will be found and perfectly matched for these women. But the results aren''t revealed to them. Now all 20 people are living together in Hawaii where they share one objective: Find their perfect match. Each week, the group will follow their hearts and lock in a choice of who they think is their perfect match. If all 20 people find their perfect match within 10 tries, they''ll all split $1 MILLION!', 'Hulu'),
('TV Show', 'Bad Girls Club', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'May 1, 2021', 2006, 'TV-14', '4 Seasons', 'Comedy, Reality', 'From Bunim-Murray, the producers of "The Real World" comes Oxygen''s reality series, The Bad Girls Club. These women have issues with anger, trust and control, and claim they want to change. Will living together help them move forward and turn their lives around – or will chaos rule?', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'Blast From the Past', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'May 1, 2021', 1999, 'PG-13', '112 min', 'Comedy, Romance', 'After 35 years in a fallout shelter, naive man/child Brendan Fraser comically emerges into the modern world in this comedy.', 'Hulu'),
('TV Show', 'Blind Date', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'May 1, 2021', 2019, 'TV-14', '1 Season', 'Comedy, Reality, Romance', 'In the age of social media where preconceived notions dominate and dating apps thrive on a swipe left or right, hopeful singles looking to form a true connection – or perhaps just any connection – take the ultimate plunge when they embark on a blind date.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'Blue Chips', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'May 1, 2021', 1994, 'PG-13', '108 min', 'Drama, Sports', 'A College b-ball coach on the verge of his first losing season recruits several talented players, but when the players make financial requests, the coach gives in to the demands. His team is winning again but the decisions he made tears him apart.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'Bound', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'May 1, 2021', 1996, 'R', '109 min', 'Crime, Drama, LGBTQ+', 'The lesbian romance between a newly-released ex-con, and the girlfriend of a Mafia money-launderer, has a mercenary dynamic. The girls plan to walk off with a suitcase of $2 million cash, but the Mafioso finds out a little too soon.', 'Hulu'),
('TV Show', 'Dating: No Filter', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'May 1, 2021', 2019, 'TV-14', '2 Seasons', 'Comedy, Reality, Romance', 'Comedians watch singles as they go on dates, providing unfiltered commentary on all the shock and awe that you the viewer are already thinking. The funny, the cringe-worthy and the brutally honest. Welcome to Dating: No Filter.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'Dr. Bird''s Advice for Sad Poets', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'May 1, 2021', 2021, 'R', '109 min', 'Comedy, Drama', 'In the emotionally charged, wild and humorous world of sixteen year old James Whitman, we see his struggle to overcome anxiety and depression by seeking advice from Dr. Bird - an imaginary pigeon therapist - in the wake of his sister''s disappearance.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'Grudge Match', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'May 1, 2021', 2013, 'PG-13', '113 min', 'Comedy', 'Bitter former boxing rivals Robert De Niro and Sylvester Stallone step into the ring as senior citizens to settle a 30-year-old score.', 'Hulu'),
('TV Show', 'I Am Cait', NULL, NULL, 'United States', 'May 1, 2021', 2015, 'TV-14', '2 Seasons', 'Documentaries, Drama, LGBTQ+', 'Living for the first time as the person she feels she was born to be, the docu-series will also explore what Cait''s transition means for the people in her life.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'I Love You Phillip Morris', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'May 1, 2021', 2010, 'R', '98 min', 'Comedy, Drama, LGBTQ+', 'Jim Carrey shines as a man who comes out of the closet, goes on a spree as a con man and later finds love in prison.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'Junior', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'May 1, 2021', 1994, 'PG-13', '110 min', 'Comedy, Romance', 'A male fertility research scientist decides to test the latest drug on himself - and becomes the world''s first pregnant man! With Emma Thompson, Frank Langella.', 'Hulu'),
('TV Show', 'Married to Medicine', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'May 1, 2021', 2013, 'TV-14', '6 Seasons', 'Reality, Romance', 'The docu-series, which takes viewers inside the fast-paced and drama-filled social scene of Atlanta''s exclusive medical inner circle. The series follows the lives of six successful women, including doctors and wives of doctors, as they juggle their careers, family and social calendars.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'Resident Evil: Apocalypse', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'May 1, 2021', 2004, 'R', '94 min', 'Action, Adventure, Horror', 'Alice is in Horrorland – again – in this bloody sequel that pits the lovely heroine against another army of flesh-eating zombies.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'Resident Evil: Extinction', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'May 1, 2021', 2007, 'R', '94 min', 'Action, Adventure, Horror', 'Alice fights the Umbrella Corporation and their plan to replace humankind with a race of undead clones.', 'Hulu'),
('TV Show', 'Shahs of Sunset', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'May 1, 2021', 2012, 'TV-14', '6 Seasons', 'Reality, Romance', 'Shahs of Sunset follows a group of friends who are trying to juggle their active social lives and up-and-coming careers while balancing the demands of their families and traditions. These passionate socialites are fervent on the dating and party scene, but seeking approval from their family they face pressures to settle down and marry within the community. From outings on Rodeo Drive to traditional Persian feasts at home, this series celebrates the unique lifestyle of a group of friends who have worked har', 'Hulu'),
('TV Show', 'Texicanas', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'May 1, 2021', 2019, 'TV-14', '1 Season', 'Reality', 'The series follows a stylish group of San Antonio sophisticates as they try to balance their social lives and the demands of raising a family. But, it''s their shared experience of facing the ongoing challenges of American culture, while still finding ways to honor their heritage and traditions that bonds these ladies with a connection that runs deeper than friendship.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'The Age of Adaline', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'May 1, 2021', 2015, 'PG-13', '113 min', 'Drama, Romance, Science Fiction', 'Blake Lively and Harrison Ford star in this stirring romantic drama about a 29-year-old woman who has stopped aging - and the timeless power of love.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'The Indian in the Cupboard', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'May 1, 2021', 1995, 'PG', '96 min', 'Drama, Family, Kids', 'A little boy''s world changes when he''s given a small cupboard with a key that brings a small toy Indian to life.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'The Jackal', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'May 1, 2021', 1997, 'R', '124 min', 'Action, Adventure, Drama', 'The FBI races to stop professional assassin Bruce Willis who has his deadly sights set on a U.S. government official in this thriller.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'We Were Soldiers', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'May 1, 2021', 2002, 'R', '139 min', 'Action, Adventure, Drama', 'Mel Gibson stars in this powerful epic chronicling the 1965 Battle of Ia Drang in the early days of America''s involvement in Vietnam.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'The Judge', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'April 30, 2021', 2014, 'R', '142 min', 'Crime, Drama', 'Hotshot lawyer Robert Downey Jr. must confront his strained relationship with his father – a local judge – upon his return home.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'The Night', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'April 30, 2021', 2020, NULL, '105 min', 'Horror, Thriller', 'A couple becomes trapped in a hotel with their demons – real and imagined – until they can confront the secrets in their marriage in this mind-bending supernatural thriller.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'Presidential Address to Congress and the Nation and the Republican Response', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'April 29, 2021', 2021, NULL, NULL, 'News', 'President Joe Biden addresses the joint session of Congress and the nation.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'Arrival', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'April 28, 2021', 2016, 'PG-13', '116 min', 'Drama, Horror, Science Fiction', 'When mysterious spacecraft touch down across the globe, an elite team - led by expert translator Louise Banks (Academy Award® nominee Amy Adams) – races against time to decipher their intent.', 'Hulu'),
('TV Show', 'The Handmaid''s Tale', NULL, NULL, 'United States', 'April 28, 2021', 2017, 'TV-MA', '4 Seasons', 'Drama, Science Fiction', 'EMMY® NOMINATED A woman forced into sexual servitude struggles to survive in a terrifying, totalitarian society.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'Sesame Street: 50 Years of Sunny Days', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'April 27, 2021', 2021, 'TV-14', NULL, 'Documentaries, News', 'Highlighting the 50-year impact of the iconic series and the nonprofit behind it, Sesame Workshop; featured guests include W. Kamau Bell, Gloria Estefan, Dr. Anthony Fauci, Whoopi Goldberg, Christopher Jackson, John Legend, Lucy Liu and Olivia Munn.', 'Hulu'),
('TV Show', 'Exposure', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'April 26, 2021', 2021, NULL, '1 Season', 'Lifestyle & Culture, Reality', '8 photographers. 1 shot at the ultimate exposure. Exposure is a competition series where contestants compete for a photography gig that could change one of their lives forever. They’ll put their creativity - and their emotions - on the line in a series of challenges that cover every aspect of phone photography - from art and food to sports and music. It’s time to take your best shot.', 'Hulu'),
('TV Show', 'Una Familia Moderna', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'April 25, 2021', 2014, NULL, '11 Seasons', 'Comedy, Latino, Sitcom', 'Una Familia Moderna es una serie cómica que muestra a tres familias diferentes a través de la lente de un documentalista y su equipo. Jay Pritchett (Ed O’Neill) es el patriarca de esta familia moderna complicada, desorganizada y amorosa.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'Wild Mountain Thyme', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'April 25, 2021', 2020, 'PG-13', '102 min', 'Comedy, Romance', 'Rosemary has her heart set on winning Anthony’s affections. Having been stung by his father’s plan to sell his farm in Ireland to his American nephew, Anthony is jolted into pursuing his dreams.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'UFC 261: Early Prelims and Prelims', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'April 24, 2021', 2021, NULL, NULL, 'Sports', 'UFC 261: Early Prelims and Prelims', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'Billie', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'April 23, 2021', 2019, NULL, '98 min', 'Black Stories, Documentaries, Music', 'Billie Holiday had one of the greatest voices of all time. This film chronicles her amazing story featuring remastered performances and interviews from musical greats.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'Better Days', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'April 22, 2021', 2019, 'PG', '136 min', 'Drama', 'The relentlessly bullied Nian finds solace in petty criminal Bei while preparing for her college entrance exam. Before they can run off together, they are pulled into a murder investigation, altering their lives forever.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'Breaking Fast', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'April 22, 2021', 2020, NULL, '92 min', 'Comedy, Drama, LGBTQ+', 'Mo, a practicing Muslim living in West Hollywood, is learning to navigate life post heartbreak. Enter Kal, an All-American guy who surprises Mo by offering to break fast with him during the holy month of Ramadan.', 'Hulu'),
('TV Show', 'Greta Thunberg: A Year to Change the World', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'April 22, 2021', 2021, 'TV-PG', '1 Season', 'Documentaries', 'Follow climate activist Greta Thunberg as she takes a year off school to explore the science of global warming and challenge world leaders, calling for action on climate change.', 'Hulu'),
('TV Show', 'Cruel Summer', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'April 21, 2021', 2021, 'TV-14', '1 Season', 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'From the executive producer, Jessica Biel, comes the chilling story of one girl, Kate Wallis, who goes missing. And another girl, Jeanette Turner, who mysteriously takes over her life. Told over 3 summers in the 90s, Cruel Summer will leave you torn between who to believe and what ‘the truth’ even looks like. Because the deeper you go in this mystery, the darker it gets. In this twisted tale, the truth is how you see it.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'It''s Not Too Late: Earth Day Special', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'April 20, 2021', 2021, NULL, NULL, 'News', 'A journey across the globe with ABC News Chief Meteorologist Ginger Zee focused on what the world can do this Earth Day to help slow the climate emergency – through a series of unique interviews and exclusive access, Ginger shows it never is too late to make a difference.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'Memories of Murder', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'April 20, 2021', 2003, 'TV-MA', '131 min', 'Crime, Drama, Horror', 'From director Bong Joon-ho (THE HOST) comes this tense psychological crime thriller based on the actual case of a serial killer.', 'Hulu'),
('TV Show', 'More in Common', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'April 20, 2021', 2020, 'TV-G', '1 Season', 'News', 'Inspiring stories of Americans who come together despite their differences.', 'Hulu'),
('TV Show', 'Sasquatch', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'April 20, 2021', 2021, NULL, '1 Season', 'Documentaries', 'SASQUATCH is a true crime doc series following investigative journalist David Holthouse as he attempts to solve a bizarre twenty-five year old triple homicide that was said to be the work of a mythical creature.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'Set the Record Straight: The Jam Master Jay Case', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'April 19, 2021', 2021, NULL, NULL, 'Crime, Documentaries, Music', 'The case of the the 2002 unsolved murder of RUN DMC’s Jam Master Jay stayed cold for nearly two decades. Now, new developments in the story uncovered by Journalist Darla Miles examines the complicated legacy of a rap pioneer and leverages exclusive archival video to reveal new details and seek justice for friends, family, fans and an entire community.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'The Lynching of Henry ‘Peg’ Gilbert', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'April 19, 2021', 2020, NULL, NULL, 'Documentaries', 'Henry ‘Peg’ Gilbert was sitting in church one evening in 1947 when, about 100 yards away, a calf wandered into the road. This would lead to a sequence of events that seemingly had nothing to do with Gilbert, or with his surprising success for a Black farmer in rural Georgia in the 1940s, but it would eventually end in his lynching. The Lynching of Henry ‘Peg’ Gilbert tells the story of a man whose unjust death resonates as much today as it did 70 years ago. Gilbert’s story was uncovered by researchers at the Northeastern University school of Law, who proved that he was beaten, tortured and lynched in a jail cell, all under the supervision of local law enforcement.', 'Hulu'),
('TV Show', 'Confronting a Serial Killer', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'April 18, 2021', 2021, 'TV-MA', '1 Season', 'Crime, Documentaries', 'The astonishing story of the unprecedented relationship between acclaimed author and journalist Jillian Lauren and the most prolific serial killer in American history, Sam Little.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'Modern Persuasion', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'April 17, 2021', 2020, NULL, '87 min', 'Romance', 'A single woman focused on her career in New York is forced to deal with the aftermath of a failed relationship when an ex-boyfriend hires her company.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'Sister of the Groom', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'April 17, 2021', 2020, 'R', '92 min', 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Alicia Silverstone (Clueless) and Tom Everett Scott (That Thing You Do) star in a destination wedding weekend gone off the rails.', 'Hulu'),
('TV Show', 'The New Electric Company', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'April 17, 2021', 2009, 'TV-Y', '3 Seasons', 'Family, Kids', 'Plug in to the power of the Electric Company and follow the continuing adventures of four friends with unique "literacy superpowers" as they foil the mischievous efforts of some tricky neighborhood Pranksters.', 'Hulu'),
('TV Show', 'Celebrity Best Home Cook', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'April 16, 2021', 2021, NULL, '1 Season', 'Cooking & Food, Lifestyle & Culture, Reality', 'Mary Berry, Dan Doherty and Chris Bavin search for the nation''s best home cook.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'Fly Like a Girl', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'April 16, 2021', 2020, NULL, '85 min', 'Documentaries', 'Fly Like A Girl is more than just a film. It’s a movement of young girls and women relentlessly pursuing their passion for aviation. A field currently dominated by men.
INSERT INTO `streaming_titles` (`type`, `title`, `director`, `cast`, `country`, `date_added`, `release_year`, `rating`, `duration`, `listed_in`, `description`, `streaming site`) VALUES
('Movie', 'Grand Isle', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'March 15, 2021', 2019, 'TV-MA', '97 min', 'Action, Thriller', 'Walter (Nicolas Cage) and his neglected wife lure a young man into their Victorian home to escape a hurricane. When the man is charged with murder by Det. Jones (Kelsey Grammar), he must reveal the couple''s wicked secrets to save himself.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'H. H. Holmes: Original Evil', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'March 15, 2021', 2018, NULL, '65 min', 'Documentaries, Drama', 'In the world of evil and deranged serial killers, there is no equal. Meet the Dark Lord of a murder castle who killed roughly 200 people in a self-made house of horrors who may have also been the notorious Jack the Ripper.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'Intersect', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'March 15, 2021', 2020, NULL, '119 min', 'Science Fiction, Thriller', 'A group of young Miskatonic University scientists invent a time machine, only to learn that they are being manipulated by mysterious, unseen forces from another dimension.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'Missing 411: The Hunted', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'March 15, 2021', 2019, NULL, '97 min', 'Documentaries', 'Hunters have disappeared from wildlands without a trace for hundreds of years. David Paulides presents the haunting true stories of hunters experiencing the unexplainable in the woods of North America.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'Naughty Books', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'March 15, 2021', 2020, NULL, '82 min', 'Documentaries', 'Come into the world of erotic fiction and meet the authors who made millions by transforming their fantasies into fiction.', 'Hulu'),
('TV Show', 'People of Earth', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'March 15, 2021', 2016, 'TV-MA', '2 Seasons', 'Comedy, Science Fiction, Sitcom', 'People of Earth is an American comedy television series created by David Jenkins about a support group for alien abductees.', 'Hulu'),
('TV Show', 'Roadies', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'March 15, 2021', 2016, 'TV-MA', '1 Season', 'Comedy, Drama, Music', 'Created by Oscar winner Cameron Crowe, ROADIES is an insider''s look at the reckless, romantic, funny and often poignant lives of a committed group of roadies, who live for music and the defacto family they''ve formed along the way.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'Robert the Bruce', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'March 15, 2021', 2019, 'TV-MA', '123 min', 'Drama, History', 'King Robert the Bruce is injured and on the run from the English army. On the brink of defeat, a widow and her family nurse him back to health and join The Bruce as he sets out to claim the long-awaited freedom of Scotland.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'Sister Aimee', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'March 15, 2021', 2019, NULL, '88 min', 'Comedy, LGBTQ+', 'America’s most famous evangelist is a woman looking for a way out. Fed up with her own success, and swept up in her lover’s daydreams about Mexico, she finds herself on a wild road trip to the border. Based on true events. Mostly made up.', 'Hulu'),
('TV Show', 'Terminator: The Sarah Connor Chronicles', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'March 15, 2021', 2008, 'TV-14', '2 Seasons', 'Action, Adventure, Drama', 'At the end of "Terminator 2: Judgment Day," Sarah vanquished the Terminator sent from the future to kill her teenage son, John. Sarah and John now find themselves alone in a very dangerous, complicated world. Fugitives from the law, they are confronted with the reality that still more enemies from the future, and the present, could attack at any moment. The Sarah Connor Chronicles reveals what happens when Sarah (Lena Headey) stops running and goes on the offensive against an ever-evolving technological enemy bent on destroying her life, and perhaps the world. Her son, 15-year-old John Connor (Thomas Dekker), knows that he may be the future savior of mankind, but is not yet ready to take on the mantle of leadership that he''s told is his destiny. John finds himself inextricably drawn to Cameron (Summer Glau), an enigmatic and otherworldly student at his high school, who soon proves to be much more than his confidante. She assumes the role of Sarah and John''s fearless protector. On their trail are not only threats from the future, but an intelligent and tough FBI agent, James Ellison (Richard T. Jones), who soon becomes a powerful ally.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'The Man Who Killed Don Quixote', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'March 15, 2021', 2018, 'TV-MA', '133 min', 'Adventure, Comedy', 'Toby (Adam Driver) enters a world of time jumping fantasy when he meets "Don Quixote" (Jonathan Pryce), a delusional Spanish cobbler who believes Toby to be Sancho Panza. They embark on an epic adventure where dreams and reality intertwine.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'The Stand: How One Gesture Shook the World', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'March 15, 2021', 2020, NULL, '70 min', 'Documentaries', 'The Stand: How One Gesture Shook the World explores the motives behind Tommie Smith and John Carlos''s gesture of defiance during the 1968 Olympics and the consequences.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'Blood and Money', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'March 14, 2021', 2020, 'TV-MA', '89 min', 'Action, Thriller', 'A retired veteran (Tom Berenger) hunting in the Allagash backcountry discovers a dead woman with a duffle bag full of money. He soon finds himself in a web of deceit and murder.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'Buddy Games', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'March 14, 2021', 2020, 'R', '97 min', 'Comedy', 'Josh Duhamel (in his directorial debut) stars as the leader of a group of lifelong friends who reunite for the ultimate bro-fest contest in this rowdy, star-studded comedy.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', '32 Seconds: A Deadly Night in Rome', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'March 12, 2021', 2020, NULL, NULL, 'Crime', 'In an emotionally charged ABC7 Originals documentary, Investigative Journalist Dan Noyes breaks dramatic new information about the killing of an Italian police officer in Rome, during an altercation with two young men from the San Francisco Bay Area.   This one-hour program details events that lead to the international murder case.  See key evidence and exclusive interviews with both suspects'' parents, as their sons await trial in an Italian prison.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'Farewell Amor', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'March 12, 2021', 2020, NULL, '102 min', 'Black Stories, Drama', 'Reunited after 17 years apart, an Angolan immigrant welcomes his wife and daughter into his tiny Brooklyn apartment. Now strangers, they find common ground in their shared love of dance.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'I Met a Girl', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'March 12, 2021', 2020, NULL, '108 min', 'Drama, Romance', 'An aspiring musician meets Lucy, and falls madly in love. However, when she suddenly vanishes, he impulsively embarks on an epic journey to find her. Meanwhile Nick, who thinks that Lucy is all in Devon’s head, sets off to rescue him.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'Kid 90', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'March 12, 2021', 2021, 'TV-MA', '72 min', 'Documentaries, Drama', 'As a teenager in the ‘90s, Soleil Moon Frye carried a video camera everywhere she went, documenting her friends as they grew up in Hollywood and New York City. Kid 90 explores how sometimes we need to look back to find our way forward.', 'Hulu'),
('TV Show', 'Black Death', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'March 11, 2021', 2021, NULL, '1 Season', 'Comedy', 'Behold the dark tales of medieval times, where life is grim, absurd and humiliating! In other words, seriously relatable.', 'Hulu'),
('TV Show', 'Game of Talents', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'March 11, 2021', 2021, 'TV-PG', '1 Season', 'Reality', 'Combining the awe, wonder and spectacle of a large-scale variety show with a clue-centered, high-intensity investigative game, "Game of Talents" is a new hybrid series. The series pits two teams of contestants against each other as they attempt to figure out the surprising – and sometimes bizarre – hidden talents of the mystery performers. With more than $200,000 on the line, it''s up to the contestants to identify unique skills, including fire dancing, spider wrangling, chainsaw juggling and contortion. Wayne Brady hosts.', 'Hulu'),
('TV Show', 'My So-Called Life', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'March 11, 2021', 1994, 'TV-14', '1 Season', 'Drama, Teen', 'MSCL follows Angela Chase, a neurotic, touching and funny 15-year-old as she chronicles the ever-present trials and tribulations of adolescence. No matter the fixation, Angela finds extraordinary drama within ordinary situations as she navigates discovering who she is and where she belongs.', 'Hulu'),
('TV Show', 'The Split', NULL, NULL, 'United Kingdom', 'March 11, 2021', 2018, 'TV-MA', '2 Seasons', 'Drama, International, Romance', '''The Split'' explores modern marriage and the legacy of divorce seen through the lens of the Defoes.', 'Hulu'),
('TV Show', 'Heartland', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'March 10, 2021', 2007, 'TV-PG', '13 Seasons', 'Drama, Family, International', 'Adapted from Lauren Brooke’s best-selling novels, this compelling family drama follows life on the Heartland ranch as sisters Amy and Lou, together with their grandfather Jack, deal with the challenges of running a ranch that has been in the family for generations.', 'Hulu'),
('TV Show', 'Absolutely Ascot', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'March 9, 2021', 2018, NULL, '2 Seasons', 'Reality', 'Big characters, extravagant lifestyles, tumultuous love-lives... Famous for its racecourse, million-pound homes and buzzing nightlife, this series follows Ascot''s most glamorous residents across one busy summer season. Featuring a cast of wealthy and impossibly attractive millennials, there are tearful heart-to-hearts and full-on dramas as reputations are made and broken, flirtations become romances and lifelong friendships fall apart.', 'Hulu'),
