('Movie', 'Proxima', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'March 7, 2021', 2019, NULL, '108 min', 'Action, Drama, Thriller', 'Sarah is an astronaut and lives alone with her daughter. When she is chosen to be part of a space mission, it creates chaos in their relationship.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'Storks', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'March 6, 2021', 2016, 'PG', '87 min', 'Adventure, Cartoons, Comedy', 'A delivery stork cooks up trouble for himself and a pal in the form of a bouncing baby girl in this animated family hit.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'Triggered', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'March 6, 2021', 2020, NULL, '94 min', 'Thriller', 'After a night of partying, nine friends wake up with suicide bombs strapped to their chests with varying timed countdown clocks, soon discovering they can ''take'' another''s time by killing each other.', 'Hulu'),
