('Movie', 'Beirut', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'March 5, 2021', 2018, 'R', '109 min', 'Drama, Thriller', 'In 1980s Beirut, Mason Skiles is a former U.S. diplomat who returns to service to save a colleague from the group that is possibly responsible for his own family''s death.', 'Hulu'),
