('TV Show', 'Jersey Shore: Family Vacation', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'February 26, 2021', 2018, 'TV-14', '2 Seasons', 'Reality', 'The gang kicks it off by heading to Las Vegas. After partying through Sin City, they head back to the East Coast, celebrating milestones in Atlantic City – and settle in for an extended summer stay at the Shore, reliving their glory days together.', 'Hulu'),
