('TV Show', 'The Secret of Skinwalker Ranch', NULL, NULL, 'United States', 'February 15, 2021', 2020, 'TV-PG', '1 Season', 'Documentaries, Science Fiction', 'For the first time ever, HISTORY is gaining full, unprecedented access to one of the most infamous and secretive hotspots of paranormal and UFO-related activities on earth, Skinwalker Ranch.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'The Shape of Water', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'February 15, 2021', 2017, 'R', '123 min', 'Drama, Romance, Science Fiction', 'When a mute cleaning woman at a Cold War-era high-security government facility discovers a top-secret experiment, she finds her lonely world opening up as she bonds with a mysterious amphibious humanoid.', 'Hulu'),
('TV Show', 'The UnXplained', NULL, NULL, 'United States', 'February 15, 2021', 2019, 'TV-14', '2 Seasons', 'Documentaries', 'The UnXplained explores the world’s most fascinating, strange and inexplicable mysteries. Hosted by Golden Globe & Emmy Award-winning actor William Shatner (Star Trek, Boston Legal) each episode will feature compelling contributions from scientists, historians, witnesses and experiencers – each seeking to shed light on how the seemingly impossible actually can happen.', 'Hulu'),
('TV Show', 'Witches of Salem', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'February 15, 2021', 2019, 'TV-14', '1 Season', 'Drama, History', 'Dark, atmospheric re-enactments and expert interviews explore the mass hysteria that led to the infamous witch trials in Salem, Massachusetts.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'Crshd', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'February 14, 2021', 2019, NULL, '81 min', 'Comedy', 'On the last night of her college freshman year, Izzy tries to lose her virginity with the help of her two best friends––but their only hope is getting into an exclusive, invite-only “Crush Party.”', 'Hulu'),
('TV Show', 'Men in Kilts: A Roadtrip with Sam and Graham', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'February 14, 2021', 2021, NULL, '1 Season', 'Documentaries, Lifestyle & Culture', 'Sam and Graham take viewers along on their adventures, discovering the rich, complex heritage of their native country, meeting local artisans and experts, and experiencing genuine moments of awe and fascination.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'A Conversation Between Black Men', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'February 13, 2021', 2021, NULL, NULL, 'News', 'This hour-long special features candid discussions between Black men on how the past year has affected them. Hosted by “GMA3: What You Need to Know” co-anchor T.J. Holmes, the conversation covers a wide range of topics from the pandemic and the racial strife that gripped America this past summer to the election and seeing Kamala Harris take the oath to be Vice President. ABC News Contributors Mike Muse and LZ Granderson and entrepreneur Paul Welch join Holmes as they discuss 2020 and what they hope to see in the future.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'Havana Street Party Presents: Beatriz Luengo', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'February 13, 2021', 2021, 'TV-PG', NULL, 'Documentaries, Music, News', 'Spanish singer Beatriz Luengo performs hits from her latest album "Cuerpo & Alma" in this special show full of Cuban music and flavor.', 'Hulu'),
('TV Show', 'Hip Hop Uncovered', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'February 13, 2021', 2021, 'TV-MA', '1 Season', 'Black Stories, Documentaries, Music', 'Hip Hop Uncovered reveals the untold story of how America’s streets helped shape hip hop culture from an expression of survival and defiance into music’s most dominant genre. The documentary series takes a deep dive into the paradox of America’s criminalization of the genre and its fascination with the street culture that created it and still exists within it.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', '2067', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'February 12, 2021', 2020, NULL, '114 min', 'Science Fiction, Thriller', 'In 2067, humanity is forced to live on artificial oxygen and is slowly dying. Ethan Whyte must travel to the future to a cure and save the world.', 'Hulu'),
('TV Show', 'Line of Duty', NULL, NULL, 'United Kingdom', 'February 12, 2021', 2012, 'TV-MA', '5 Seasons', 'Crime, Drama, International', 'Set in the fictional police anti-corruption unit AC-12, “Line of Duty” is a cat-and-mouse thriller that takes a probing look into modern policing and corruption. The British drama features an all-star cast including Keeley Hawes, Vicky McClure, Martin Compston, Adrian Dunbar, Lennie James, Neil Morrissey and Gina McKee.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'Tentacles', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'February 12, 2021', 2021, 'TV-MA', '84 min', 'Horror', 'TENTACLES is a psychosexual horror-thriller about a young Los Angeles couple Tara (Dana Drori) and Sam (Casey Deidrick) who fall head over heels into a new romance, entwining their lives – until their intimacy transforms into something terrifying.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'You''re Next', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'February 12, 2021', 2011, 'R', '95 min', 'Horror, Thriller', 'Aubrey and Paul decide to celebrate their wedding anniversary with their family by inviting them to a reunion, but everything goes awry when their home comes under siege by a mask-wearing team of crossbow-bearing assailants.', 'Hulu'),
('TV Show', 'Black Love', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'February 11, 2021', 2017, 'TV-14', '3 Seasons', 'Black Stories, Documentaries, Romance', 'BLACK LOVE is a docuseries created by newlywed filmmakers to highlight love stories from the Black community and answer the question, “What does it take to make a marriage work?” Couples featured have been married anywhere from 1 to 70 years and are from all walks of life. Black Love pulls back the curtain on how love begins and the reality of life-long love, offering proof that it can happen for everyone, but it isn’t a cakewalk. The show shares jaw dropping, sometimes cringe-worthy, other times utterly magical, always-true love stories.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'Then Came You', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'February 11, 2021', 2020, 'PG-13', '98 min', 'Comedy, Romance', 'A lonely widow plans a trip around the world with her husband''s ashes, to visit the places they loved in the movies. The first stop on the journey changes her life forever.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'OnlyFans: Selling Sexy', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'February 10, 2021', 2021, NULL, NULL, 'News', 'ABC News Originals documentary, “OnlyFans: Selling Sexy,” examines the voyeuristic and profit-making world of the online platform OnlyFans.', 'Hulu'),
('TV Show', 'Moesha', NULL, NULL, 'United States', 'February 9, 2021', 1996, 'TV-PG', '6 Seasons', 'Black Stories, Comedy, Sitcom', 'Navigating the twists and firsts of being a teen, Moesha juggles friendships, romance and the occasional drama while trying to keep her family together.', 'Hulu'),
('TV Show', 'Sister, Sister', NULL, NULL, 'United States', 'February 9, 2021', 1994, 'TV-G', '6 Seasons', 'Black Stories, Comedy, Sitcom', 'Tia Landry and Tamera Campbell are twins separated at birth who learn of each other''s existence and come together as teenagers.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'Harrow', NULL, NULL, 'United States, Australia', 'February 8, 2021', 2018, '3 Seasons', NULL, 'Crime, Drama, International', 'Daniel Harrow is a brilliant forensic pathologist who solves the cases others can''t. When a secret from his past threatens his career and his family, he''ll need all his wit and forensic genius to keep a crime buried forever.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'Beach Rats', NULL, NULL, 'United States', 'February 6, 2021', 2018, 'R', '98 min', 'Drama, LGBTQ+', 'BEACH RATS follows a teenage Frankie (Harris Dickinson) on the outer edges of Brooklyn as he struggles to reconcile his competing sexual desires, leaving him hurtling towards irreparable consequences.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'Antebellum', NULL, NULL, 'United States', 'February 5, 2021', 2020, 'R', '106 min', 'Black Stories, Thriller', 'A successful author is plunged into a horrifying reality that forces her to confront her past, present, and future in this tense thriller from visionary filmmakers Bush + Renz, and the producer of Get Out and Us.', 'Hulu'),
('TV Show', 'Black Stories Presents: Your Attention Please', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'February 5, 2021', 2020, NULL, '2 Seasons', 'Black Stories, Documentaries', 'Hosted by Craig Robinson, this three-part series explores nine Black voices who are part of the next generation of excellence. Join us as we embark on this visual journey.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'Dear Comrades!', NULL, NULL, 'Russia', 'February 5, 2021', 2020, '121 min', NULL, 'Drama, History', 'When the communist government raises food prices in 1962, the rebellious workers from the small industrial town of Novocherkassk go on strike. The massacre which then ensues is seen through the eyes of a devout party activist.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', '12 Hour Shift', NULL, NULL, 'United States', 'February 4, 2021', 2020, '88 min', NULL, 'Comedy, Horror, Thriller', 'It’s 1998, and over the course of one 12-hour shift at an Arkansas hospital, a junkie nurse, her scheming cousin, and a group of black market organ-trading criminals start a heist that could lead to their collective demise.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'Kindred', NULL, NULL, 'United Kingdom', 'February 4, 2021', 2020, '101 min', NULL, 'Horror, Thriller', 'A chilling tale of one young woman slowly losing her grip on reality...or is she being brainwashed and psychologically tortured by her deceased boyfriend''s family?', 'Hulu'),
('TV Show', 'Modern Family', NULL, NULL, 'United States', 'February 4, 2021', 2009, 'TV-14', '11 Seasons', 'Comedy, Family, Sitcom', 'Today''s American families come in all shapes and sizes. The cookie cutter mold of man + wife + 2.5 kids is a thing of the past, as it becomes quickly apparent in the bird''s eye view of ABC''s half-hour comedy, which takes an honest and often hilarious look at the composition and complexity of modern family life.', 'Hulu'),
('TV Show', 'Our America: Living While Black', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'February 3, 2021', 2020, NULL, '1 Season', 'Black Stories, Documentaries', 'ABC Owned Television Stations present personal stories that go beyond the statistics to explore life in America as present-day challenges ignite change for a better future.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'Good Morning America', NULL, NULL, 'United States', 'February 2, 2021', 1975, '1 Season', NULL, 'News', 'The Emmy-winning morning news program featuring anchors George Stephanopoulos, Robin Roberts, Lara Spencer, Amy Robach and Ginger Zee.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'The School That Tried to End Racism', NULL, NULL, 'United Kingdom', 'February 2, 2021', 2020, '1 Season', NULL, 'Documentaries', 'New series following a pioneering British school as it tries to help its students uncover and eradicate hidden racial biases.', 'Hulu'),
('TV Show', 'Baldwin Hills', NULL, NULL, 'United States', 'February 1, 2021', 2007, 'TV-14', '3 Seasons', 'Black Stories, Drama, Reality', 'BET’s reality docu-drama will explore the lives of 11 upper middle class African American teens as they grow up in BALDWIN HILLS, an upscale black neighborhood in Los Angeles where athletes, television and film stars, doctors and lawyers reside.', 'Hulu'),
('TV Show', 'Being Mary Jane', NULL, NULL, 'United States', 'February 1, 2021', 2013, 'TV-14', '5 Seasons', 'Drama', 'BEING MARY JANE is BET''s first one-hour drama brought to us by the creator of "Girlfriends" and "The Game." The series focuses on the life of SNC news anchor, Mary Jane Paul. She seems to have it all, yet something is missing.', 'Hulu'),
('TV Show', 'Black Ink Crew', NULL, NULL, 'United States', 'February 1, 2021', 2013, 'TV-14', '3 Seasons', 'Reality', 'In the heart of Harlem, Black Ink is the only black-owned and operated tattoo parlor as well as one of the most famous in the country. Black Ink owner, and noted hardass, Ceaser employs some close, and very vocal friends that make up the "Crew."', 'Hulu'),
('TV Show', 'College Hill', NULL, NULL, 'United States', 'February 1, 2021', 2007, 'TV-14', '3 Seasons', 'Reality', 'Series follows the lives of eight university students as they live, learn, love, laugh, and experience life as young adults together under one roof.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'Hello, My Name Is Doris', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'February 1, 2021', 2015, 'R', '90 min', 'Comedy, Drama', 'A self-help seminar inspires a sixty-something woman to romantically pursue her younger co-worker.', 'Hulu'),
('TV Show', 'Love & Hip Hop Atlanta', NULL, NULL, 'United States', 'February 1, 2021', 2013, 'TV-14', '3 Seasons', 'Music, Reality', 'Love and Hip Hop: Atlanta has returned for a second season! Back in the Dirty South, Atlanta is the new frontier in entertainment where the opportunity to make it big in the rap game is always one hustle away.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'Possessor', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'February 1, 2021', 2020, 'R', '104 min', 'Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Using brain-implant technology, an elite corporate assassin takes control of other people’s bodies to execute high-profile targets. As she sinks deeper into her latest assignment, Vos becomes trapped inside a mind that threatens to obliterate her.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'The Game', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'February 1, 2021', 2021, NULL, NULL, 'Sports', 'The exhilarating highs and lows of a professional soccer match, all from the watchful perspective of a referee at the very heart of the action.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'The Haunting in Connecticut', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'February 1, 2021', 2009, 'PG-13', '103 min', 'Drama, Horror, Thriller', 'In this supernatural thriller, the Campbell family''s move to Connecticut takes a mysteriously dark turn when a series of shocking paranormal events reveals that their inviting new home is a former mortuary with a sordid past. Based on a true story.', 'Hulu'),
('TV Show', 'The Lady And The Dale', NULL, NULL, 'United States', 'February 1, 2021', 2021, 'TV-14', '1 Season', 'Documentaries', 'This documentary series explores an audacious 1970s auto scam centered around a mysterious entrepreneur.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'You Laugh But It''s True', NULL, NULL, 'United States, South Africa', 'February 1, 2021', 2011, '83 min', NULL, 'Comedy, Documentaries, Drama', 'In the world of stand-up comedy in South Africa, Trevor Noah uses his experiences during Apartheid to prepare for the biggest show of his life.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'The Undefeated', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'January 30, 2021', 2017, 'TV-G', NULL, 'Sports', 'The Undefeated explores sports, style and culture.', 'Hulu'),
('TV Show', 'Jann', NULL, NULL, 'Canada', 'January 29, 2021', 2019, 'TV-PG', '2 Seasons', 'Comedy', '"In JANN, Jann Arden plays a fictionalized, self-deprecating version
INSERT INTO `streaming_titles` (`type`, `title`, `director`, `cast`, `country`, `date_added`, `release_year`, `rating`, `duration`, `listed_in`, `description`, `streaming site`) VALUES
('TV Show', 'The Apartment (TV)', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'September 24, 2020', 2018, NULL, '2 Seasons', 'Lifestyle & Culture', 'Twelve aspiring designers from around the world compete over ten intense episodes to win a brand new luxury home. In this high stakes competition, the budding designers are mentored by designer to the stars, Jamie Durie and their fate is decided by the Dark Prince of Design, Laurence Llewelyn Bowen. High Drama, Amazing Designs and a beautiful cast will keep viewers at the edge of their seats.', 'Hulu'),
('TV Show', 'Cosmos: Possible Worlds', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'September 23, 2020', 2020, NULL, '1 Season', 'Documentaries, Science & Technology', 'A wonder-filled voyage to the lost worlds and worlds yet to come revealed by science.', 'Hulu'),
('TV Show', 'If Loving You Is Wrong', NULL, NULL, 'United States', 'September 23, 2020', 2014, 'TV-MA', '5 Seasons', 'Black Stories, Drama, Romance', 'Couples and friends in a middle-class community are the focus of this drama series by Tyler Perry. While it may seem typical, below the surface lie heartbreak and deceit, threatening everybody''s well-being. Residents include married Randal and Marcie; she desperately wants children; he''s having an affair with Alex, the wife of best friend Brad. Elsewhere in the neighborhood, divorced Esperanza pursues a budding relationship with Julius while keeping it secret from her vindictive ex, Edward.', 'Hulu'),
('TV Show', 'Boonie Bears: Spring into Action', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'September 22, 2020', 2018, 'TV-G', '1 Season', 'Adventure, Family, Kids', 'Spring is in the air and the forest animals are planting fresh trees and flowers to celebrate. However, when Logger Vick comes around and threatens to chop down every tree in the forest, it will take the Bear Brothers - Briar and Bramble - to rally their forest friends and save their home.', 'Hulu'),
('TV Show', 'Filthy Rich', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'September 22, 2020', 2020, 'TV-14', '1 Season', 'Drama', 'A Southern Gothic family drama in which wealth, power and religion intersect – more correctly, collide – with outrageously soapy results. Meet the Monreauxes, a mega-rich Southern family famed for creating a successful Christian television network. On the cusp of launching a digital retail arm of the company, the family''s patriarch, Eugene, dies in a plane crash, leaving his wife, Margaret, to take charge of the family business. Not surprisingly, Eugene''s apparent death greatly impacts the family, who are stunned to learn that Eugene fathered three illegitimate children, all of whom are written into his will. Now, Margaret must use her business savvy and Southern charm to control her newly legitimized heirs, whose very existence threatens the Monreaux family name and fortune.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'The Addams Family', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'September 22, 2020', 2019, 'PG', '87 min', 'Comedy, Kids', 'Members of the mysterious and spooky Addams family – Gomez, Morticia, Pugsley, Wednesday, Uncle Fester and Grandma – are readily preparing for a visit from their even creepier relatives. But trouble soon arises when shady TV personality Margaux Needler realizes that the Addams'' eerie hilltop mansion is standing in the way of her dream to sell all the houses in the neighborhood.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'ESPN FC', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'September 21, 2020', 2013, NULL, NULL, 'Sports', 'Highlights, news, reactions and opinions from the day in soccer.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'Stars and Strife', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'September 21, 2020', 2020, 'TV-PG', NULL, 'Documentaries', 'As America faces the horrific coronavirus epidemic, what long-term effects will the virus have on the country''s political and social landscape?', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'The Haunted', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'September 20, 2020', 2018, NULL, '75 min', 'Horror, Thriller', 'Emily arrives for her first night-shift as a care-giver in an isolated house. A nightmare unfolds as she is tormented by a vengeful spirit.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'Babyteeth', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'September 18, 2020', 2019, NULL, '118 min', 'Comedy, Drama', 'A terminally ill teen upsets her parents when she falls in love with a small-time drug dealer.', 'Hulu'),
('TV Show', 'Bless the Harts', NULL, NULL, 'United States', 'September 18, 2020', 2019, 'TV-14', '2 Seasons', 'Adult Animation, Comedy, Sitcom', 'The Harts are a Southern family that is forever struggling to make ends meet. They hope to achieve the American dream, but they''re already rich – in friends, family and laughter. Jenny Hart is a single mother supporting her family working as a waitress in the small town of Greenpoint, N.C. While Jenny''s the head of her family, she''s often at odds with, or scheming with, her lottery scratcher-obsessed mother, Betty, and her witty, creative daughter, Violet. Jenny''s doting, eternal optimist boyfriend of 10 years, Wayne Edwards, is the love of her life and a surrogate father to Violet. He''s a charming dreamer who may never hit the big time, but he''s not going to give up the fight. In the end, the Harts may not have much, but they may just have everything they need.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'Buttons: A Christmas Tale', NULL, NULL, 'United States', 'September 18, 2020', 2018, 'PG', '88 min', 'Drama, Family, Kids', 'With a little help from their guardian angels, two orphan girls discover miracles really can happen.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'Gemini Man', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'September 18, 2020', 2019, 'PG-13', '117 min', 'Action, Adventure, Black Stories', 'Henry Brogan is an elite 51-year-old assassin who''s ready to call it quits after completing his 72nd job. His plans get turned upside down when he becomes the target of a mysterious operative who can seemingly predict his every move. To his horror, Brogan soon learns that the man who''s trying to kill him is a younger, faster, cloned version of himself.', 'Hulu'),
('TV Show', 'Sherman''s Showcase', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'September 18, 2020', 2019, 'TV-MA', '2 Seasons', 'Black Stories, Comedy', 'Travel through time via music and comedy drawn from the library of this musical variety show.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'StarDog and TurboCat', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'September 18, 2020', 2019, 'PG', '91 min', 'Action, Adventure, Comedy', 'When genius cat, Felix, and loyal canine, Buddy, set out to find Buddy’s lost owner, they discover not only the power of friendship but their inner superpowers along the way.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'The Fight', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'September 18, 2020', 2020, 'PG-13', '98 min', 'Documentaries', 'At a defining moment in American history, a scrappy team of heroic ACLU lawyers battles for abortion rights, immigrant rights, LGBTQ rights and voting rights.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'The Master of Disguise', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'September 18, 2020', 2002, 'PG', '81 min', 'Comedy, Family, Kids', 'Dana Carvey co-stars with Dana Carvey, Dana Carvey, and in his screen debut, Dana Carvey, taking on many different identities and a multitude of different languages, proving once and for all that he is The Master of Disguise.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'My Soul to Take', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'September 16, 2020', 2010, 'R', '91 min', 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'A serial killer returns to his hometown to stalk seven children who share the same birthday as the date he was allegedly put to rest.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'A.C.O.R.N.S: Operation Crack Down', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'September 15, 2020', 2015, NULL, '80 min', 'Comedy, Family, Kids', 'Frankie, a smooth-talking squirrel finds out that the acorns are being stolen by the evil A.C.O.R.N.S. Corporation. Now he must assemble a rag-tag team of forest animals with only three days to pull-off their biggest heist.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'Ozzy', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'September 15, 2020', 2016, 'G', '91 min', 'Action, Adventure, Comedy', 'The lovable Ozzy’s pampered life is thrown into turmoil after his family drops him at Blue Creek before their vacation. Ozzy quickly learns that Blue Creek is a dog prison and he’ll need to rely on some new friends to help him break out and get back home.', 'Hulu'),
('TV Show', 'The 3 Knockdown Rule', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'September 15, 2020', 2020, NULL, '1 Season', 'Documentaries, Sports', 'TV personality & boxing aficionado Mario Lopez and ESPN journalist Steve Kim bring their popular “The 3 Knockdown Rule” podcast to the screen, with thoughtful insights, healthy debate, and special guests from the world of boxing.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'The Etruscan Smile', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'September 14, 2020', 2018, 'R', '108 min', 'Drama', 'A rugged old Scotsman leaves his beloved isolated Hebridean island and travels to San Francisco to seek medical treatment where he reunites with his estranged son and new grandson.', 'Hulu'),
('TV Show', 'Pororo the Little Penguin', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'September 12, 2020', 2013, NULL, '5 Seasons', 'International, Kids', 'Far far away, unknown and untouched by human civilization, lies a peaceful land covered in snow and ice. All of our friends have distinct personalities and different interests, which sometimes cause little happenings in their calm white world. But they are all good friends and know how to help each other in times of trouble.', 'Hulu'),
('TV Show', 'Bin Laden''s Hard Drive', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'September 11, 2020', 2020, 'TV-14', '1 Season', 'Documentaries', 'Newly declassified hard drives reveal a groundbreaking look at Osama bin Laden''s personal life.', 'Hulu'),
('TV Show', 'Pop Goes the Vet', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'September 11, 2020', 2020, 'TV-PG', '1 Season', 'Documentaries, Science & Technology', 'If viewers have never seen a hairless rat with a pustule on its neck, or a plump fair pig with an abscess on its rump, they are in for a treat as some of National Geographic''s most renowned and beloved vets work to drain some of the worst abscesses they have ever seen. From the office to the field, no pustule or abscess will go undrained.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'Prisoners', NULL, NULL, 'United States', 'September 10, 2020', 2013, 'R', '153 min', 'Crime, Drama, Horror', 'The abduction of two children prompts father Hugh Jackman to take matters into his own hands in this harrowing thriller.', 'Hulu'),
('TV Show', 'Woke', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'September 9, 2020', 2020, 'TV-MA', '1 Season', 'Black Stories, Comedy', 'Inspired by the life and work of artist Keith Knight, comedy series WOKE takes an absurdly irreverent look at identity and culture as it follows Keef, an African-American cartoonist finally on the verge of mainstream success when an unexpected incident changes everything. With a fresh outlook on the world around him, Keef must now navigate the new voices and ideas that confront and challenge him, all without setting aflame everything he’s already built.', 'Hulu'),
('TV Show', 'This is How U Hulu', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'September 8, 2020', 2019, NULL, '2 Seasons', 'Science & Technology', 'Get your green on with these lessons and tips to make the most of your Hulu experience.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'Awoken', NULL, NULL, 'Australia', 'September 6, 2020', 2019, '88 min', NULL, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'A young medical student tries to cure her brother of a terminal sleeping illness.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'Power Book II: Ghost', NULL, NULL, 'United States', 'September 6, 2020', 2020, '1 Season', NULL, 'Crime, Drama', 'Power Book II: Ghost picks up shortly after the earth-shattering events of Power as Tariq St. Patrick grapples with a new world order: his father dead and his mother, Tasha, facing charges for the murder her son committed.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'Hooking Up', NULL, NULL, 'United States', 'September 4, 2020', 2020, 'R', '105 min', 'Comedy, Drama', 'A cynical writer and a hopeless romantic hit the road for a cross-country trip.', 'Hulu'),
('TV Show', 'Vacation In Place', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'September 4, 2020', 2020, NULL, '1 Season', 'Lifestyle & Culture', 'Can’t get away these days? Let these immersive, relaxing scenes take you to some of the most beautiful places around. Choose from lakes, beaches, rolling hills, and endless skies … Take your pick and have a mini-vacay from wherever you are .', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'First Day', NULL, NULL, 'Australia', 'September 3, 2020', 2020, '1 Season', NULL, 'Family, International, Kids', 'It’s Hannah Bradford’s first year of high school. As a transgender girl, Hannah not only has to navigate the challenges that come with starting a new school, but find the courage to live as her most authentic self.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'Anthropoid', NULL, NULL, 'Czech Republic, United Kingdom, United States, France', 'September 2, 2020', 2016, 'R', '121 min', 'Action, Adventure, Drama', 'Based on the extraordinary true story of Operation Anthropoid, the WWII mission to assassinate SS General Reinhard Heydrich, the main architect behind the Final Solution and the Reich’s third in command after Hitler and Himmler.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'Hell on the Border', NULL, NULL, 'United States', 'September 2, 2020', 2019, 'R', '110 min', 'Action, Adventure', 'Inspired by the incredible true story of Bass Reeves, the first black deputy US marshal. In order to become a lawman, Bass accepts an assignment that no other marshal will take: eliminating Bob Dozier, the most dangerous outlaw in the Indian Territory.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'I Feel Pretty', NULL, NULL, 'China, United States', 'September 1, 2020', 2018, 'PG-13', '111 min', 'Comedy', 'A woman wakes up from a fall believing she is the prettiest woman on earth.', 'Hulu'),
('TV Show', 'Mike Tyson Mysteries', NULL, NULL, 'United States', 'September 1, 2020', 2014, 'TV-14', '4 Seasons', 'Adult Animation, Comedy', 'In Mike Tyson Mysteries, a new half-hour animated adult comedy series from Warner Bros. Animation, Mike Tyson is taking the fight from the boxing ring to the streets … by solving mysteries! The series also features the voices of Norm Macdonald (SNL, Norm), Rachel Ramras (The Looney Tunes Show) and Oscar® winner Jim Rash (Community).', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'Mississippi Burning', NULL, NULL, 'United States', 'September 1, 2020', 1989, 'R', '127 min', 'Classics, Crime, Drama', 'When three civil rights workers disappear in 1964 Mississippi, two FBI agents with wildly divergent styles resort to increasingly violent tactics to apprehend the culprit Ku Klux Klan. Crucial to the case is the testimony of a beautician.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'Playmobil: The Movie', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'September 1, 2020', 2019, 'PG', '100 min', 'Action, Adventure, Comedy', 'A young woman travels to the animated world of Playmobil to find her missing brother.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'Rambo', NULL, NULL, 'Germany, United States, Thailand', 'September 1, 2020', 2008, 'R', '91 min', 'Action, Adventure', 'Sylvester Stallone returns to the iconic character of John Rambo in this action sequel that finds the middle-aged veteran living quietly in Thailand as a mechanic and snake wrangler - until a group of American missionaries are caught up in the bloody Burmese civil war raging nearby and reach out to the reluctant killing machine for rescue. Julie Benz, Paul Schulze and Ken Howard costar in this long-awaited follow-up.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'Strike', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'September 1, 2020', 2018, 'TV-G', '101 min', 'Action, Adventure, Comedy', 'A young mole must try to achieve his dream of becoming a footballer in order to save his hometown gold mine from a greedy super villain.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'The Festival', NULL, NULL, 'United Kingdom', 'September 1, 2020', 2018, 'R', '98 min', 'Comedy', 'After his girlfriend dumps him at graduation, a young man thinks his life is over. His best friend has the perfect solution: three days at a giant music festival.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'Trolls World Tour', NULL, NULL, 'United States', 'September 1, 2020', 2020, 'PG', '91 min', 'Action, Adventure, Comedy', 'When the kingdom is invaded by Rock Trolls, Queen Poppy (Anna Kendrick) and Branch (Justin Timberlake) embark on an epic quest to find the harmony that will save them all.', 'Hulu'),
('TV Show', 'I''ll Be Gone In The Dark', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'August 31, 2020', 2019, 'TV-MA', '1 Season', 'Crime, Documentaries, Mystery', 'Documentary series based on Michelle McNamara’s account of the 1970s and 1980s serial killer dubbed "The Golden State Killer."', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'Primal', NULL, NULL, 'United States', 'August 31, 2020', 2019, 'R', '97 min', 'Action', 'Hunter and collector Frank Walsh expects a big payday after bagging a priceless white jaguar for a zoo. But the ship bearing Frank''s precious cargo has another predator – a political assassin facing extradition to America. When the prisoner manages to break free, Walsh must utilize his expert skills to capture the dangerous killer – not dead, but alive.', 'Hulu'),
