('Movie', 'The Gallows Act II', NULL, NULL, 'United States', 'June 30, 2020', 2019, 'R', '100 min', 'Horror, Thriller', 'While pursuing her dreams of stardom, a teenage actress is drawn into the dark world of a malevolent spirit in this supernatural thriller from Blumhouse, the producer of Paranormal Activity, Insidious and The Gallows.', 'Hulu'),
