('Movie', 'Autonomy', NULL, NULL, 'United States', 'May 20, 2020', 2019, '80 min', NULL, 'Documentaries', 'Acclaimed author, Malcolm Gladwell, leads this feature documentary about the emerging technology of self-driving vehicles and the big questions they raise: what is control and who do we become as we relinquish it to machines?', 'Hulu'),
