('Movie', 'Let the Right One In', NULL, NULL, 'Sweden', 'April 8, 2020', 2008, 'R', '115 min', 'Drama, Horror, International', 'Lonely, 12-year-old Oskar is regularly bullied by his stronger classmates.  A new friendship develops when Eli, a pale, serious young girl who only comes out at night, moves in next door.', 'Hulu'),
