('TV Show', 'Behind the Mask', NULL, NULL, 'United States', 'February 26, 2015', 2013, 'TV-14', '2 Seasons', 'Documentaries, Sports', '"Behind the Mask" dives into the colorful, unusual side of sports through the eyes of four mascots.', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'The Other Man', NULL, NULL, 'United Kingdom, United States', 'February 3, 2015', 2008, 'R', '88 min', 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'A taut thriller, The Other Man is an intimate tale of a man who discovers his wife''s infidelity and sets out to track down his rival. Driven to pursue the mystery surrounding his wife’s adultery, Liam Neeson embarks on a global pursuit with a haunted passion that begins to probe the nature not simply of jealousy, but of loss and forgiveness. The film is beautifully shot on location in Milan and Lake Como as well as in London and Ely by renowned cinematographer Harris Zambarloukos (Mama Mia!, Heart in the Sand.)', 'Hulu'),
('Movie', 'The Resident', NULL, NULL, 'United Kingdom, United States', 'February 3, 2015', 2012, 'R', '91 min', 'Drama, Horror, Thriller', 'Juliet, has found the perfect New York apartment to start a new life after separating from her husband. It''s got spacious rooms, and a handsome landlord. But there are secrets behind every wall as Juliet gets the feeling that she is not alone.', 'Hulu'),
('TV Show', 'The Marvelous Misadventures of Flapjack', NULL, NULL, 'United States', 'February 1, 2015', 2008, 'TV-Y7', '3 Seasons', 'Adventure, Cartoons, Kids', 'Oh buoy! Set a course for misadventure! Take a trip to the bizarre sea village of Stormalong Harbor with a kooky kid named Flapjack and his very best friends - a crusty old pirate called Captain K''nuckles, and a wise-talking whale, Bubbie, whose mouth they call home sweet home.', 'Hulu'),
('TV Show', '.hack//Roots', NULL, NULL, 'Japan', 'January 30, 2015', 2006, 'TV-14', '1 Season', 'Action, Adventure, Anime', 'In the online RPG know as "The World," Haseo and his guild mates are on the search for a legendary item. When a rival team challenges them, the conflict has deep repercussions both inside and outside the game, and threatens to change the players forever.', 'Hulu'),
('TV Show', 'Stone Quackers', NULL, NULL, 'United States', 'January 24, 2015', 2015, 'TV-MA', '1 Season', 'Adult Animation, Comedy', 'Stone Quackers will shock, it will disturb, it will provoke. Executive produced by acclaimed actor John C. Reilly and renowned artist/creator Ben Jones, the duck denizens of Cheeseburger Island endure hardships ranging from hurricanes, severed heads to dangerous hot dogs and the shame of being alive. The show is based on the upbringing of Whit Thomas and Clay Tatum (from the lauded live show PowerViolence) and their experience living in the remote and strange city of Gulf Shores, Alabama. Actress/writer, Heather Lawless (The Heart, She Holler) also stars as John C. Reilly’s angelic yet deviant paramour. Guest stars include Pam Adlon (Louie, Californiacation), Rory Scovel (Ground Floor) and Budd Anthony Diaz (PowerViolence) with music from The Zombies, Lightning Bolt, and The Doobie Brothers.', 'Hulu'),
('TV Show', 'Death Parade', NULL, NULL, 'Japan', 'January 16, 2015', 2015, 'TV-MA', '1 Season', 'Anime, Drama, International', 'There is a place after death that''s neither heaven nor hell. A bar that serves you one chance to win. You cannot leave until the game is over, and when it is, your life may be too.', 'Hulu'),
